["color"] = {
["b"] = -0,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "You loot 15 Gold, 12 Silver, 70 Copper",
["id"] = "s28_2890",
["timestamp"] = 1773630395,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Starphage-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: A good kill, Starphage. And I rescued all that were still alive. But why did Muro'jin bring them here?",
["id"] = "s28_2891",
["timestamp"] = 1773630396,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Starphage-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: De kidnapping won't stop until we get to de root of de evil. Follow me.",
["id"] = "s28_2892",
["timestamp"] = 1773630404,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Starphage-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: That... not be natural. And the energy flowing into it... This is hex magic.",
["id"] = "s28_2893",
["timestamp"] = 1773630418,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Starphage-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: Using the souls of de dead in powerful magic spells... I hope this is not why they brought my kin here.",
["id"] = "s28_2894",
["timestamp"] = 1773630426,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Starphage-Tichondrius",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Rokh'zal",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Rokh'zal yells: You cannot stop de ritual! Spirits, rise!",
["id"] = "s28_2895",
["timestamp"] = 1773630428,
},
