s: The opposition includes some of Gnomeregan's finest... although they've all seen better days. It's the leper gnome quintet!\",\"timestamp\":1765464063,\"id\":\"s17_2580\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bizmo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Bizmo yells: Keep 'em comin', Gingiboi.\",\"id\":\"s17_2581\",\"timestamp\":1765464903},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|Hcurrency:1299:0|h[Brawler's Gold]|h|rx1\",\"id\":\"s17_2582\",\"timestamp\":1765464904},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Brawl Enthusiast\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Brawl Enthusiast yells: I LOSE? NO YOU LOSE!\",\"id\":\"s17_2583\",\"timestamp\":1765464909},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bizmo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Bizmo yells: Look out... here comes the deadly Rank 6 void elf, Keyss!\",\"id\":\"s17_2584\",\"timestamp\":1765464919},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Max Megablast\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Max Megablast yells: GG Engineering is gonna mop the floor with your sorry mug!\",\"id\":\"s17_2585\",\"timestamp\":1765464923},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bo Bobble\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"c