e item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:250130::::::::80:62::14::1:28:633:::::|h[Tirisgarde Candle]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s17_3019\",\"timestamp\":1765988666},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:250132::::::::80:62::14::1:28:633:::::|h[Tirisgarde Brazier]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s17_3020\",\"timestamp\":1765988667},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:250239::::::::80:62::14::1:28:633:::::|h[Tirisgarde Banner]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s17_3021\",\"timestamp\":1765988669},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Overlord Geya'rah\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Overlord Geya'rah says: Your people have broken their word, Trollbane.\",\"timestamp\":1765989553,\"id\":\"s17_3022\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Danath Trollbane\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Danath Trollbane says: I understand your frustration, Geya'rah. But do not rush to conclusions.\",\"timestamp\":1765989556,\"id\":\"s17_3023\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Skitter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Skitter says: Uplander! Hello! You have shinnies, yes?\",\"timestamp\":1765989559,\"id\":\"s17_3024\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Andee Seabraid\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Andee Seabraid says: We have many shinnies. What are you after?\",\"timestamp\":1765989563,\"id\":\"s17_3025\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Skitter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Skitter says: Ropes, hooks, and maps!\",\"timestamp\":1765989567,\"id\":\"s17_3026\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Andee Seabraid\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Andee Seabraid says: I have rope and hooks, but I don't have any maps of Khaz Algar.\",\"timestamp\":1765989570,\"id\":\"s17_3027\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Andee Seabraid\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Andee Seabraid says: I have maps of Azeroth, but you probably don't wa--\",\"timestamp\":1765989575,\"id\":\"s17_3028\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Skitter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Skitter says: You have maps of big world? I want maps of big world!\",\"timestamp\":1765989580,\"id\":\"s17_3029\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Andee Seabraid\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Andee Seabraid says: Okay then. Rope, hooks, maps. Anything else?\",\"timestamp\":1765989584,\"id\":\"s17_3030\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:1166:0|h[Timewarped Badge]|h|rx930\",\"id\":\"s17_3031\",\"timestamp\":1766176333},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"|cnNORMAL_FONT_COLOR:Stormclout|r |cnHIGHLIGHT_FONT_COLOR:transferred |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:1166:930|h[Timewarped Badge]|h|rx930 to|r |cnNORMAL_FONT_COLOR:Ofpuss.|r\",\"id\":\"s17_3032\",\"timestamp\":1766176333},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rhonin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rhonin yells: Citizens of Dalaran! Raise your eyes to the skies and observe!\",\"id\":\"s17_3033\",\"timestamp\":1766176429},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rhonin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rhonin yells: Today our world's destruction has been averted in defiance of our very makers!\",\"id\":\"s17_3034\",\"timestamp\":1766176437},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rhonin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rhonin yells: Algalon the Observer, herald of the titans, has been defeated by our brave comrades in the depths of the titan city of Ulduar.\",\"id\":\"s17_3035\",\"timestamp\":1766176446},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rhonin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rhonin yells: Algalon was sent here to judge the fate of our world.\",\"id\":\"s17_3036\",\"timestamp\":1766176454},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rhonin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rhonin yells: He found a planet whose races had deviated from the titans' blueprints. A planet where not everything had gone according to plan.\",\"id\":\"s17_3037\",\"timestamp\":1766176460},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rhonin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rhonin yells: Cold logic deemed our world not worth saving. Cold logic, however, does not account for the power of free will. It's up to each of us to prove this is a world worth saving.\",\"id\":\"s17_3038\",\"timestamp\":1766176469},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Chatty Contender\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Chatty Contender says: Did you hear Bizmo's Brawlpub is back in business?\",\"timestamp\":1766588416,\"id\":\"s17_3039\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ve'nari\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ve'nari says: That Xy Cartel has lost control of the docks. I need someone competent to sort it out for them.\",\"timestamp\":1766588431,\"id\":\"s17_3040\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Om'rajula\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Om'rajula says: This antique transmogrifier was damaged in transit. See if you can repair it.\",\"timestamp\":1766588504,\"id\":\"s17_3041\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: You're not Adarus. I suppose I shouldn't be surprised.\",\"timestamp\":1766588567,\"id\":\"s17_3042\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:239074::::::::80:269::11::1:28:3008:::::|h[Void Lure]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766588568,\"id\":\"s17_3043\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: We must feed Ramon'ta on the remains of the Void Tempests that we defeat here.\",\"timestamp\":1766588570,\"id\":\"s17_3044\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: Only then will he be suffused with enough void energy to be useful for Adarus' ritual.\",\"timestamp\":1766588575,\"id\":\"s17_3045\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:238866::::::::80:269:::::::::|h[K'aresh Dust]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766588590,\"id\":\"s17_3046\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: Good. I wasn't sure if would take to the lure.\",\"timestamp\":1766588595,\"id\":\"s17_3047\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: So voracious. I can feel the void energy emanating from it.\",\"timestamp\":1766588615,\"id\":\"s17_3048\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: That's enough. I've prepared an area where we can confront this creature.\",\"timestamp\":1766588641,\"id\":\"s17_3049\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: Let's head there and get what I came for.\",\"timestamp\":1766588645,\"id\":\"s17_3050\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: When you're ready for a fight, toss a lure in the center there.\",\"timestamp\":1766588648,\"id\":\"s17_3051\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:220264::::::::80:269:::::::::|h[Jaw with Barbed Teeth]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766588668,\"id\":\"s17_3052\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: Thank you, Stormclout. I should be able to get all Void energy needed for the ritual.\",\"timestamp\":1766588670,\"id\":\"s17_3053\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: I've harvested the void essence of Ramon'ta. All we need is the appropriate vessel to store it for the ritual.\",\"timestamp\":1766588688,\"id\":\"s17_3054\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: Don't forget our pact, Adarus. Once your ritual is complete, you'll share the secrets of the illidari with us.\",\"timestamp\":1766588695,\"id\":\"s17_3055\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Adarus Duskblaze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Adarus Duskblaze says: Of course, my dark cousin.\",\"timestamp\":1766588702,\"id\":\"s17_3056\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3008:0|h[Valorstones]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1766588707,\"id\":\"s17_3057\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Adarus Duskblaze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Adarus Duskblaze says: Join us in North Sufaad immediately, Stormclout.\",\"timestamp\":1766588711,\"id\":\"s17_3058\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Adarus Duskblaze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Adarus Duskblaze says: Or miss out on your chance to be part of something greater.\",\"timestamp\":1766588715,\"id\":\"s17_3059\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1766588740,\"id\":\"s17_3060\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Adarus Duskblaze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Adarus Duskblaze says: Perfect, I can feel the energy radiating from it. How do we remove it?\",\"timestamp\":1766588754,\"id\":\"s17_3061\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: I've read about similar containments. If we find the keys, we'll be able to deactivate these devices that hold it in place.\",\"timestamp\":1766588759,\"id\":\"s17_3062\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Relictor Qunash'i\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Relictor Qunash'i says: Fool! It cannot be controlled, only contained!\",\"timestamp\":1766588827,\"id\":\"s17_3063\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:239154::::::::80:269:::::::::|h[Key of the Waning Moon]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766588830,\"id\":\"s17_3064\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Relictor Lay'sha\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Relictor Lay'sha says: Trespasser! The fragment must never be unleashed!\",\"timestamp\":1766588858,\"id\":\"s17_3065\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:239153::::::::80:269:::::::::|h[Key of the Eternal Night]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766588875,\"id\":\"s17_3066\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 2 Gold, 98 Silver, 21 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1766588876,\"id\":\"s17_3067\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1766588877,\"id\":\"s17_3068\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Relictor Efrat\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Relictor Efrat says: Your ignorance will be your doom, outlander!\",\"timestamp\":1766588886,\"id\":\"s17_3069\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:239155::::::::80:269:::::::::|h[Key of the Dark Sun]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766588890,\"id\":\"s17_3070\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Adarus Duskblaze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Adarus Duskblaze says: You're back. Good.\",\"timestamp\":1766588905,\"id\":\"s17_3071\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: I'm prepared to contain the released fragment, Stormclout. Whenever you're ready.\",\"timestamp\":1766588907,\"id\":\"s17_3072\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Adarus Duskblaze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Adarus Duskblaze says: Ah yes, there it is.\",\"timestamp\":1766588940,\"id\":\"s17_3073\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: The power in this fragment is more volatile than I predicted.\",\"timestamp\":1766588942,\"id\":\"s17_3074\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3008:0|h[Valorstones]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1766588952,\"id\":\"s17_3075\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1766588965,\"id\":\"s17_3076\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1766589048,\"id\":\"s17_3077\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ruffious\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ruffious says: Opportunity's knocking! If you've got the mettle, there are valuables waiting to be won.\",\"timestamp\":1766589072,\"id\":\"s17_3078\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:220264::::::::80:269:::::::::|h[Jaw with Barbed Teeth]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1766589146,\"id\":\"s17_3079\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:220264::::::::80:269:::::::::|h[Jaw with Barbed Teeth]|h|rx3\",\"timestamp\":1766589197,\"id\":\"s17_3080\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:238866::::::::80:269:::::::::|h[K'aresh Dust]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766589197,\"id\":\"s17_3081\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3008:0|h[Valorstones]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1766589219,\"id\":\"s17_3082\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Adarus Duskblaze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Adarus Duskblaze says: Do it.\",\"timestamp\":1766589232,\"id\":\"s17_3083\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Lëmonáde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Looks like someone has a bounty on their head. Anyone care to collect?\",\"timestamp\":1766589238,\"id\":\"s17_3084\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Adarus Duskblaze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Adarus Duskblaze says: I... I can feel it!\",\"timestamp\":1766589239,\"id\":\"s17_3085\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Adarus Duskblaze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Adarus Duskblaze says: Limitless. All futures are open to me. Within my reach!\",\"timestamp\":1766589244,\"id\":\"s17_3086\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Adarus Duskblaze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Adarus Duskblaze says: What?! Who? So many voices...whispering to me...\",\"timestamp\":1766589249,\"id\":\"s17_3087\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: Do not attempt to exert your will upon it, Adarus. Let it wash over you!\",\"timestamp\":1766589254,\"id\":\"s17_3088\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Adarus Duskblaze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Adarus Duskblaze says: No... you are weak! I can bind it to my will!\",\"timestamp\":1766589258,\"id\":\"s17_3089\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: Don't be a fool, Adarus. Listen to me!\",\"timestamp\":1766589262,\"id\":\"s17_3090\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Adarus Duskblaze\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Adarus Duskblaze says: No, I... ahhhhh!\",\"timestamp\":1766589266,\"id\":\"s17_3091\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: We need to do something!\",\"timestamp\":1766589269,\"id\":\"s17_3092\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: Quickly, Stormclout. Push him through the portal, or he'll bring this cave down around us!\",\"timestamp\":1766589277,\"id\":\"s17_3093\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3008:0|h[Valorstones]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1766589288,\"id\":\"s17_3094\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: His pride almost killed us, Stormclout.\",\"timestamp\":1766589288,\"id\":\"s17_3095\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1766589312,\"id\":\"s17_3096\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Om'rajula\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Om'rajula says: This antique transmogrifier was damaged in transit. See if you can repair it.\",\"timestamp\":1766589320,\"id\":\"s17_3097\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Leona! You're well I see! Did you learn anything from that Demon Hunter?\",\"timestamp\":1766589326,\"id\":\"s17_3098\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: We attempted to infuse Adarus with the Void. He is strong, but there were complications.\",\"timestamp\":1766589363,\"id\":\"s17_3099\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: He was partially successful. Though the backlash of energy nearly brought the cavern down on top of us.\",\"timestamp\":1766589368,\"id\":\"s17_3100\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: I see. Does he live?\",\"timestamp\":1766589375,\"id\":\"s17_3101\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: I believe so. We were forced to push him through a portal, and his current whereabouts are unknown.\",\"timestamp\":1766589378,\"id\":\"s17_3102\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: What of your experiments? Did you learn the secret of harnessing the Void in this way?\",\"timestamp\":1766589383,\"id\":\"s17_3103\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: I'm getting closer, Magister. The K'areshi fragment is inert, but intact. Given time, or a better teacher, I can master these techniques.\",\"timestamp\":1766589389,\"id\":\"s17_3104\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Good. I hope Adarus can forgive us for saving him from his own folly. You did well. Thank you for assistance in this, Stormclout.\",\"timestamp\":1766589397,\"id\":\"s17_3105\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3008:0|h[Valorstones]|h|rx15\",\"timestamp\":1766589408,\"id\":\"s17_3106\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:245730::::::::80:269::25:4:12265:6652:12244:3171:1:28:2462:::::|h[Waders of the Endless Hunger]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766589408,\"id\":\"s17_3107\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Liaeda-Mug'thol\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Liaeda-Mug'thol|h[|cffaad372Liaeda-Mug'thol|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:42739:Player-84-0613AAE3:1:12:24:25:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Sojourner of K'aresh]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1766589417,\"id\":\"s17_3108\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Neonvoid-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver says: Your attire seems adequate. How may I assist you?\",\"id\":\"s17_3109\",\"timestamp\":1766596429},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver says: Your attire seems adequate. How may I assist you?\",\"timestamp\":1766857486,\"id\":\"s17_3110\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lucille Waycrest\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lucille Waycrest says: We're running short on silver, which is crucial in our fight against the witches. Delve into the mines and gather all you can find.\",\"timestamp\":1766857960,\"id\":\"s17_3111\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Brother Therold\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Brother Therold says: Rosaline has requested more barbs. Would you mind lending a hand?\",\"timestamp\":1766857997,\"id\":\"s17_3112\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:251768::::::::80:577:::::::::|h[Darkpine Lumber]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766858074,\"id\":\"s17_3113\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:251768::::::::80:577:::::::::|h[Darkpine Lumber]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1766858085,\"id\":\"s17_3114\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Brother Pike\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Brother Pike says: K'thir practice their dark magics unimpeded aboard the Abyssal Melody. Cleanse its decks of their defilement.\",\"timestamp\":1766858093,\"id\":\"s17_3115\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Brother Pike\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Brother Pike says: The shrine must be cleansed of Lord Stormsong's evil, heroes.\",\"timestamp\":1766858118,\"id\":\"s17_3116\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Brother Pike\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Brother Pike says: Tread carefully. Some dark presence watches us even now.\",\"timestamp\":1766858124,\"id\":\"s17_3117\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Stormsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Lord Stormsong yells: How dare you sully this holy place with your presence!\",\"timestamp\":1766858158,\"id\":\"s17_3118\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:152576::::::::80:577:::::::::|h[Tidespray Linen]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766858164,\"id\":\"s17_3119\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:158874::::::::80:577:::::::::|h[Frothing Vapor]|h|rx3\",\"timestamp\":1766858164,\"id\":\"s17_3120\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:157844::::::::80:577:::::::::|h[Iridescent Speck]|h|rx11\",\"timestamp\":1766858164,\"id\":\"s17_3121\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Stormsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Lord Stormsong yells: I call upon the surging waters! Arise, and wipe out these intruders!\",\"timestamp\":1766858164,\"id\":\"s17_3122\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 8 Gold, 38 Silver, 98 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1766858165,\"id\":\"s17_3123\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:159420::::::::80:577::23:2:9024:6652:2:9:50:28:2640:::::|h[Stormsurger's Sabatons]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766858183,\"id\":\"s17_3124\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:159420::::::::80:577::23:2:9024:6652:2:9:50:28:2640:::::|h[Stormsurger's Sabatons]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766858183,\"id\":\"s17_3125\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 12 Gold, 83 Silver, 50 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1766858184,\"id\":\"s17_3126\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Brother Pike\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Brother Pike says: Stormsong has twisted this sacred place. We must press on and undo his foul work.\",\"timestamp\":1766858185,\"id\":\"s17_3127\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Brother Ironhull\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Brother Ironhull says: Welcome, Brother Pike. You have arrived just in time to witness our victory.\",\"timestamp\":1766858216,\"id\":\"s17_3128\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Galecaller Faye\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Galecaller Faye says: Once our ritual is complete, the Kul Tiran fleet will belong to Queen Azshara!\",\"timestamp\":1766858224,\"id\":\"s17_3129\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Tidesage Initiate\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Tidesage Initiate attempts to run away in fear!\",\"timestamp\":1766858228,\"id\":\"s17_3130\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Tidesage Initiate\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Tidesage Initiate attempts to run away in fear!\",\"timestamp\":1766858229,\"id\":\"s17_3131\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Brother Pike\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Brother Pike says: Quickly, heroes! Stop them before the fleet is lost!\",\"timestamp\":1766858231,\"id\":\"s17_3132\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Galecaller Faye\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Galecaller Faye yells: The clouds... break...\",\"timestamp\":1766858239,\"id\":\"s17_3133\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:159359::::::::80:577::23:2:9024:6652:2:9:50:28:2640:::::|h[Sea Priest's Greaves]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766858242,\"id\":\"s17_3134\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:159359::::::::80:577::23:2:9024:42:2:9:50:28:2640:::::|h[Sea Priest's Greaves]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766858242,\"id\":\"s17_3135\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:152576::::::::80:577:::::::::|h[Tidespray Linen]|h|rx3\",\"timestamp\":1766858242,\"id\":\"s17_3136\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Brother Pike\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Brother Pike says: Sea to sea, ashes to ashes, tide to tide. May your souls find peaceful currents.\",\"timestamp\":1766858243,\"id\":\"s17_3137\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 15 Gold, 44 Silver, 38 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1766858243,\"id\":\"s17_3138\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:152577::::::::80:577:::::::::|h[Deep Sea Satin]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766858297,\"id\":\"s17_3139\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:152576::::::::80:577:::::::::|h[Tidespray Linen]|h|rx3\",\"timestamp\":1766858297,\"id\":\"s17_3140\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:160938::::::::80:577::23:1:6657:2:9:50:28:502:::::|h[Bent Punching Blade]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766858297,\"id\":\"s17_3141\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 20 Gold, 79 Silver, 80 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1766858298,\"id\":\"s17_3142\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Stormsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lord Stormsong says: The Kul Tiran fleet is nearly yours, my queen.\",\"timestamp\":1766858315,\"id\":\"s17_3143\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Queen Azshara\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Queen Azshara says: It would seem you have guests, Lord Stormsong.\",\"timestamp\":1766858323,\"id\":\"s17_3144\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Brother Pike\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Brother Pike yells: Master! Stop this madness at once! The Kul Tiran fleet must not fall to darkness!\",\"timestamp\":1766858328,\"id\":\"s17_3145\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Stormsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Lord Stormsong yells: Fool! We must return to the sea, and Queen Azshara will grant us the power to do so!\",\"timestamp\":1766858337,\"id\":\"s17_3146\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Stormsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lord Stormsong says: For the last time, join me, or die.\",\"timestamp\":1766858348,\"id\":\"s17_3147\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Ofpuss-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Ofpuss|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:12601:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:12:27:25:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Void Lies Sleeping]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1766858356,\"id\":\"s17_3148\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Ofpuss-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Ofpuss|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:12601:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:12:27:25:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Void Lies Sleeping]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1766858356,\"id\":\"s17_3149\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Brother Pike\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Brother Pike says: Never.\",\"timestamp\":1766858356,\"id\":\"s17_3150\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:159364::::::::80:577::23:3:9024:6652:8811:2:9:50:28:2640:::::|h[Bindings of the Calling Depths]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766858358,\"id\":\"s17_3151\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:159646::::::::80:577::23:2:9024:40:2:9:50:28:2640:::::|h[Aq'mar, the Tidecaller]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1766858358,\"id\":\"s17_3152\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Stormsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Lord Stormsong yells: Then I shall cast your bodies to the blackened depths, to be crushed for eternity.\",\"timestamp\":1766858358,\"id\":\"s17_3153\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 13 Gold, 26 Silver, 8 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1766858359,\"id\":\"s17_3154\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Brother Pike\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Brother Pike says: You turned against the tide, Master, and now you have been pulled underneath it.\",\"timestamp\":1766858367,\"id\":\"s17_3155\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Brother Pike\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Brother Pike says: Something is not right. Darkness still festers here.\",\"timestamp\":1766858375,\"id\":\"s17_3156\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Brother Pike\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Brother Pike says: Be wary, heroes. Some unseen evil still lurks in the dark. We must press on to remove its influence from the shrine.\",\"timestamp\":1766858381,\"id\":\"s17_3157\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vol'zith the Whisperer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vol'zith the Whisperer yells: Ugalazul bwrxil' qu rax.\",\"id\":\"s17_3158\",\"timestamp\":1766858406},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vol'zith the Whisperer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.9215686917304993,\"g\":0.7098039388656616,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vol'zith the Whisperer whispers: Darkness roots. Pestilence spreads. The doorway is open.\",\"id\":\"s17_3159\",\"timestamp\":1766858406},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Brother Pike\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Brother Pike says: By the Tidemother!\",\"id\":\"s17_3160\",\"timestamp\":1766858421},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vol'zith the Whisperer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vol'zith the Whisperer yells: Aglathrax hig' thrixa.\",\"id\":\"s17_3161\",\"timestamp\":1766858423},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vol'zith the Whisperer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.9215686917304993,\"g\":0.7098039388656616,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vol'zith the Whisperer whispers: I reside within your lungs!\",\"id\":\"s17_3162\",\"timestamp\":1766858423},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vol'zith the Whisperer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vol'zith the Whisperer yells: Bwixki amala zal qulllll...\",\"id\":\"s17_3163\",\"timestamp\":1766858423},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vol'zith the Whisperer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.9215686917304993,\"g\":0.7098039388656616,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vol'zith the Whisperer whispers: I will await you... in the dark...\",\"id\":\"s17_3164\",\"timestamp\":1766858423},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Brother Pike\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Brother Pike says: Do not listen to its whispers! This horror will try to twist your souls!\",\"id\":\"s17_3165\",\"timestamp\":1766858424},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:159307::::::::80:577::23:2:9024:6652:2:9:50:28:2640:::::|h[Tentacle-Laced Spaulders]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s17_3166\",\"timestamp\":1766858425},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"playe