n their word, Trollbane.\",\"timestamp\":1767327245,\"id\":\"s17_3188\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Danath Trollbane\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Danath Trollbane says: I understand your frustration, Geya'rah. But do not rush to conclusions.\",\"timestamp\":1767327248,\"id\":\"s17_3189\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rannan Korren\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rannan Korren says: Hey Teha. Checking in to see if you have any titanic artifacts.\",\"id\":\"s17_3190\",\"timestamp\":1767536743},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Teha\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Teha says: Rannan, I be telling ya that people not be bringing titanic artifacts to our door on a regular basis.\",\"id\":\"s17_3191\",\"timestamp\":1767536748},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rannan Korren\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rannan Korren says: Well---\",\"id\":\"s17_3192\",\"timestamp\":1767536755},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Teha\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Teha says: I let ya know if it be happening.\",\"id\":\"s17_3193\",\"timestamp\":1767536755},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rannan Korren\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rannan Korren says: Very well, very well. Can't blame a guy for trying.\",\"id\":\"s17_3194\",\"timestamp\":1767536759},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rannan Korren\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rannan Korren says: It's a lot less dangerous than my usual exploits. Did I tell you about the time I met---\",\"id\":\"s17_3195\",\"timestamp\":1767536764},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:147511::::::::80:577:::::::::|h[Seal of the Deceiver]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s17_3196\",\"timestamp\":1768358475},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Auteist-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebAuteist|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:11223:Player-11-0EA2971E:1:1:14:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Legendary Research]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s17_3197\",\"timestamp\":1768410761},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loramus Thalipedes\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Loramus Thalipedes:60:MONSTER_YELL:|h[Loramus Thalipedes]|h yells: [Demonic] NOTHING CAN PREVENT YOUR WORLD FROM BURNING!\",\"timestamp\":1768411375,\"id\":\"s17_3198\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Captain Hicks\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406