en'dorei!\",\"id\":\"s17_3530\",\"timestamp\":1768962397},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vraxik\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vraxik says: Hold still, mortal!\",\"id\":\"s17_3531\",\"timestamp\":1768962402},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: No!\",\"id\":\"s17_3532\",\"timestamp\":1768962404},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider yells: Release them!\",\"id\":\"s17_3533\",\"timestamp\":1768962405},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vraxik\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vraxik says: The void... is endless...\",\"id\":\"s17_3534\",\"timestamp\":1768962408},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Allari the Souleater\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Allari the Souleater says: Impressive, Leona. You broke that creature's hold on Ofpuss with ease.\",\"id\":\"s17_3535\",\"timestamp\":1768962414},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Allari the Souleater\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Allari the Souleater says: I will proudly take Leona on as my disciple. And not just her.\",\"id\":\"s17_3536\",\"timestamp\":1768962434},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Ofpuss-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Ofpuss|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61916:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:1:20:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Rage of the Ren'dorei]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s17_3537\",\"timestamp\":1768962436},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Ofpuss-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Ofpuss|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61916:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:1:20:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Rage of the Ren'dorei]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s17_3538\",\"timestamp\":1768962436},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Knuckshots-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Knuckshots-Tichondrius|h[|cffaad372Knuckshots|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61916:Player-11-0EA664CD:1:1:20:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Rage of the Ren'dorei]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s17_3539\",\"timestamp\":1768962436},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Syldz-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Syldz-Tichondrius|h[|cffc41e3aSyldz|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61916:Player-11-0E7491E7:1:1:20:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Rage of the Ren'dorei]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s17_3540\",\"timestamp\":1768962437},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Allari the Souleater\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Allari the Souleater says: Leona has shown me that the ren'dorei are uniquely suited to both wield and combat the Void.\",\"id\":\"s17_3541\",\"timestamp\":1768962437},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Sonne-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Sonne-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Sonne|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61916:Player-11-0DD8D5BB:1:1:20:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Rage of the Ren'dorei]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s17_3542\",\"timestamp\":1768962439},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Allari the Souleater\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Allari the Souleater says: The Illidari currently lack such expertise. We will train any void elves who wish to join us.\",\"id\":\"s17_3543\",\"timestamp\":1768962443},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: I will direct those who are interested to you. May this exchange of knowledge benefit us all.\",\"id\":\"s17_3544\",\"timestamp\":1768962449},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leona Darkstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Leona Darkstrider says: My thanks, Allari. I look forward to walking the path ahead of me.\",\"id\":\"s17_3545\",\"timestamp\":1768962454},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Ofpuss|h[Ofpuss]: |h|A:ping_chat_warning:0:0:0:0|aWarning\",\"id\":\"s17_3546\",\"timestamp\":1768962455},{\"recordedBy\":\"Ofpuss-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Ofpuss|h[Ofpuss]: |h|A:ping_chat_nonthreat:0:0:0:0|aLook here\",\"id\":\"s17_3547\",\"timestamp\":1768962455},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.6666666865348816,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage|h[Starphage]: |h|A:ping_chat_onmyway:0:0:0:0|aOn my way\",\"timestamp\":1768962726,\"id\":\"s17_3548\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:152320::::::::80:1480:::::::::|h[Discharged Shock Lance]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1768963254,\"id\":\"s17_3549\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:143849::::::::80:1480:::::::::|h[Summon Royal Guard]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1768963254,\"id\":\"s17_3550\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Artames\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Artames just won a game of Hearthstone!\",\"timestamp\":1768963416,\"id\":\"s17_3551\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Artames\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Artames just won a game of Hearthstone!\",\"timestamp\":1768963554,\"id\":\"s17_3552\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver says: My skills in warpweaving can only do so much to help you. But I shall do my best.\",\"id\":\"s17_3553\",\"timestamp\":1768964340},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"General Hammond Clay\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"General Hammond Clay yells: People of Stormwind! Bear witness today to the deeds of Minnervva-Tichondrius, who has stood valiantly against the many foes that would threaten our fair city.\",\"id\":\"s17_3554\",\"timestamp\":1768964718},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"General Hammond Clay\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"General Hammond Clay yells: For their courage, we honor Minnervva as Lionguard, defender of Stormwind and all her people. Rise and Light bless you, Lion of Stormwind!\",\"id\":\"s17_3555\",\"timestamp\":1768964724},{\"rec