:\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx104\",\"id\":\"s17_4119\",\"timestamp\":1769105758},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ4:|Hcurrency:1602:0|h[Conquest]|h|rx6\",\"id\":\"s17_4120\",\"timestamp\":1769105758},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Skitter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Skitter says: Uplander! Hello! You have shinnies, yes?\",\"timestamp\":1769105810,\"id\":\"s17_4121\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Andee Seabraid\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Andee Seabraid says: We have many shinnies. What are you after?\",\"timestamp\":1769105814,\"id\":\"s17_4122\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Skitter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Skitter says: Ropes, hooks, and maps!\",\"timestamp\":1769105818,\"id\":\"s17_4123\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Andee Seabraid\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Andee Seabraid says: I have rope and hooks, but I don't have any maps of Khaz Algar.\",\"timestamp\":1769105821,\"id\":\"s17_4124\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Andee Seabraid\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Andee Seabraid says: I have maps of Azeroth, but you probably don't wa--\",\"timestamp\":1769105827,\"id\":\"s17_4125\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Skitter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Skitter says: You have maps of big world? I want maps of big world!\",\"timestamp\":1769105831,\"id\":\"s17_4126\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Andee Seabraid\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Andee Seabraid says: Okay then. Rope, hooks, maps. Anything else?\",\"timestamp\":1769105836,\"id\":\"s17_4127\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Skitter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Skitter says: You have candle?\",\"timestamp\":1769105841,\"id\":\"s17_4128\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Starphage, rumors suggest that Xal'atath's Twilight's Blade cult has been recruiting in Alliance cities.\",\"timestamp\":1769538712,\"id\":\"s17_4129\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Meet me in Stormwind so we can conduct an investigation. If the cult is there, then we must stamp it out at once.\",\"timestamp\":1769538722,\"id\":\"s17_4130\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loramus Thalipedes\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Loramus Thalipedes:23:MONSTER_YELL:|h[Loramus Thalipedes]|h yells: [Demonic] NOTHING CAN PREVENT YOUR WORLD FROM BURNING!\",\"timestamp\":1769538888,\"id\":\"s17_4131\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Over here, Starphage. The rumors I mentioned began in this part of the city.\",\"id\":\"s17_4132\",\"timestamp\":1769539700},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Please be discreet. Not everyone who seems suspicious or who practices void magic is necessarily a danger.\",\"id\":\"s17_4133\",\"timestamp\":1769539706},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:202163::::::::80:1480:::::::::|h[Rumble Prize Box]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s17_4134\",\"timestamp\":1769539719},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bryan Cross\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Bryan Cross says: Greetings.\",\"id\":\"s17_4135\",\"timestamp\":1769539721},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Suspicious Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Suspicious Citizen says: You're looking for cultists? I'm not a cultist!\",\"id\":\"s17_4136\",\"timestamp\":1769539730},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Suspicious Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Suspicious Citizen says: Xal'atath has a dark and glorious purpose for you, demon hunter!\",\"id\":\"s17_4137\",\"timestamp\":1769539736},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Interested Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Interested Citizen says: Twilight's Blade? Is that what they've been rambling on about? Ridiculous.\",\"id\":\"s17_4138\",\"timestamp\":1769539737},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Suspicious Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Suspicious Citizen says: Do I give the impression I'm part of that cult? I need to rethink my wardrobe...\",\"id\":\"s17_4139\",\"timestamp\":1769539748},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Miles Sidney\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Miles Sidney says: Only put half as much in next time.\",\"id\":\"s17_4140\",\"timestamp\":1769539752},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Suspicious Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Suspicious Citizen says: The apocalypse beckons. We answer her call.\",\"id\":\"s17_4141\",\"timestamp\":1769539754},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 34 Silver, 44 Copper\",\"id\":\"s17_4142\",\"timestamp\":1769539762},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Suspicious Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Suspicious Citizen says: The Twilight's Blade embraces the end. Join us!\",\"id\":\"s17_4143\",\"timestamp\":1769539765},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Interested Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Interested Citizen says: I don't want a fight! I'll go!\",\"id\":\"s17_4144\",\"timestamp\":1769539767},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Gold, 64 Silver, 13 Copper\",\"id\":\"s17_4145\",\"timestamp\":1769539774},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: So Rommath was right for once. The Twilight's Blade have been recruiting here.\",\"id\":\"s17_4146\",\"timestamp\":1769539781},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Cheerupbebii\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Cheerupbebii munches on some popcorn.\",\"id\":\"s17_4147\",\"timestamp\":1769539784},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Now that we have confirmed the rumors, we must stop the Twilight's Blade at its source: The Twilight Highlands.\",\"id\":\"s17_4148\",\"timestamp\":1769539790},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: Yet more minds twisted by the Void. This must seem quite familiar to you, Umbric.\",\"id\":\"s17_4149\",\"timestamp\":1769539797},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: Infiltrate the cult and see what you can learn. But do not succumb to the allure of their sermons.\",\"id\":\"s17_4150\",\"timestamp\":1769539808},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: A strong enough will can resist the call of Void, Rommath. You would do well to remember that.\",\"id\":\"s17_4151\",\"timestamp\":1769539815},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:68198::::::::80:1480:::::::::|h[Ruined Embersilk Scraps]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s17_4152\",\"timestamp\":1769539833},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:53010::::::::80:1480:::::::::|h[Embersilk Cloth]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s17_4153\",\"timestamp\":1769539833},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 3 Gold, 64 Silver, 61 Copper\",\"id\":\"s17_4154\",\"timestamp\":1769539834},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nedrand the Eyegorger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"The Twilight's Blade have begun summoning more forces. Defeat their ritual leaders!\",\"id\":\"s17_4155\",\"timestamp\":1769539844},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx10\",\"id\":\"s17_4156\",\"timestamp\":1769539885},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:68198::::::::80:1480:::::::::|h[Ruined Embersilk Scraps]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s17_4157\",\"timestamp\":1769539918},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:258853::::::::80:1480:::1:13611:2:9:80:28:3322:::::|h[Stained Sabatons]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s17_4158\",\"timestamp\":1769539918},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 6 Gold, 23 Silver, 98 Copper\",\"id\":\"s17_4159\",\"timestamp\":1769539919},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:246400::::::::80:1480:::::::::|h[Cultist Robes]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s17_4160\",\"timestamp\":1769539953},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 3 Gold, 92 Silver, 31 Copper\",\"id\":\"s17_4161\",\"timestamp\":1769539954},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:246398::::::::80:1480:::::::::|h[Cultist Cowl]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s17_4162\",\"timestamp\":1769539967},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nedrand the Eyegorger\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nedrand the Eyegorger's ritual has been interrupted! Finish him!\",\"id\":\"s17_4163\",\"timestamp\":1769539972},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:246399::::::::80:1480:::::::::|h[Cultist Dagger]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s17_4164\",\"timestamp\":1769539981},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gehl Harrowtongue\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Gehl Harrowtongue says: You. Acolyte. Haven't you finished your training? Where is your tabard?\",\"id\":\"s17_4165\",\"timestamp\":1769539981},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gehl Harrowtongue\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Gehl Harrowtongue says: Prove yourself as one Xal'atath's faithful. Only then may you attend the initiation ceremony.\",\"id\":\"s17_4166\",\"timestamp\":1769539993},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Gold, 33 Silver, 90 Copper\",\"id\":\"s17_4167\",\"timestamp\":1769540012},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Restless Neophyte\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Restless Neophyte says: Prove you're worthy of being Twilight's Blade!\",\"id\":\"s17_4168\",\"timestamp\":1769540091},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Restless Neophyte\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Restless Neophyte says: With this fight, I'll prove myself to Xal'atath!\",\"id\":\"s17_4169\",\"timestamp\":1769540102},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:258850::::::::80:1480:::1:13611:2:9:80:28:3322:::::|h[Stained Fistguards]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s17_4170\",\"timestamp\":1769540112},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 4 Gold, 50 Silver, 49 Copper\",\"id\":\"s17_4171\",\"timestamp\":1769540112},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Restless Neophyte\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Restless Neophyte says: We fight for Xal'atath!\",\"id\":\"s17_4172\",\"timestamp\":1769540115},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Restless Neophyte\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Restless Neophyte says: I won't let you win!\",\"id\":\"s17_4173\",\"timestamp\":1769540117},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Restless Neophyte\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Restless Neophyte says: For Xal'atath! For the Twilight's Blade!\",\"id\":\"s17_4174\",\"timestamp\":1769540119},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gehl Harrowtongue\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Gehl Harrowtongue says: You appear to be ready for your initiation now, fledgling. This way.\",\"id\":\"s17_4175\",\"timestamp\":1769540143},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gehl Harrowtongue\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Gehl Harrowtongue says: Take heed of Mor'duun's speech. Our leader's words have set many cultists' hearts afire. I'm sure they will yours as well.\",\"id\":\"s17_4176\",\"timestamp\":1769540145},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Projection of Mor'duun\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Projection of Mor'duun says: We are the Twilight's Blade. The void-black dagger Xal'atath wields against Azeroth.\",\"id\":\"s17_4177\",\"timestamp\":1769540154},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:250465::::::::80:1480:::::::::|h[Shadow Crystal]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s17_4178\",\"timestamp\":1769540178},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:250465::::::::80:1480:::::::::|h[Shadow Crystal]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s17_4179\",\"timestamp\":1769540182},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Projection of Mor'duun\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Projection of Mor'duun says: We cut deep. Blood. Carnage. Chaos! This is what gains her favor. This is our glorious purpose!\",\"id\":\"s17_4180\",\"timestamp\":1769540182},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Projection of Mor'duun\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Projection of Mor'duun says: We shall strike at the heart of Azeroth and end this flawed world. For Xal'atath! For the Twilight's Blade!\",\"id\":\"s17_4181\",\"timestamp\":1769540190},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage|h[Starphage]: |h|A:ping_chat_nonthreat:0:0:0:0|aStarphage\",\"id\":\"s17_4182\",\"timestamp\":1769540230},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Excellent work, Starphage. I believe we have learned enough here. Time to tear this camp apart.\",\"id\":\"s17_4183\",\"timestamp\":1769540267},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: I will meet you back at the basecamp. Our fight against this cult is only beginning.\",\"id\":\"s17_4184\",\"timestamp\":1769540272},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Mazeloki-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mazeloki-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaMazeloki|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:17334:Player-11-09C3488A:1:1:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Trading Post Enthusiast]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s17_4185\",\"timestamp\":1769540277},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Cheerupbebii\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Cheerupbebii munches on some popcorn.\",\"id\":\"s17_4186\",\"timestamp\":1769540306},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260661::::::::80:1480:::::::::|h[Glowing Shrub]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s17_4187\",\"timestamp\":1769540312},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 5 Gold, 28 Silver, 13 Copper\",\"id\":\"s17_4188\",\"timestamp\":1769540313},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx10\",\"id\":\"s17_4189\",\"timestamp\":1769540336},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Moonyeezy-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SAY\",\"type\":\"SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Moonyeezy-Tichondrius:148:SAY:|h[|cffffffffMoonyeezy|r]|h says: [Orcish] Raznos ka GROM Moth'aga..\",\"id\":\"s17_4190\",\"timestamp\":1769540337},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Moonyeezy-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SAY\",\"type\":\"SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Moonyeezy-Tichondrius:149:SAY:|h[|cffffffffMoonyeezy|r]|h says: [Orcish] Nuk ogg.. nuk maka.. \\\"Nuk Moguna.\\\"\",\"id\":\"s17_4191\",\"timestamp\":1769540339},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage|h[Starphage]: |h|A:ping_chat_nonthreat:0:0:0:0|aLook here\",\"id\":\"s17_4192\",\"timestamp\":1769540350},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Cheerupbebii\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Cheerupbebii munches on some popcorn.\",\"id\":\"s17_4193\",\"timestamp\":1769540426},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Executioner Lynthelma\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"The Twilight's Blade have begun summoning more forces. Defeat their ritual leaders!\",\"id\":\"s17_4194\",\"timestamp\":1769540444},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 51 Silver, 71 Copper\",\"id\":\"s17_4195\",\"timestamp\":1769540500},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gehl Harrowtongue\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Gehl Harrowtongue says: You still haven't learned. The Twilight's Blade will be your end!\",\"id\":\"s17_4196\",\"timestamp\":1769540520},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gehl Harrowtongue\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Gehl Harrowtongue says: I didn't... teach you that.\",\"id\":\"s17_4197\",\"timestamp\":1769540536},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 2 Gold, 92 Silver, 66 Copper\",\"id\