HAT_MSG_TEXT_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Manthamen:288:TEXT_EMOTE:|h|cffffffffManthamen|r|h-Antonidas serenades Uuna with a song.\",\"id\":\"s18_3620\",\"timestamp\":1770259997},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Anakron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Anakron says: Starphage, you stand before your peers as a scholar of the world.\",\"id\":\"s18_3621\",\"timestamp\":1770260012},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Uuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Uuna begins singing.\",\"id\":\"s18_3622\",\"timestamp\":1770260016},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Uuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SAY\",\"type\":\"SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Uuna:291:SAY:|h[Uuna]|h says: Tulip's sister, pure and humble! Seeks to... something...\",\"id\":\"s18_3623\",\"timestamp\":1770260016},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Uuna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Uuna mumbles.\",\"id\":\"s18_3624\",\"timestamp\":1770260016},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Anakron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Anakron says: You have proven yourself curious beyond a reasonable doubt. Inquisitive to a fault.\",\"id\":\"s18_3625\",\"timestamp\":1770260018},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Anakron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Anakron says: You have meddled in otherworldly affairs which, frankly, should have killed you.\",\"id\":\"s18_3626\",\"timestamp\":1770260024},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Anakron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Anakron says: Yet here you stand.\",\"id\":\"s18_3627\",\"timestamp\":1770260031},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Anakron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Anakron says: We, the Mind-Seekers, do hereby welcome you as one of our own. This is a great privilege and a heavy responsibility.\",\"id\":\"s18_3628\",\"timestamp\":1770260036},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Anakron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Anakron says: We bestow this honor upon you that you may continue to uncover the hidden truths in our world... and beyond.\",\"id\":\"s18_3629\",\"timestamp\":1770260042},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Anakron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Anakron:298:MONSTER_YELL:|h[Anakron]|h yells: [Demonic] From the shadows, let there be truth!\",\"id\":\"s18_3630\",\"timestamp\":1770260048},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.2509804069