ared Civilian\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Scared Civilian says: I can make it from here.\",\"id\":\"s18_3896\",\"timestamp\":1772151273},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: By the Light, suffer no more.\",\"id\":\"s18_3897\",\"timestamp\":1772151275},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Injured Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Injured Citizen says: I thought I was dead for sure!\",\"id\":\"s18_3898\",\"timestamp\":1772151278},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Treesuh-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Treesuh-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aTreesuh|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0E53603A:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_3899\",\"timestamp\":1772151279},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rescued Civilian\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rescued Civilian says: I will follow you, Starphage.\",\"id\":\"s18_3900\",\"timestamp\":1772151291},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scared Civilian\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Scared Civilian says: We're safe--Arator is here. Run to the boats!\",\"id\":\"s18_3901\",\"timestamp\":1772151294},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: You will not fall today!\",\"id\":\"s18_3902\",\"timestamp\":1772151296},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Arator, Starphage! The evacuating ships are under attack!\",\"id\":\"s18_3903\",\"timestamp\":1772151310},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Tmpikaboo-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tmpikaboo-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Tmpikaboo|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-11-0E82A933:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_3904\",\"timestamp\":1772151318},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:268327::::::::80:1480::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:80:28:3592:::::|h[Sin'dorei Citizen's Shawl]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s18_3905\",\"timestamp\":1772151322},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: If we don't protect those ships, we'll have sent the people aboard them to die!\",\"id\":\"s18_3906\",\"timestamp\":1772151324},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Climatechang-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Climatechang-Tichondrius:176:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aClimatechang|r]|h: GRATS!\",\"id\":\"s18_3907\",\"timestamp\":1772151325},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Tiana Sunfeather\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Tiana Sunfeather says: Mount up! She's ready to go!\",\"id\":\"s18_3908\",\"timestamp\":1772151327},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: Clear the skies and rescue any survivors you can find!\",\"id\":\"s18_3909\",\"timestamp\":1772151329},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: They've sunk a ship! Throw the survivor a rope!\",\"id\":\"s18_3910\",\"timestamp\":1772151350},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Badonkadonk-Trollbane\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Badonkadonk-Trollbane|h[|cff8788eeBadonkadonk-Trollbane|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:P