n't your decision to make!\",\"id\":\"s18_4078\",\"timestamp\":1772152870},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Voidwhispèr-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Voidwhispèr-Area52:494:GUILD:|h[|cffa330c9Voidwhispèr|r]|h: grats!\",\"id\":\"s18_4079\",\"timestamp\":1772152871},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Snowshatter-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Snowshatter-Tichondrius:495:GUILD:|h[|cffc41e3aSnowshatter|r]|h: i cant even get my xp to show\",\"id\":\"s18_4080\",\"timestamp\":1772152877},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:248061::::::::80:1480::11:4:13573:13613:13615:6652:2:9:80:28:3085:::::|h[Golden City Hatchet]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s18_4081\",\"timestamp\":1772152882},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: The Sunwell holds the Voidstorm at bay for now. But its current state cannot be sustained forever.\",\"id\":\"s18_4082\",\"timestamp\":1772152883},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Treesuh-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Treesuh-Tichondrius:516:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aTreesuh|r]|h: edit mode they say\",\"id\":\"s18_4083\",\"timestamp\":1772152885},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: And there's no telling how it could be affecting the rest of Eversong, especially the Lightbloom. We need an alternative course of action.\",\"id\":\"s18_4084\",\"timestamp\":1772152890},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Treesuh-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Treesuh-Tichondrius:520:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aTreesuh|r]|h: It doesnt matter to me  though bub...just rippin\",\"id\":\"s18_4085\",\"timestamp\":1772152895},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: We ren'dorei can aid you in finding one. Grant us entry into Silvermoon--\",\"id\":\"s18_4086\",\"timestamp\":1772152898},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: Absolutely not! Your mere presence would risk defiling the Sunwell with Void magic.\",\"id\":\"s18_4087\",\"timestamp\":1772152903},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Necrosouls-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Necrosouls-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eeNecrosouls|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0EA7DF24:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4088\",\"timestamp\":1772152904},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Jaxoa-Zul'jin\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Jaxoa-Zul'jin|h[|cffff7c0aJaxoa-Zul'jin|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-61-0EC3D930:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4089\",\"timestamp\":1772152910},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Then it seems we have nothing more to discuss. I'll continue my research in Tranquillien, should you choose to see reason.\",\"id\":\"s18_4090\",\"timestamp\":1772152910},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: The Grand Magister is right about one thing--protecting the Sunwell is our top priority. The Vanguard of the Light will see to its defense.\",\"id\":\"s18_4091\",\"timestamp\":1772152920},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Your aid was timely and welcome, Turalyon. But remember that Silvermoon and the Sunwell belong to the sin'dorei. You are guests in our fair city.\",\"id\":\"s18_4092\",\"timestamp\":1772152930},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Endisnear-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Endisnear-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Endisnear|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0E6E8675:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4093\",\"timestamp\":1772152935},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Moonslasher-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Moonslasher-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aMoonslasher|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:40436:Player-11-0DCBF9A7:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[You're Getting a Delve!]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4094\",\"timestamp\":1772152937},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Moonslasher-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Moonslasher-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aMoonslasher|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-11-0DCBF9A7:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4095\",\"timestamp\":1772152937},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: Guests, allies, and saviors, Lor'themar. Rest assured that we will guard your city and your people with the full strength of the Light.\",\"id\":\"s18_4096\",\"timestamp\":1772152940},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Mvmnt-MoonGuard\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mvmnt-MoonGuard|h[|cffff7c0aMvmnt-MoonGuard|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-3675-0AC0F600:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4097\",\"timestamp\":1772152943},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: I'll speak to the Vanguard while you get the other matters settled.\",\"id\":\"s18_4098\",\"timestamp\":1772152963},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Kritcity-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kritcity-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aKritcity|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0E43FBE7:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4099\",\"timestamp\":1772152964},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Theoboom-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Theoboom-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aTheoboom|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0EAE8521:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4100\",\"timestamp\":1772152964},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Happybunny-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Happybunny-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffHappybunny|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0E43FC68:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4101\",\"timestamp\":1772152969},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: You have already taken so many of my Blood Knights to empower the Sunwell! Quel'Thalas is largely undefended!\",\"id\":\"s18_4102\",\"timestamp\":1772152977},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Guard\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"The nearby guard glares at you and the void energy that you surround yourself with.\",\"id\":\"s18_4103\",\"timestamp\":1772152979},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"General Amias Bellamy\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"General Amias Bellamy says: And I am telling you that it is still not enough. Only by the faith of our forces is the Sunwell holding back the Void.\",\"id\":\"s18_4104\",\"timestamp\":1772152984},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ceera\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ceera says: The last I saw shadows descend on Quel'Danas, Arthas marched on our kingdom with his army of Scourge. Now another army marches in our streets, saying they're here for our protection... are you certain of that?\",\"id\":\"s18_4105\",\"timestamp\":1772152996},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magistrix Narinth\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magistrix Narinth says: That burst of energy from the Sunwell--it was more powerful than any magic I've ever encountered, and I am well practiced. They say that army protects us, but I heard the surge was their doing! Do they even understand what they meddle with?\",\"id\":\"s18_4106\",\"timestamp\":1772153026},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Tiivah-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tiivah-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dTiivah|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0E6BD6A1:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4107\",\"timestamp\":1772153028},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Skymaster Skyles\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Skymaster Skyles says: That surge from the Sunwell set off the dragonhawks--they know when there's danger. I've never seen them this unnerved. If the animals are this affected, what about the rest of Eversong?\",\"id\":\"s18_4108\",\"timestamp\":1772153037},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Wroot-Zuluhed\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Wroot-Zuluhed|h[|cffff7c0aWroot-Zuluhed|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41287:Player-96-0BEC845D:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Windrunner Spire]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4109\",\"timestamp\":1772153042},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Innkeeper Jovia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Innkeeper Jovia says: With all that has happened, that... utterly mad vortex of shadow in the sky, guests are leaving in droves. If I weren't overseeing this place, I'm not so certain I'd still be here myself. If you wish a room, it is yours.\",\"id\":\"s18_4110\",\"timestamp\":1772153046},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:6948::::::::80:1480:::::::::|h[Hearthstone]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s18_4111\",\"timestamp\":1772153050},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"LightforgedDraenei\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Amyrabelle-MoonGuard\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Amyrabelle-MoonGuard|h[|cfff48cbaAmyrabelle-MoonGuard|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-3675-0A7793FD:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4112\",\"timestamp\":1772153054},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Guard Captain Goldblade\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Guard Captain Goldblade says: The gates behind me are restricted to members of the Horde only. Avoid the red banners and trees, or there will be consequences.\",\"id\":\"s18_4113\",\"timestamp\":1772153073},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Dexand-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Dexand-Tichondrius|h[|cffaad372Dexand|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0E2B8100:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4114\",\"timestamp\":1772153108},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Tomãs-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tomãs-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dTomãs|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-11-0E79EB80:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4115\",\"timestamp\":1772153138},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar says: Of course--the Reliquary will lend aid wherever it's needed. Let me know if you're interested as well.\",\"id\":\"s18_4116\",\"timestamp\":1772153147},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: You're needed in Fairbreeze, champion. A problem with the Lightbloom.\",\"id\":\"s18_4117\",\"timestamp\":1772153170},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:248045::::::::80:1480::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:80:28:3085:::::|h[Reluctant Diplomat's Wraps]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s18_4118\",\"timestamp\":1772153176},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:250352::::::::80:1480:::::::::|h[Worn Supply Bag]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s18_4119\",\"timestamp\":1772153176},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:263231::::::::80:1480::11::1:28:3085:::::|h[Silvermoon Curio Shelves]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s18_4120\",\"timestamp\":1772153176},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Starphage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4121\",\"timestamp\":1772153176},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Starphage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4122\",\"timestamp\":1772153176},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: Use this arcane projector to keep us informed.\",\"id\":\"s18_4123\",\"timestamp\":1772153176},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Helläkopta-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Helläkopta-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Helläkopta|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-11-0E8A9BE5:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4124\",\"timestamp\":1772153182},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Aggröphobic-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Aggröphobic-Tichondrius|h[|cff0070ddAggröphobic|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0DBD291B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4125\",\"timestamp\":1772153184},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Morbidus-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Morbidus-Tichondrius|h[|cffc41e3aMorbidus|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0B68887C:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4126\",\"timestamp\":1772153184},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Twìtch-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Twìtch-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffTwìtch|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62388:Player-11-0E5A0B07:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Illicit Rain: Five Stars]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4127\",\"timestamp\":1772153191},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Cheapbolts-Illidan\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Cheapbolts-Illidan|h[|cff8788eeCheapbolts-Illidan|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-57-0D4B4B59:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4128\",\"timestamp\":1772153195},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Dhezi-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Dhezi-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Dhezi|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0DB445A7:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4129\",\"timestamp\":1772153196},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Zarusah-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Zarusah-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aZarusah|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0ADF3292:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4130\",\"timestamp\":1772153197},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: Arator, you may be needed at the Sunwell.\",\"id\":\"s18_4131\",\"timestamp\":1772153199},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Coraqt-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Coraqt-Tichondrius|h[|cffaad372Coraqt|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:247:Player-11-0E91E32A:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Make Love, Not Warcraft]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4132\",\"timestamp\":1772153201},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Is everything all right, Lady Liadrin? You've said little since we arrived.\",\"id\":\"s18_4133\",\"timestamp\":1772153204},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Lenos-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Lenos-Tichondrius|h[|cffc41e3aLenos|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0DD34557:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4134\",\"timestamp\":1772153204},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Schwhacked-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Schwhacked-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaSchwhacked|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0EB02708:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4135\",\"timestamp\":1772153205},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Nightborne\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Eleonore-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Eleonore-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eeEleonore|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0EA60346:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4136\",\"timestamp\":1772153207},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Jillyanne-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Jillyanne-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaJillyanne|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0DC07B95:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4137\",\"timestamp\":1772153207},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Shadowge-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Shadowge-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffShadowge|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0EB2176A:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4138\",\"timestamp\":1772153208},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: My apologies--my thoughts are with the Sunwell. I did not expect it to react with such... force.\",\"id\":\"s18_4139\",\"timestamp\":1772153209},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Anshlun\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Anshlun places a cozy Feast of the Midnight Masquerade for everyone to enjoy!\",\"id\":\"s18_4140\",\"timestamp\":1772153209},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Eximious-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Eximious-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffEximious|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0AEF9870:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4141\",\"timestamp\":1772153210},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Clearcast-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Clearcast-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebClearcast|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0EAE0154:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4142\",\"timestamp\":1772153213},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: You ask, and the Light provides. Need it be more complicated than that?\",\"id\":\"s18_4143\",\"timestamp\":1772153218},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Clearcast-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Clearcast-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebClearcast|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61310:Player-11-0EAE0154:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Casual Collector]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4144\",\"timestamp\":1772153220},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: She speaks of the Sunwell, not the Light.\",\"id\":\"s18_4145\",\"timestamp\":1772153224},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: Your fount was blessed by the heart of a naaru. It is one and the same.\",\"id\":\"s18_4146\",\"timestamp\":1772153228},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Mvmnt-MoonGuard\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mvmnt-MoonGuard|h[|cffff7c0aMvmnt-MoonGuard|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-3675-0AC0F600:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4147\",\"timestamp\":1772153233},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Dandanwyn-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Dandanwyn-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aDandanwyn|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0E88B933:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4148\",\"timestamp\":1772153233},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: I suggest you hold your tongue, High Exarch. That \\\"fount\\\" you so blithely pretend to understand predates the existence of human civilization.\",\"id\":\"s18_4149\",\"timestamp\":1772153234},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Neryssa-Agamaggan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Neryssa-Agamaggan|h[|cff8788eeNeryssa-Agamaggan|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-1129-0BB81599:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4150\",\"timestamp\":1772153243},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: And in all that time, I have never heard of the Sunwell reacting with that kind of... aggression. Liadrin, what was that beam of light?\",\"id\":\"s18_4151\",\"timestamp\":1772153244},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Stöic-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Stöic-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Stöic|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0EAFE8B8:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4152\",\"timestamp\":1772153248},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Anshlun-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Anshlun-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffAnshlun|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0E577688:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4153\",\"timestamp\":1772153251},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: I wish I knew. It holds back the Void, yet I still wonder... if the Sunwell is capable of such power, what else will it do?\",\"id\":\"s18_4154\",\"timestamp\":1772153253},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: That question worries me, Liadrin. Is it wrong for it to do so?\",\"id\":\"s18_4155\",\"timestamp\":1772153265},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Illidanxd-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Illidanxd-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Illidanxd|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0EB0AF10:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4156\",\"timestamp\":1772153267},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Mezmir-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mezmir-Tichondrius|h[|cff0070ddMezmir|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-11-0EA2A9CD:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4157\",\"timestamp\":1772153268},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: The effects of the Sunwell have never been malicious. It has blessed Eversong's forests with small groves of Lightbloom for years.\",\"id\":\"s18_4158\",\"timestamp\":1772153270},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Small at first, but Fairbreeze now reports a problem. If the Sunwell is aggressive, what of the Lightbloom?\",\"id\":\"s18_4159\",\"timestamp\":1772153280},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: These worries will lead you nowhere, Regent Lord. As long as the Vanguard maintains the connection to the Sunwell, the Light will see us through.\",\"id\":\"s18_4160\",\"timestamp\":1772153288},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: Have faith. That is all that is needed from you.\",\"id\":\"s18_4161\",\"timestamp\":1772153298},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Perhaps you should save your words for when they are asked for, High Exarch. I suspect they would be better received.\",\"id\":\"s18_4162\",\"timestamp\":1772153303},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Kronicle-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kronicle-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaKronicle|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-02C69B67:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4163\",\"timestamp\":1772153307},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Slapr-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Slapr-Tichondrius|h[|cff0070ddSlapr|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0ABB55E1:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4164\",\"timestamp\":1772153310},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Elkie-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Elkie-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dElkie|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0A841313:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4165\",\"timestamp\":1772153311},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Clydemcfree-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Clydemcfree-Tichondrius|h[|cff0070ddClydemcfree|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0E1CA23B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s18_4166\",\"timestamp\":1772153311},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:251321::::::::80:1480::11::1:28:3615:::::|h[Collection of Eversong Minerals]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772153453,\"id\":\"s18_4167\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:237362::::::::80:1480::::1:38:13:::::|h[Umbral Tin Ore |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx12\",\"timestamp\":1772153455,\"id\":\"s18_4168\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:237364::::::::80:1480::::1:38:13:::::|h[Brilliant Silver Ore |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx12\",\"timestamp\":1772153455,\"id\":\"s18_4169\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:237359::::::::80:1480::::1:38:13:::::|h[Refulgent Copper Ore |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx40\",\"timestamp\":1772153455,\"id\":\"s18_4170\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"You have gained the Midnight Engineering skill.\",\"timestamp\":1772153482,\"id\":\"s18_4171\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"You have gained the Midnight Mining skill.\",\"timestamp\":1772153555,\"id\":\"s18_4172\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Guard\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"The nearby guard glares at you and the void energy that you surround yourself with.\",\"timestamp\":1772153559,\"id\":\"s18_4173\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: You're Orweyna, aren't you? My mother Alleria told me about you.\",\"timestamp\":1772153644,\"id\":\"s18_4174\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vidious\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vidious says: You like goods don't you? Then find them.\",\"timestamp\":1772153647,\"id\":\"s18_4175\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Darkð-Kel'Thuzad\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Darkð-Kel'Thuzad:759:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDarkð|r]|h: MIDNIGHT BOYS!!\",\"timestamp\":1772153650,\"id\":\"s18_4176\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Magistrix, when did you first begin seeing these disturbances with this Lightbloom?\",\"timestamp\":1772153650,\"id\":\"s18_4177\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magistrix Landra Dawnstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magistrix Landra Dawnstrider says: Hmm, perhaps when the Sunwell blew sky high into that swirling vortex? ...sorry. I'm a bit overwhelmed.\",\"timestamp\":1772153656,\"id\":\"s18_4178\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Twìtch-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Twìtch-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffTwìtch|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41960:Player-11-0E5A0B07:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Murder Row]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772153659,\"id\":\"s18_4179\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Darkð-Kel'Thuzad\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Darkð-Kel'Thuzad:763:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDarkð|r]|h: Oh shit i gotta check out the new race\",\"timestamp\":1772153667,\"id\":\"s18_4180\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Darkð-Kel'Thuzad\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Darkð-Kel'Thuzad:764:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDarkð|r]|h: brb\",\"timestamp\":1772153668,\"id\":\"s18_4181\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Ugh! It looks--and smells--like the local pets were marking their territory. They're obviously distressed.\",\"timestamp\":1772153670,\"id\":\"s18_4182\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aleeta Dawnstone\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Aleeta Dawnstone says: Please save my kitty, mister paladin!\",\"timestamp\":1772153673,\"id\":\"s18_4183\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aleeta Dawnstone\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Aleeta Dawnstone says: Come down kitty!\",\"timestamp\":1772153677,\"id\":\"s18_4184\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: There we are--keep him close now!\",\"timestamp\":1772153679,\"id\":\"s18_4185\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: This nest... it's being choked by the Lightbloom growth. Let's fix this.\",\"timestamp\":1772153684,\"id\":\"s18_4186\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Luccei-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"¡|Hplayer:Luccei-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Luccei|r]|h ha ganado el logro |cffffff00|Hachievement:42197:Player-11-0E5FB1A3:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[War Within Delves: Tier 5 (Season 3)]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772153690,\"id\":\"s18_4187\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Luccei-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"¡|Hplayer:Luccei-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Luccei|r]|h ha ganado el logro |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-11-0E5FB1A3:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772153690,\"id\":\"s18_4188\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Luccei-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"¡|Hplayer:Luccei-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Luccei|r]|h ha ganado el logro |cffffff00|Hachievement:61835:Player-11-0E5FB1A3:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 2]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772153690,\"id\":\"s18_4189\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Luccei-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"¡|Hplayer:Luccei-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Luccei|r]|h ha ganado el logro |cffffff00|Hachievement:61836:Player-11-0E5FB1A3:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 3]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772153690,\"id\":\"s18_4190\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Pleaseclap-WyrmrestAccord\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Pleaseclap-WyrmrestAccord:776:GUILD:|h[|cffc41e3aPleaseclap|r]|h: dont think its out yet lol\",\"timestamp\":1772153698,\"id\":\"s18_4191\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"KulTiran\",\"name\":\"Lacarei-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Lacarei-Tichondrius|h[|cff0070ddLacarei|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:238:Player-11-0EB05C9E:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[An Honorable Kill]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772153703,\"id\":\"s18_4192\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: The Lightbloom first appeared when the Sunwell was restored, many years ago. But it never grew near civilization like this.\",\"timestamp\":1772153720,\"id\":\"s18_4193\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: That creature must have come from the Lightbloom! We should let the Magistrix know.\",\"timestamp\":1772153728,\"id\":\"s18_4194\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: This bush was trampled--the poor wildlife here must be terrified.\",\"timestamp\":1772153740,\"id\":\"s18_4195\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Perhaps this sudden growth is tied to the empowerment of the Sunwell. I think I was right--this could be used to help the Vanguard.\",\"timestamp\":1772153753,\"id\":\"s18_4196\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: The nearest Lightbloom is nowhere near the village. How did the growth get all the way out here?\",\"timestamp\":1772153760,\"id\":\"s18_4197\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Melida Sunward\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Melida Sunward says: Thank you. Those hawkstriders are a terror!\",\"timestamp\":1772153779,\"id\":\"s18_4198\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: They shouldn't be a problem much longer.\",\"timestamp\":1772153783,\"id\":\"s18_4199\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: This Lightbloom you describe is clearly out of control. We must find what has disturbed it so.\",\"timestamp\":1772153803,\"id\":\"s18_4200\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Assisting Paladin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Assisting Paladin says: Light soothe those wounds, little friend.\",\"timestamp\":1772153804,\"id\":\"s18_4201\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:248023::::::::80:1480::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:80:28:3085:::::|h[Lynxslayer's Leather Gloves]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772153807,\"id\":\"s18_4202\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Dolphinz-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Dolphinz-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eeDolphinz|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-11-09C892D3:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772153859,\"id\":\"s18_4203\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260670::::::::80:1480:::::::::|h[Bloody Broken Beak]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772153875,\"id\":\"s18_4204\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Climatechang-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Climatechang-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aClimatechang|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-11-0E90740E:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772153916,\"id\":\"s18_4205\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Audmir-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"¡|Hplayer:Audmir-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eeAudmir|r]|h ha ganado el logro |cffffff00|Hachievement:41287:Player-11-0EA3740A:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Windrunner Spire]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772153944,\"id\":\"s18_4206\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Dprh-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Dprh-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Dprh|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41287:Player-11-0EA1AF2F:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Windrunner Spire]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772153957,\"id\":\"s18_4207\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssara Duskmourne\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lyssara Duskmourne says: The shadows hang long with the crimes of the meek...\",\"timestamp\":1772153984,\"id\":\"s18_4208\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Coraqt-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Coraqt-Tichondrius|h[|cffaad372Coraqt|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:12572:Player-11-0E91E32A:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[War Supplied]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772154000,\"id\":\"s18_4209\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Light soothe those wounds, little friend.\",\"timestamp\":1772154010,\"id\":\"s18_4210\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Assisting Paladin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Assisting Paladin says: Light soothe those wounds, little friend.\",\"timestamp\":1772154011,\"id\":\"s18_4211\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Darion Swiftdawn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Darion Swiftdawn says: My poor kitten was savaged! Thank you.\",\"timestamp\":1772154012,\"id\":\"s18_4212\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264248::::::::80:1480::11::1:28:3085:::::|h[Sin'dorei Storage Jar]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772154016,\"id\":\"s18_4213\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: It was no trouble at all.\",\"timestamp\":1772154016,\"id\":\"s18_4214\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Follow the trail. It should lead to the answers we seek.\",\"timestamp\":1772154019,\"id\":\"s18_4215\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Mother said you're familiar with the wilds. What do you make of all this?\",\"timestamp\":1772154025,\"id\":\"s18_4216\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: The creatures... they remind me of home, yet they live on the surface. It should not be this way.\",\"timestamp\":1772154029,\"id\":\"s18_4217\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"DarkIronDwarf\",\"name\":\"Tipride-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tipride-Tichondrius|h[|cff0070ddTipride|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41287:Player-11-0EA6D4F4:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Windrunner Spire]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772154043,\"id\":\"s18_4218\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Ironspider-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"