 out in the distance. Don't miss this opportunity!\",\"timestamp\":1772154747,\"id\":\"s18_4329\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Darkð-Kel'Thuzad\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Darkð-Kel'Thuzad:1052:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDarkð|r]|h: Has anyone figured out how far into the quests that we can do the Harandar campaign to unlock the allied race?\",\"timestamp\":1772154758,\"id\":\"s18_4330\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Starphage-Tichondrius:1053:GUILD:|h[|cffa330c9Starphage|r]|h: wow the intro quest flashbang is something\",\"timestamp\":1772154758,\"id\":\"s18_4331\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Quartermaster Lymel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Quartermaster Lymel says: Why are we stockpiling?\",\"timestamp\":1772154764,\"id\":\"s18_4332\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Shookone-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Shookone-Area52:1055:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeShookone|r]|h: anyone want to come for daily dungeon\",\"timestamp\":1772154773,\"id\":\"s18_4333\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Quartermaster Lymel\"},\"event\":\"C