88},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Shookone-Area52|h[|cff8788eeShookone-Area52|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41287:Player-3676-0EC012CA:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Windrunner Spire]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157289,\"id\":\"s18_4724\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Audmir-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"¡|Hplayer:Audmir-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eeAudmir|r]|h ha ganado el logro |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0EA3740A:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157311,\"id\":\"s18_4725\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:250478::::::::81:1480::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:81:28:3085:::::|h[Enchanted Crypt Hatchet]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772157319,\"id\":\"s18_4726\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Quickly, we need to get to Amani Pass and tell them the truth of what is happening!\",\"timestamp\":1772157321,\"id\":\"s18_4727\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"name\":\"Mookiemagi-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mookiemagi-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebMookiemagi|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:40436:Player-11-0E5B9C4D:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[You're Getting a Delve!]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157324,\"id\":\"s18_4728\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"name\":\"Mookiemagi-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mookiemagi-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebMookiemagi|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-11-0E5B9C4D:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157324,\"id\":\"s18_4729\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: It's the Twilight's Blade! They're the true threat!\",\"timestamp\":1772157335,\"id\":\"s18_4730\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: If you will not fight, get out of my way!\",\"timestamp\":1772157340,\"id\":\"s18_4731\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: This bloodshed... it's madness. Where is my father? He must see this by now!\",\"timestamp\":1772157342,\"id\":\"s18_4732\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eversong Farstrider\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Eversong Farstrider says: Have you lost your mind? They have threatened us for generations!\",\"timestamp\":1772157344,\"id\":\"s18_4733\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eversong Spellbreaker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Eversong Spellbreaker says: Are you mad? Perhaps I should be silencing your words as well as the Amani!\",\"timestamp\":1772157347,\"id\":\"s18_4734\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eversong Arch Magister\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Eversong Arch Magister says: Have you forgotten your history? Given the opportunity, the Amani would gladly take our lands and our lives!\",\"timestamp\":1772157349,\"id\":\"s18_4735\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Blessed Lightbringer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Blessed Lightbringer says: How do you not see the enemy that stands before you? They strike, and we deliver retribution!\",\"timestamp\":1772157351,\"id\":\"s18_4736\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amani Grunt\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Amani Grunt says: I'll break you!\",\"timestamp\":1772157360,\"id\":\"s18_4737\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Veteran Blood Knight\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Veteran Blood Knight says: How could you think that when your own people lay dead or dying around us?\",\"timestamp\":1772157367,\"id\":\"s18_4738\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Blessed Lightbringer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Blessed Lightbringer says: I will fail neither the Light nor Turalyon! Press the attack!\",\"timestamp\":1772157375,\"id\":\"s18_4739\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eversong Magister\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Eversong Magister says: And give them the upper hand? Glory belongs to the sin'dorei--have you forgotten?\",\"timestamp\":1772157384,\"id\":\"s18_4740\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: How dare the Amani threaten the sin'dorei again!\",\"timestamp\":1772157385,\"id\":\"s18_4741\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Theodosiâ-Area52\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Theodosiâ-Area52|h[|cfff48cbaTheodosiâ-Area52|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-3676-0E0EA19C:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157387,\"id\":\"s18_4742\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Veteran Blood Knight\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Veteran Blood Knight says: Your people fight for their freedom and their lives, and this is all you have to say? Get out, then!\",\"timestamp\":1772157394,\"id\":\"s18_4743\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: We have to stop this!\",\"timestamp\":1772157406,\"id\":\"s18_4744\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: It is too late, Arator. But we can heal those in need.\",\"timestamp\":1772157408,\"id\":\"s18_4745\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: Wretched Amani! By the Light, I will see these monsters purged!\",\"timestamp\":1772157412,\"id\":\"s18_4746\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:248029::::::::81:1480::11:2:13613:6652:2:9:81:28:3085:::::|h[Eversong Defender's Hood]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772157413,\"id\":\"s18_4747\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Champion! We've cornered Zul'jan. It is time to bring this incursion to an end!\",\"timestamp\":1772157416,\"id\":\"s18_4748\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Were we blind to Arator's truth?\",\"timestamp\":1772157534,\"id\":\"s18_4749\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Lady Liadrin, secure the pass. For good or ill, we've taken a stand here. We should keep it.\",\"timestamp\":1772157537,\"id\":\"s18_4750\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Vheradis-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Vheradis-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aVheradis|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-11-0E328A6A:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157593,\"id\":\"s18_4751\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Cleppi-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Cleppi-Tichondrius|h[|cffc41e3aCleppi|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0EAFBAFF:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157603,\"id\":\"s18_4752\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"You have gained the Midnight Fishing skill.\",\"timestamp\":1772157620,\"id\":\"s18_4753\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"You have gained the Midnight Cooking skill.\",\"timestamp\":1772157713,\"id\":\"s18_4754\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Starphage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:1796:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Short Order Cook]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157715,\"id\":\"s18_4755\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Starphage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:1796:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Short Order Cook]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157715,\"id\":\"s18_4756\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Chàòs-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Chàòs-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eeChàòs|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0EB0D712:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157744,\"id\":\"s18_4757\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Champion, you've uncovered many threats that besiege Quel'Thalas. We must plan our next move together.\",\"timestamp\":1772157745,\"id\":\"s18_4758\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: The Amani crossed a line. We need to make sure their encroachment has ended.\",\"timestamp\":1772157748,\"id\":\"s18_4759\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Lasadin-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Lasadin-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaLasadin|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-11-0E872977:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157752,\"id\":\"s18_4760\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Lady Liadrin is in Zul'Aman now, looking into the situation. She'll need backup.\",\"timestamp\":1772157752,\"id\":\"s18_4761\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: The Lightbloom is still an ever-present threat.\",\"timestamp\":1772157757,\"id\":\"s18_4762\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: Your... contact has been investigating the overgrowth. Perhaps she has found something of value.\",\"timestamp\":1772157761,\"id\":\"s18_4763\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: The Sunwell can only be empowered for so long. Those who are maintaining its current state are under immense strain.\",\"timestamp\":1772157769,\"id\":\"s18_4764\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Turalyon, how does our army fare?\",\"timestamp\":1772157776,\"id\":\"s18_4765\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: The Vanguard... stands at the ready. But even we cannot hold the line should the Sunwell falter.\",\"timestamp\":1772157779,\"id\":\"s18_4766\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"name\":\"Cluckinchuck-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Cluckinchuck-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aCluckinchuck|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0E8E0F2A:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157782,\"id\":\"s18_4767\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: The Light... we must trust in the Light. We must.\",\"timestamp\":1772157788,\"id\":\"s18_4768\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Thefuneral-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Thefuneral-Tichondrius|h[|cff00ff98Thefuneral|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0EB12AD6:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157793,\"id\":\"s18_4769\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:244538::::::::81:1480::11::1:28:3085:::::|h[Silvermoon Sundial]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772157799,\"id\":\"s18_4770\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"Your skill in Warglaives has increased to 410.\",\"timestamp\":1772157799,\"id\":\"s18_4771\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Starphage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157800,\"id\":\"s18_4772\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Starphage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157800,\"id\":\"s18_4773\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"LightforgedDraenei\",\"name\":\"Veonnifer-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Veonnifer-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eeVeonnifer|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0E8A432D:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157822,\"id\":\"s18_4774\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Rapchercat-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Rapchercat-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aRapchercat|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41287:Player-11-0EA8EBE7:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Windrunner Spire]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157839,\"id\":\"s18_4775\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Velline-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Velline-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaVelline|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0E5A4F3F:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157855,\"id\":\"s18_4776\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Zanglar-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Zanglar-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dZanglar|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0EB1CCB2:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157865,\"id\":\"s18_4777\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"KulTiran\",\"name\":\"Ingoodtaste-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Ingoodtaste-Stormrage|h[|cffff7c0aIngoodtaste-Stormrage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-60-0E8FA2B4:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157888,\"id\":\"s18_4778\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: The Sunwell holds for now, only through the constant effort of its defenders. Should their strength waver...\",\"timestamp\":1772157895,\"id\":\"s18_4779\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Bishop Alonsus Faol has a plan to support those at the Sunwell. And to help Arator.\",\"timestamp\":1772157902,\"id\":\"s18_4780\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Starphage! We're going to save the Sunwell. More importantly, we're going to fix that broken young man.\",\"timestamp\":1772157903,\"id\":\"s18_4781\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Such a troubled boy. That'll happen when your father leaves a gaping wound in your chest. Not to worry--I have a plan.\",\"timestamp\":1772157908,\"id\":\"s18_4782\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Artis-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Artis-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Artis|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0E0798A6:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157925,\"id\":\"s18_4783\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Asking for me to inspire anyone? Faol always was an original thinker.\",\"timestamp\":1772157927,\"id\":\"s18_4784\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Go. Quickly--Liadrin needs urgent assistance with the Amani.\",\"timestamp\":1772157961,\"id\":\"s18_4785\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"KulTiran\",\"name\":\"Lacarei-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Lacarei-Tichondrius|h[|cff0070ddLacarei|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-11-0EB05C9E:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157964,\"id\":\"s18_4786\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Psychzz-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Psychzz-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eePsychzz|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0E30C009:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157967,\"id\":\"s18_4787\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Durfnn-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Durfnn-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dDurfnn|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-11-0E799EEA:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772157979,\"id\":\"s18_4788\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Ah good! You're both here. There is a crisis of faith that we need to fix!\",\"timestamp\":1772158017,\"id\":\"s18_4789\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ6:|Hitem:237811::::::::82:1480::11::1:28:3088:::::|h[Faol's Benediction]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772158020,\"id\":\"s18_4790\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: That's your solution? To zap them with your staff?\",\"timestamp\":1772158020,\"id\":\"s18_4791\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Hmmph. Those defenders have exhausted themselves, giving of their own faith and power. We bolster their reserves.\",\"timestamp\":1772158025,\"id\":\"s18_4792\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Prophet Velen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Prophet Velen yells: The Sunwell is a conduit for the Light! Made holy through the sacrifice of the naaru Mu'ru!\",\"timestamp\":1772158036,\"id\":\"s18_4793\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Snowshatter-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Snowshatter-Tichondrius:2046:GUILD:|h[|cffc41e3aSnowshatter|r]|h: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:265814::::::::82:251:::1:13639:1:28:3085:::::|h[Noble's Signet Ring]|h|r like treasures in panda\",\"timestamp\":1772158036,\"id\":\"s18_4794\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Prophet Velen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Prophet Velen yells: I know you are tired. It is hard to continue, but we must!\",\"timestamp\":1772158051,\"id\":\"s18_4795\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"General Amias Bellamy\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"General Amias Bellamy says: I'm worried that Void Elf might sneak back in here and disrupt our efforts at the Sunwell.\",\"timestamp\":1772158062,\"id\":\"s18_4796\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"War Chaplain Senn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"War Chaplain Senn says: I have marshalled what priests were available to ward against the Void. It won't repel the Devouring Host, but will prevent contamination from any undesirable mortals.\",\"timestamp\":1772158068,\"id\":\"s18_4797\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Durfnn-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Durfnn-Tichondrius:2050:GUILD:|h[|cffc69b6dDurfnn|r]|h: +1 nobility wtf is that lol\",\"timestamp\":1772158072,\"id\":\"s18_4798\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Prophet Velen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Prophet Velen yells: Should the Sunwell fall, we have no way to stop the Devouring Host!\",\"timestamp\":1772158084,\"id\":\"s18_4799\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Snowshatter-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Snowshatter-Tichondrius:2052:GUILD:|h[|cffc41e3aSnowshatter|r]|h: lol\",\"timestamp\":1772158084,\"id\":\"s18_4800\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Clearcast-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Clearcast-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebClearcast|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-11-0EAE0154:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158094,\"id\":\"s18_4801\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Durfnn-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Durfnn-Tichondrius:2054:GUILD:|h[|cffc69b6dDurfnn|r]|h: tryna farm my +1 aura ring\",\"timestamp\":1772158095,\"id\":\"s18_4802\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Prophet Velen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Prophet Velen yells: We have taken different paths to reach the Light, but together we assemble for the same purpose. To protect Azeroth!\",\"timestamp\":1772158114,\"id\":\"s18_4803\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: What if I promised that my task would take you far away from here?\",\"timestamp\":1772158136,\"id\":\"s18_4804\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:251274::::::::82:1480::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:82:28:3088:::::|h[Gloves of Renewal]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772158139,\"id\":\"s18_4805\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: You're creating a bigger cloud with your moping than Xal'atath's Voidstorm.\",\"timestamp\":1772158143,\"id\":\"s18_4806\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: To Light's Hope to gather relics and inspire the Vanguard.\",\"timestamp\":1772158146,\"id\":\"s18_4807\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Moistydank-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Moistydank-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Moistydank|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0E9CAA58:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158163,\"id\":\"s18_4808\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Mageyuya-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mageyuya-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebMageyuya|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0E97F286:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158174,\"id\":\"s18_4809\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Snowshatter-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Snowshatter-Tichondrius|h[|cffc41e3aSnowshatter|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0EAE839D:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158181,\"id\":\"s18_4810\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1772158229,\"id\":\"s18_4811\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Varamithis-Sargeras\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Varamithis-Sargeras|h[|cfff48cbaVaramithis-Sargeras|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41804:Player-76-095925CB:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[One Does Not Simply Walk Into Harandar]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158231,\"id\":\"s18_4812\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Climatechang-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Climatechang-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aClimatechang|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61836:Player-11-0E90740E:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 3]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158292,\"id\":\"s18_4813\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Lord Tyrosus, I had no idea things were so desperate. What can we do to help?\",\"timestamp\":1772158301,\"id\":\"s18_4814\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Maxwell Tyrosus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lord Maxwell Tyrosus says: With so many defenders called away to the Sunwell, the Scourge almost broke through to the chapel.\",\"timestamp\":1772158305,\"id\":\"s18_4815\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Durfnn-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Durfnn-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dDurfnn|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0E799EEA:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158306,\"id\":\"s18_4816\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Maxwell Tyrosus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lord Maxwell Tyrosus says: I've called for assistance from the Ebon Blade, but we could use your help pushing back this latest attack.\",\"timestamp\":1772158312,\"id\":\"s18_4817\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Clearcast-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Clearcast-Tichondrius:2102:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebClearcast|r]|h: already level 86's\",\"timestamp\":1772158330,\"id\":\"s18_4818\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Clearcast-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Clearcast-Tichondrius:2103:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebClearcast|r]|h: sheesh\",\"timestamp\":1772158331,\"id\":\"s18_4819\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I fear if I were stationed here to fight the Scourge, I'd become just like my fath--I'd fall to rage and wrath.\",\"timestamp\":1772158352,\"id\":\"s18_4820\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"KulTiran\",\"name\":\"Geòspàwn-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Geòspàwn-Tichondrius|h[|cff00ff98Geòspàwn|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:42191:Player-11-0E9C32EB:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Safer Deposit]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158353,\"id\":\"s18_4821\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Dolphinz-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Dolphinz-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eeDolphinz|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41805:Player-11-09C892D3:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Arator's Journey]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158359,\"id\":\"s18_4822\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Sanfu-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Sanfu-Tichondrius:2113:GUILD:|h[|cffffffffSanfu|r]|h: Actually insane. lol. I had to pause to play with my kid.\",\"timestamp\":1772158367,\"id\":\"s18_4823\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Snowshatter-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Snowshatter-Tichondrius:2114:GUILD:|h[|cffc41e3aSnowshatter|r]|h: there was a lvl 89 until blizz caught onto him\",\"timestamp\":1772158369,\"id\":\"s18_4824\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Tmpikaboo-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tmpikaboo-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Tmpikaboo|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0E82A933:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158373,\"id\":\"s18_4825\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Dexand-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Dexand-Tichondrius|h[|cffaad372Dexand|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:40463:Player-11-0E2B8100:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Delve Deepest]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158375,\"id\":\"s18_4826\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Dexand-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Dexand-Tichondrius|h[|cffaad372Dexand|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-11-0E2B8100:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158375,\"id\":\"s18_4827\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I shouldn't let my doubts get in the way of the defense of this place.\",\"timestamp\":1772158387,\"id\":\"s18_4828\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Light's Hope is in danger. The world is in danger. I need to get my head in the battle.\",\"timestamp\":1772158443,\"id\":\"s18_4829\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Maxwell Tyrosus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lord Maxwell Tyrosus says: Thank you. The Scourge has diminished. Take whatever relics you need to support the Sunwell.\",\"timestamp\":1772158455,\"id\":\"s18_4830\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:251719::::::::82:1480::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:82:28:3088:::::|h[Light's Hope Mantle]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772158459,\"id\":\"s18_4831\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: For my first lesson, learn from the revered heroes of the past and what inspired their Light.\",\"timestamp\":1772158460,\"id\":\"s18_4832\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: That's what I've been trying to do since I joined the Silver Hand.\",\"timestamp\":1772158469,\"id\":\"s18_4833\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I've known the stories of these paladins since I was a child.\",\"timestamp\":1772158482,\"id\":\"s18_4834\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Each of them is a legend immortalized in stone. Their great deeds set an example for all paladins.\",\"timestamp\":1772158487,\"id\":\"s18_4835\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: But no matter how hard I try... I fear that I'll never live up to them.\",\"timestamp\":1772158494,\"id\":\"s18_4836\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ6:|Hitem:237513::::::::82:1480:::::::::|h[Vindicator Maraad's Meditation Crystal]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772158505,\"id\":\"s18_4837\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Maraad was known for his skill in combat, yet his relic is a meditation crystal.\",\"timestamp\":1772158505,\"id\":\"s18_4838\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ6:|Hitem:237518::::::::82:1480:::::::::|h[Lena Stormpike's Stein]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772158514,\"id\":\"s18_4839\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Lena led an army against the Legion. Why would her relic be something like this?\",\"timestamp\":1772158514,\"id\":\"s18_4840\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I forgot that statue was here.\",\"timestamp\":1772158521,\"id\":\"s18_4841\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ6:|Hitem:237519::::::::82:1480:::::::::|h[Uther's Healing Kit]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772158525,\"id\":\"s18_4842\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Uther was the first and greatest of the Silver Hand Paladins. I'm surprised not to find his hammer, but a healing kit.\",\"timestamp\":1772158525,\"id\":\"s18_4843\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ6:|Hitem:237573::::::::82:1480:::::::::|h[Mara Fordragon's Prayer Book]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772158530,\"id\":\"s18_4844\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Mara's heroics inspired the creation of the Silver Hand. Her relic is a book of refugee prayers though.\",\"timestamp\":1772158531,\"id\":\"s18_4845\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ6:|Hitem:237574::::::::82:1480:::::::::|h[Krohm Dawnhammer's Smithing Hammer]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772158535,\"id\":\"s18_4846\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Krohm defended the people of Lordaeron. But the relic is a smithing hammer, not a weapon.\",\"timestamp\":1772158535,\"id\":\"s18_4847\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I had expected these relics to be powerful weapons.\",\"timestamp\":1772158539,\"id\":\"s18_4848\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Instead, they were mostly simple items, unconnected to war.\",\"timestamp\":1772158545,\"id\":\"s18_4849\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: The Silver Hand was founded to wield the Light in battle. Is that not the measure of a paladin's accomplishments?\",\"timestamp\":1772158550,\"id\":\"s18_4850\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Rapchercat-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Rapchercat-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aRapchercat|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-11-0EA8EBE7:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158563,\"id\":\"s18_4851\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: The most revered paladins didn't draw their faith in the Light from warfare. They fought to preserve what they valued most.\",\"timestamp\":1772158568,\"id\":\"s18_4852\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: The Scarlet Crusade? You, of all people, want to spread their Light?\",\"timestamp\":1772158572,\"id\":\"s18_4853\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I can scarcely believe that the Light answers their call.\",\"timestamp\":1772158578,\"id\":\"s18_4854\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: They claimed many relics when they seized my church. Relics that would be better used to our purpose of holding back Xal'atath.\",\"timestamp\":1772158579,\"id\":\"s18_4855\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I was always taught that the Light was good. The Crusade is... unconscionable.\",\"timestamp\":1772158583,\"id\":\"s18_4856\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: The Light seeks a path. It does not dictate the way.\",\"timestamp\":1772158589,\"id\":\"s18_4857\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Treesuh-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Treesuh-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aTreesuh|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0E53603A:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158591,\"id\":\"s18_4858\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: However... the relics they possess will do for our purposes of bolstering the Sunwell defenders.\",\"timestamp\":1772158675,\"id\":\"s18_4859\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: It... will be good to reclaim them.\",\"timestamp\":1772158676,\"id\":\"s18_4860\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: You're here, Starphage. We should join Arator inside. My sermon to these fanatics is falling on deaf ears.\",\"timestamp\":1772158679,\"id\":\"s18_4861\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: This place has all the trappings of the Church of Holy Light, but turned to an evil purpose.\",\"timestamp\":1772158703,\"id\":\"s18_4862\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Instructor Meyer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Instructor Meyer says: I'll show the initiates how one smites an unbeliever!\",\"timestamp\":1772158707,\"id\":\"s18_4863\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: That is my second lesson. The Light is channeled through belief and conviction. Even if they are misguided.\",\"timestamp\":1772158709,\"id\":\"s18_4864\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Claus-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Claus-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eeClaus|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0E5CD6EA:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158733,\"id\":\"s18_4865\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Instructor Meyer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Instructor Meyer says: Who will teach them... the Light's dictates?\",\"timestamp\":1772158735,\"id\":\"s18_4866\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ6:|Hitem:237579::::::::82:1480:::::::::|h[Meyer's Rod of Castigation]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772158736,\"id\":\"s18_4867\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 15 Gold, 52 Silver, 49 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1772158737,\"id\":\"s18_4868\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: Will these initiates forever call forth the Light through hatred?\",\"id\":\"s18_4869\",\"timestamp\":1772158744},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Recoveryee-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Recoveryee-Tichondrius|h[|cff0070ddRecoveryee|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-11-0A87223A:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158757,\"id\":\"s18_4870\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Footman\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Footman says: An outsider, here?\",\"timestamp\":1772158761,\"id\":\"s18_4871\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Mage\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Mage says: An outsider, here?\",\"timestamp\":1772158771,\"id\":\"s18_4872\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Mage\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Mage says: Benthar promised...\",\"timestamp\":1772158778,\"id\":\"s18_4873\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 3 Gold, 68 Silver, 95 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1772158783,\"id\":\"s18_4874\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Footman\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Footman says: You should fear the Light!\",\"timestamp\":1772158788,\"id\":\"s18_4875\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Champion Aelyse\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Champion Aelyse says: Intruders... So the time has come to die for the Crusade.\",\"timestamp\":1772158789,\"id\":\"s18_4876\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Footman\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Footman says: Foul heretic...\",\"timestamp\":1772158793,\"id\":\"s18_4877\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"name\":\"Tiivah-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tiivah-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dTiivah|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61310:Player-11-0E6BD6A1:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Casual Collector]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158798,\"id\":\"s18_4878\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Champion Aelyse\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Champion Aelyse yells: Wait! I yield! I lost my faith in this order long ago. I won't give my life for them as well.\",\"timestamp\":1772158814,\"id\":\"s18_4879\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:258855::::::::82:1480:::1:13611:2:9:82:28:3322:::::|h[Stained Armguards]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772158817,\"id\":\"s18_4880\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 2 Gold, 10 Silver, 11 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1772158818,\"id\":\"s18_4881\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Go! If you wish to surrender, give us your weapon, leave this accursed place, and never return.\",\"timestamp\":1772158822,\"id\":\"s18_4882\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Champion Aelyse\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Aelyse carefully hands her weapon to Arator.\",\"timestamp\":1772158826,\"id\":\"s18_4883\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ6:|Hitem:237761::::::::82:1480:::::::::|h[Aelyse's Gleaming Falchion]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772158830,\"id\":\"s18_4884\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"name\":\"Àshtray-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Àshtray-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaÀshtray|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:5794:Player-11-0EB1F2BC:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Time Flies When You're Having Fun]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158830,\"id\":\"s18_4885\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: This blade was forged long before the Crusade's hatred. Perhaps it can be returned to a wielder who is truly righteous.\",\"timestamp\":1772158833,\"id\":\"s18_4886\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Mvmnt-MoonGuard\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mvmnt-MoonGuard|h[|cffff7c0aMvmnt-MoonGuard|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-3675-0AC0F600:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158834,\"id\":\"s18_4887\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Cleric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Cleric says: You should fear the Light!\",\"timestamp\":1772158842,\"id\":\"s18_4888\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Mage\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Mage says: An outsider, here?\",\"timestamp\":1772158842,\"id\":\"s18_4889\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Footman\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Footman says: How could...\",\"timestamp\":1772158848,\"id\":\"s18_4890\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Footman\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Footman says: The Light... failed?\",\"timestamp\":1772158848,\"id\":\"s18_4891\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Mage\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Mage says: Foul heretic...\",\"timestamp\":1772158852,\"id\":\"s18_4892\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Cleric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Cleric says: Benthar promised...\",\"timestamp\":1772158852,\"id\":\"s18_4893\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Footman\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Footman says: An outsider, here?\",\"timestamp\":1772158859,\"id\":\"s18_4894\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Footman\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Footman says: You should fear the Light!\",\"timestamp\":1772158859,\"id\":\"s18_4895\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Cleric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Cleric says: How could...\",\"timestamp\":1772158861,\"id\":\"s18_4896\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Mage\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Mage says: The Light... failed?\",\"timestamp\":1772158863,\"id\":\"s18_4897\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Mage\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Mage says: The Crusade shall prevail!\",\"timestamp\":1772158864,\"id\":\"s18_4898\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Cleric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Cleric says: The Crusade shall prevail!\",\"timestamp\":1772158865,\"id\":\"s18_4899\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Mage\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Mage says: An outsider, here?\",\"timestamp\":1772158865,\"id\":\"s18_4900\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Cleric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Cleric says: An outsider, here?\",\"timestamp\":1772158865,\"id\":\"s18_4901\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scarlet Cleric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Scarlet Cleric says: Benthar promised...\",\"timestamp\":1772158881,\"id\":\"s18_4902\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:258854::::::::82:1480:::1:13611:2:9:82:28:3322:::::|h[Stained Pauldrons]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772158888,\"id\":\"s18_4903\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:258871::::::::82:1480:::1:13611:2:9:82:28:3322:::::|h[Brittle Armplates]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772158888,\"id\":\"s18_4904\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 12 Gold, 1 Silver, 98 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1772158889,\"id\":\"s18_4905\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Abbot Benthar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Abbot Benthar says: The Light will choose... a new leader... for our crusade...\",\"timestamp\":1772158917,\"id\":\"s18_4906\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ6:|Hitem:237576::::::::82:1480:::::::::|h[Benthar's Scarlet Spire]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772158918,\"id\":\"s18_4907\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 2 Gold, 85 Silver, 64 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1772158919,\"id\":\"s18_4908\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: It never ends, does it? Another will just continue this doctrine of spite.\",\"timestamp\":1772158920,\"id\":\"s18_4909\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Arator, the Light may empower its followers, but the morals and ethics of this force come from within each of us.\",\"timestamp\":1772158926,\"id\":\"s18_4910\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:251725::::::::82:1480::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:82:28:3088:::::|h[Repurposed Scarlet Axe]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772158938,\"id\":\"s18_4911\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Is this the fate of all paladins? Die a legend or live to be consumed by zealotry and wrath?\",\"timestamp\":1772158939,\"id\":\"s18_4912\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: No, Arator. My hope is that you can find a different path to follow.\",\"timestamp\":1772158946,\"id\":\"s18_4913\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"ßigßrain-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:ßigßrain-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dßigßrain|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-11-0E43E93E:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772158970,\"id\":\"s18_4914\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I can't face those gathered at the Sunwell right now.\",\"timestamp\":1772158974,\"id\":\"s18_4915\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Arator, I did not mean to add to your burdens. The trip to the cathedral was necessary to save the Sunwell.\",\"timestamp\":1772158977,\"id\":\"s18_4916\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Starphage, if you could deliver the relics. I need to have a word in private with Arator.\",\"timestamp\":1772158987,\"id\":\"s18_4917\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Salandria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Salandria says: Thank you, Starphage. I can feel its energy already. I'll use it well.\",\"timestamp\":1772158998,\"id\":\"s18_4918\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mehlar Dawnblade\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mehlar Dawnblade says: For years, Starphage, I was bitter with Uther for having trained Arthas, but he forgave me. Even that upset me.\",\"timestamp\":1772159032,\"id\":\"s18_4919\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Taelia Fordragon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Taelia Fordragon says: Wha... that's unbelievable. She was my grandmother. She watched over refugees fleeing from Stormwind to Lordaeron.\",\"timestamp\":1772159038,\"id\":\"s18_4920\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valunei\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valunei says: Maraad was a hero to our people, Starphage. I can feel his Light--it still remains in the crystal.\",\"timestamp\":1772159040,\"id\":\"s18_4921\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Prophet Velen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Prophet Velen says: Thank you, Starphage. We are resolute in our defense, but mortal in our constitutions. These relics will bolster us for a time.\",\"timestamp\":1772159050,\"id\":\"s18_4922\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Commander Venel Lightblood\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Commander Venel Lightblood says: I appreciate your concerns, Koruth. For my people, the Light and the Sunwell are the same. They may complain, but they will accept the Vanguard.\",\"timestamp\":1772159058,\"id\":\"s18_4923\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: With the relics delivered, the Sunwell is safe, for now.\",\"timestamp\":1772159067,\"id\":\"s18_4924\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:257240::::::::82:1480::11::1:28:872:::::|h[Relinquished Scarlet Charger]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772159071,\"id\":\"s18_4925\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: I spoke to you of finding a different path, Arator. I think it's time we started on it.\",\"timestamp\":1772159073,\"id\":\"s18_4926\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: All right... But if this lesson is anything like the others--\",\"timestamp\":1772159081,\"id\":\"s18_4927\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Oh, don't worry. This one won't be imparted by me.\",\"timestamp\":1772159086,\"id\":\"s18_4928\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"UNKNOWN\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_BN_WHISPER_INFORM\",\"type\":\"BN_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.9647059440612793},\"text\":\"To [???]: P\",\"timestamp\":1772159100,\"id\":\"s18_4929\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Lìqur-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Lìqur-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Lìqur|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-11-0E4CFEF3:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772159110,\"id\":\"s18_4930\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Cabelas-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Cabelas-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dCabelas|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-11-0E28B0F4:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772159133,\"id\":\"s18_4931\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Hammerfall? Is this about the Red Dawn?\",\"timestamp\":1772159140,\"id\":\"s18_4932\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Quite the opposite. We're going to see someone who is doing something wonderful. Something I failed to accomplish.\",\"timestamp\":1772159144,\"id\":\"s18_4933\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sunwalker Dezco\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Sunwalker Dezco says: One moment--t