ame\":\"Danath Trollbane\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Danath Trollbane says: I've found the leader of the Dark Horde. She has the final fragment.\",\"timestamp\":1772160607,\"id\":\"s19_2579\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"name\":\"Mookiemagi-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mookiemagi-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebMookiemagi|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:19459:Player-11-0E5B9C4D:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Level 80]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772160610,\"id\":\"s19_2580\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Danath Trollbane\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Danath Trollbane says: The Dark Horde prepares to raid another border settlement. Get that last shield fragment and scatter their troops.\",\"timestamp\":1772160613,\"id\":\"s19_2581\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: The Second War ended decades ago. I won't let them shatter the peace you bled for.\",\"timestamp\":1772160622,\"id\":\"s19_2582\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1772160640,\"id\":\"s19_2583\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"ra