]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772160869,\"id\":\"s19_2609\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Danath Trollbane\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Danath Trollbane says: I can see you've figured out why Faol's brought you here.\",\"timestamp\":1772160873,\"id\":\"s19_2610\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:251824::::::::82:1480::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:82:28:3088:::::|h[Dark Horde Cowl]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772160874,\"id\":\"s19_2611\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: This is my father's shield, isn't it? How did it break?\",\"timestamp\":1772160876,\"id\":\"s19_2612\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Dprh-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Dprh-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Dprh|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41803:Player-11-0EA1AF2F:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[For Zul'Aman!]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772160877,\"id\":\"s19_2613\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Xzaelpal-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Xzaelpal-Tichondrius:2765:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaXzaelpal|r]|h: is there a way to turn off this buff \\\"dressed in minning gear\\\"\",\"timestamp\":1772160881,\"id\":\"s19_2614\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eitrigg\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Eitrigg says: If the boy has all the fragments of the shield, we can begin.\",\"timestamp\":1772160882,\"id\":\"s19_2615\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: As you have guessed, that is your father's shield. Broken into fragments and left on the field of battle.\",\"timestamp\":1772160883,\"id\":\"s19_2616\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Danath Trollbane\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Danath Trollbane says: I still have nightmares about that time. After all I've seen, I still dream about this place.\",\"timestamp\":1772160885,\"id\":\"s19_2617\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Qtlolxdfurry-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Qtlolxdfurry-Tichondrius:2776:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aQtlolxdfurry|r]|h: yes\",\"timestamp\":1772160922,\"id\":\"s19_2618\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"name\":\"Minotaur-Bonechewer\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Minotaur-Bonechewer:2777:GUILD:|h[|cffc69b6dMinotaur|r]|h: yeah, you gotta talk to someone but i dont know who\",\"timestamp\":1772160923,\"id\":\"s19_2619\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Qtlolxdfurry-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Qtlolxdfurry-Tichondrius:2778:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aQtlolxdfurry|r]|h: you can talk to the cow in dornogal by the crafting station\",\"timestamp\":1772160936,\"id\":\"s19_2620\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Qtlolxdfurry-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Qtlolxdfurry-Tichondrius:2779:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aQtlolxdfurry|r]|h: can turn off fishing and gathering gear showing\",\"timestamp\":1772160960,\"id\":\"s19_2621\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Buju-BleedingHollow\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Buju-BleedingHollow|h[|cff0070ddBuju-BleedingHollow|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-73-0E2D145C:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772160972,\"id\":\"s19_2622\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Treesuh-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Treesuh-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aTreesuh|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61835:Player-11-0E53603A:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 2]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772160998,\"id\":\"s19_2623\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I had no idea. I didn't realize what my father went through.\",\"timestamp\":1772161003,\"id\":\"s19_2624\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: If I repair the shield, maybe it can remind my father of the kind of paladin he wanted to be.\",\"timestamp\":1772161009,\"id\":\"s19_2625\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I think... I think I'd like to fix this shield, and return it to him.\",\"timestamp\":1772161012,\"id\":\"s19_2626\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: That is an excellent idea.\",\"timestamp\":1772161013,\"id\":\"s19_2627\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kurdran Wildhammer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kurdran Wildhammer says: Faol, I hope you know what you are doing.\",\"timestamp\":1772161017,\"id\":\"s19_2628\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Starphage, please join me at the forge. I'll need your help with the shield.\",\"timestamp\":1772161030,\"id\":\"s19_2629\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Starphage! I was just about to begin. It will be a test of skill, but I can repair this.\",\"timestamp\":1772161039,\"id\":\"s19_2630\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: I'll pull Turalyon away from his duties. Not an easy feat by any means.\",\"timestamp\":1772161041,\"id\":\"s19_2631\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: It will give Arator time to finish reforging his father's shield. He could use your assistance.\",\"timestamp\":1772161048,\"id\":\"s19_2632\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Let's do this! I'll hammer, you control the heat!\",\"timestamp\":1772161060,\"id\":\"s19_2633\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Add some wyrmdust to make it more powerful.\",\"timestamp\":1772161066,\"id\":\"s19_2634\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: It's too hot! Pour some water on the shield to cool it.\",\"timestamp\":1772161075,\"id\":\"s19_2635\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_RAID_BOSS_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_BOSS_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.8666667342185974,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"That wasn't right. Let's try again.\",\"timestamp\":1772161078,\"id\":\"s19_2636\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Stop! The temperature isn't right. Let's start over. Tell me when you're ready.\",\"timestamp\":1772161079,\"id\":\"s19_2637\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Voidwhispèr-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Voidwhispèr-Area52:2814:GUILD:|h[|cffa330c9Voidwhispèr|r]|h: gonna crash for the night, gonna go degen mode tomorrow. night all\",\"timestamp\":1772161085,\"id\":\"s19_2638\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Add some wyrmdust to make it more powerful.\",\"timestamp\":1772161094,\"id\":\"s19_2639\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: It's too hot! Pour some water on the shield to cool it.\",\"timestamp\":1772161102,\"id\":\"s19_2640\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I need another steel ingot.\",\"timestamp\":1772161111,\"id\":\"s19_2641\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Add a phoenix feather to increase the heat.\",\"timestamp\":1772161120,\"id\":\"s19_2642\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Durfnn-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Durfnn-Tichondrius:2819:GUILD:|h[|cffc69b6dDurfnn|r]|h: zzz already behind\",\"timestamp\":1772161122,\"id\":\"s19_2643\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Shookone-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Shookone-Area52:2820:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeShookone|r]|h: enchant mats are selling for 8k lmao\",\"timestamp\":1772161130,\"id\":\"s19_2644\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Why do you still have the shield? Didn't you give it to your father?\",\"timestamp\":1772161185,\"id\":\"s19_2645\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Swagchecked-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Swagchecked-Tichondrius:2822:GUILD:|h[|cffffffffSwagchecked|r]|h: yo ret paladins are broken\",\"timestamp\":1772161246,\"id\":\"s19_2646\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"name\":\"Tiivah-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tiivah-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dTiivah|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61856:Player-11-0E6BD6A1:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Explore Zul'Aman]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161273,\"id\":\"s19_2647\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Blueberryzyn-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Blueberryzyn-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffBlueberryzyn|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41287:Player-11-0E9901D7:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Windrunner Spire]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161309,\"id\":\"s19_2648\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"name\":\"Frostyfries-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Frostyfries-Tichondrius|h[|cffc41e3aFrostyfries|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-11-0E83AB7E:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161322,\"id\":\"s19_2649\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I did. He said \\\"some things can't ever be redeemed\\\" and refused it.\",\"timestamp\":1772161338,\"id\":\"s19_2650\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Starphage! I was just about to begin. It will be a test of skill, but I can repair this.\",\"timestamp\":1772161341,\"id\":\"s19_2651\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: That's... disappointing. I had hoped for a different reaction.\",\"timestamp\":1772161344,\"id\":\"s19_2652\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: So did I... but a wise man once told me \\\"I can't change anything but how I feel.\\\"\",\"timestamp\":1772161351,\"id\":\"s19_2653\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: So I'm going to focus on that. My father may not be ready to change, but I am.\",\"timestamp\":1772161358,\"id\":\"s19_2654\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Arator... Light be praised, perhaps this all happened for a reason.\",\"timestamp\":1772161363,\"id\":\"s19_2655\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I just need to figure out what to do with this shield.\",\"timestamp\":1772161372,\"id\":\"s19_2656\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kurdran Wildhammer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kurdran Wildhammer says: I could use a hot meal and a drink while you ponder. Come with us, lad. You too, Starphage.\",\"timestamp\":1772161375,\"id\":\"s19_2657\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: I must return to the Sunwell. The Vanguard needs my counsel.\",\"timestamp\":1772161383,\"id\":\"s19_2658\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:248131::::::::82:1480::11::1:28:3088:::::|h[Key to the Arcantina]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772161394,\"id\":\"s19_2659\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Danath Trollbane\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Danath Trollbane says: Honestly, Arator, we've wanted to show you the place for some time. Glad to finally get the chance.\",\"timestamp\":1772161398,\"id\":\"s19_2660\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Treesuh-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Treesuh-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aTreesuh|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61836:Player-11-0E53603A:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 3]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161409,\"id\":\"s19_2661\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Where is this place? It doesn't appear to be in Azeroth.\",\"timestamp\":1772161423,\"id\":\"s19_2662\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kurdran Wildhammer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kurdran Wildhammer says: Khadgar introduced us. It's in some wizardy, hocus-pocus, dimensional whatzzuhthing. Hot food, cold drinks, magical access.\",\"timestamp\":1772161429,\"id\":\"s19_2663\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"Goblin\",\"name\":\"Couchnaps-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Couchnaps-Tichondrius|h[|cff0070ddCouchnaps|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41805:Player-11-0E48F64B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Arator's Journey]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161437,\"id\":\"s19_2664\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Danath Trollbane\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Danath Trollbane says: Starphage, could you get us the first round? Put it on my tab.\",\"timestamp\":1772161441,\"id\":\"s19_2665\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:2460::::::::82:1480:::::::::|h[Elixir of Tongues]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772161441,\"id\":\"s19_2666\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:254838::::::::82:1480:::::::::|h[A Round of Drinks]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772161444,\"id\":\"s19_2667\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kurdran Wildhammer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kurdran Wildhammer says: ...and so I said, \\\"If that's my gryphon, who's sitting on the egg?\\\"\",\"timestamp\":1772161446,\"id\":\"s19_2668\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Danath Trollbane\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Danath Trollbane says: Arator, what are you going to do with Turalyon's shield?\",\"timestamp\":1772161451,\"id\":\"s19_2669\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eitrigg\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Eitrigg says: Take a look around. Horde, Alliance... this place is a refuge for those who've had enough of war.\",\"timestamp\":1772161452,\"id\":\"s19_2670\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Ha! Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!\",\"timestamp\":1772161452,\"id\":\"s19_2671\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eitrigg\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Eitrigg says: Pfffft--Sitting on the egg! HA!\",\"timestamp\":1772161452,\"id\":\"s19_2672\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Danath Trollbane\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Danath Trollbane says: Ha ha ha--that doesn't make any sense. Ha ha ha.\",\"timestamp\":1772161452,\"id\":\"s19_2673\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kurdran Wildhammer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kurdran Wildhammer says: HA! Ha ha ha ha!\",\"timestamp\":1772161452,\"id\":\"s19_2674\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:40195::::::::82:1480:::::::::|h[Pygmy Oil]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772161467,\"id\":\"s19_2675\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Well... I've been giving it some thought. I'd like to hang it on the wall here. As a reminder.\",\"timestamp\":1772161475,\"id\":\"s19_2676\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Demmonlock-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Demmonlock-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eeDemmonlock|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41805:Player-11-0A45A39F:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Arator's Journey]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161479,\"id\":\"s19_2677\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Fireysquirts-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Fireysquirts-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebFireysquirts|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-11-0E013D50:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161480,\"id\":\"s19_2678\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: We can all break, but we can put ourselves back together, and emerge stronger for it.\",\"timestamp\":1772161482,\"id\":\"s19_2679\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"name\":\"Hësher-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Hësher-Tichondrius|h[|cffaad372Hësher|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41805:Player-11-0EA16CD0:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Arator's Journey]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161483,\"id\":\"s19_2680\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Kronuts-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kronuts-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Kronuts|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41805:Player-11-0EB1FBC2:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Arator's Journey]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161486,\"id\":\"s19_2681\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Kronuts-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kronuts-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Kronuts|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:506:Player-11-0EB1FBC2:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[500 Quests Completed]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161486,\"id\":\"s19_2682\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Unclechip-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Unclechip-Tichondrius|h[|cffc41e3aUnclechip|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61576:Player-11-0DD3A416:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong Woods Glyph Hunter]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161486,\"id\":\"s19_2683\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kurdran Wildhammer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kurdran Wildhammer says: Bah! Terrible idea! Worst I've ever heard.\",\"timestamp\":1772161489,\"id\":\"s19_2684\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kurdran Wildhammer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kurdran Wildhammer says: To have a fine piece of equipment like that, well made, well repaired, languish on the wall until it rusts? That's shameful.\",\"timestamp\":1772161494,\"id\":\"s19_2685\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Dabearnoob-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Dabearnoob-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aDabearnoob|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41805:Player-11-0EA4528E:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Arator's Journey]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161501,\"id\":\"s19_2686\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Danath Trollbane\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Danath Trollbane says: He has a point, lad. A good shield like that yearns to protect a soldier, so they can protect others.\",\"timestamp\":1772161504,\"id\":\"s19_2687\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I... But it's not my shield.\",\"timestamp\":1772161513,\"id\":\"s19_2688\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Rasvan-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Rasvan-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aRasvan|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41805:Player-11-0EA02CED:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Arator's Journey]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161515,\"id\":\"s19_2689\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eitrigg\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Eitrigg says: Your father refused the legacy. It's yours if you want it.\",\"timestamp\":1772161516,\"id\":\"s19_2690\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: It does feel right.\",\"timestamp\":1772161521,\"id\":\"s19_2691\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I'll do it. Faol told me that the Silver Hand was meant to protect the defenseless, during war as well as peace.\",\"timestamp\":1772161525,\"id\":\"s19_2692\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Maybe I can help to demonstrate that service to others, as Dezco has. This reforged shield can be a reminder to me, as I protect Azeroth.\",\"timestamp\":1772161534,\"id\":\"s19_2693\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Thank you. All of you. I won't let you down.\",\"timestamp\":1772161545,\"id\":\"s19_2694\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"DarkIronDwarf\",\"name\":\"Zapstrike-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Zapstrike-Stormrage|h[|cff0070ddZapstrike-Stormrage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41805:Player-60-0EE20573:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Arator's Journey]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161550,\"id\":\"s19_2695\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:253629::::::::82:1480::11::1:28:3088:::::|h[Personal Key to the Arcantina]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772161555,\"id\":\"s19_2696\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Starphage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41805:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Arator's Journey]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161555,\"id\":\"s19_2697\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Starphage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41805:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Arator's Journey]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161555,\"id\":\"s19_2698\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Thank you for helping me, Starphage. I think that our presence has been missed in Silvermoon. We should return.\",\"timestamp\":1772161557,\"id\":\"s19_2699\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Starphage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:11176:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Remember to Share]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161559,\"id\":\"s19_2700\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Starphage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:11176:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Remember to Share]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161559,\"id\":\"s19_2701\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Rangoons-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Rangoons-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Rangoons|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41805:Player-11-0E2F2D8D:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Arator's Journey]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161565,\"id\":\"s19_2702\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eitrigg\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Eitrigg says: The Sons of Lothar will stay here for a bit. The Arcantina needs our protection. Or at least I need another round.\",\"timestamp\":1772161566,\"id\":\"s19_2703\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Leamillion-Trollbane\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Leamillion-Trollbane|h[|cfffff468Leamillion-Trollbane|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-1175-0E2BEE41:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161571,\"id\":\"s19_2704\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"name\":\"Jeeun-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Jeeun-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebJeeun|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41805:Player-11-0E90F30C:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Arator's Journey]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161574,\"id\":\"s19_2705\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Gatoon-Trollbane\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Gatoon-Trollbane|h[|cffc69b6dGatoon-Trollbane|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-1175-0ED95F3D:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772161588,\"id\":\"s19_2706\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: I've received reports from the Sunwell that Faol's plan has worked. The defenders hold back the Voidstorm another day.\",\"id\":\"s19_2707\",\"timestamp\":1772161625},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Ðrex-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Ðrex-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eeÐrex|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0E307193:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2708\",\"timestamp\":1772161629},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: We can't defend against both the Voidstorm and the aggression from the Lightbloom.\",\"id\":\"s19_2709\",\"timestamp\":1772161633},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Endmins-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Endmins-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaEndmins|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0EB161E4:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2710\",\"timestamp\":1772161637},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Halduron has joined your haranir friend to aid in ending the threat. They await you in Fairbreeze.\",\"id\":\"s19_2711\",\"timestamp\":1772161638},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Buzek-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Buzek-Tichondrius:2923:GUILD:|h[|cfffff468Buzek|r]|h: lets goo ty ben\",\"id\":\"s19_2712\",\"timestamp\":1772161658},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Benbreeze-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Benbreeze-Tichondrius:2924:GUILD:|h[|cffa330c9Benbreeze|r]|h: np bro\",\"id\":\"s19_2713\",\"timestamp\":1772161670},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Ultrafather-MoonGuard\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Ultrafather-MoonGuard|h[|cffff7c0aUltrafather-MoonGuard|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-3675-0AFC8411:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2714\",\"timestamp\":1772161710},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Over here, Starphage! The situation is... escalating.\",\"id\":\"s19_2715\",\"timestamp\":1772161738},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: There is no need for further bloodshed. Cease your raids, surrender the lightwood, and return to your lands.\",\"id\":\"s19_2716\",\"timestamp\":1772161740},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: You will take de lightwood over my grave, gokinye. Lightwood weapons are--\",\"id\":\"s19_2717\",\"timestamp\":1772161750},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: A void beast! Look out!\",\"id\":\"s19_2718\",\"timestamp\":1772161758},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: Warriors, attack!\",\"id\":\"s19_2719\",\"timestamp\":1772161763},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mor'duun\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Mor'duun yells: Destroy the Amani! Break them! Sow chaos for the glory of Xal'atath!\",\"id\":\"s19_2720\",\"timestamp\":1772161769},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Kilroe-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kilroe-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Kilroe|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41287:Player-11-0DFEA960:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Windrunner Spire]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2721\",\"timestamp\":1772161788},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Swagchecked-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Swagchecked-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffSwagchecked|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:10686:Player-11-0EB2269B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Fashionista: Waist]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2722\",\"timestamp\":1772161814},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Warglaives has increased to 415.\",\"id\":\"s19_2723\",\"timestamp\":1772161841},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Allow us passage into Zul'Aman! We cannot sit idle while the Twilight amass close to our border!\",\"id\":\"s19_2724\",\"timestamp\":1772161845},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Your border? Hah. If you want to die in Zul'Aman to de Twilight's Blade, I won't stop you--but your army stays here.\",\"id\":\"s19_2725\",\"timestamp\":1772161854},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Knights, stay and guard Eversong. Let us follow them, Starphage.\",\"id\":\"s19_2726\",\"timestamp\":1772161865},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Cabelas-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Cabelas-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dCabelas|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41287:Player-11-0E28B0F4:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Windrunner Spire]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2727\",\"timestamp\":1772161928},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mor'duun\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Mor'duun yells: Wail in anguish! Let Xal'atath hear your cries as your city burns!\",\"id\":\"s19_2728\",\"timestamp\":1772161931},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: When de wardrums sound, reinforcements will rally at de center altar, Jan.\",\"id\":\"s19_2729\",\"timestamp\":1772161937},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Varamithis-Sargeras\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Varamithis-Sargeras|h[|cfff48cbaVaramithis-Sargeras|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62388:Player-76-095925CB:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Illicit Rain: Five Stars]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2730\",\"timestamp\":1772161939},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: You would let gokinye, the invaders, fight in Atal'Aman?\",\"id\":\"s19_2731\",\"timestamp\":1772161941},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: I can help you if you allow it, Zul'jarra. Find me once you have finished your mission, Starphage.\",\"id\":\"s19_2732\",\"timestamp\":1772161943},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Tiivah-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tiivah-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dTiivah|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41803:Player-11-0E6BD6A1:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[For Zul'Aman