999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Mor'duun yells: Killing my portal mages gets you nothing! We will still trample your pathetic swamp-city!\",\"id\":\"s19_2928\",\"timestamp\":1772164998},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 87 Silver, 42 Copper\",\"id\":\"s19_2929\",\"timestamp\":1772165000},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Torundo, hold here until Zul'jan fires, den leave with de survivors in de confusion.\",\"id\":\"s19_2930\",\"timestamp\":1772165010},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:260470::::::::83:1480::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:83:28:3086:::::|h[Bloodspattered Bindings]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_2931\",\"timestamp\":1772165013},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Torundo the Grizzled\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Torundo the Grizzled says: We will fly on de winds of Akil'zon--like in de olden days.\",\"id\":\"s19_2932\",\"timestamp\":1772165016},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264257::::::::83:1480::11::1:28:3086:::::|h[Zul'Aman Armament Rest]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_2933\",\"timestamp\":1772165017},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: With me, elf. Let's get in close and distract him.\",\"id\":\"s19_2934\",\"timestamp\":1772165024},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mor'duun\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Mor'duun yells: Mere mortal-born armaments cannot harm the grand glory of Xal'atath!\",\"id\":\"s19_2935\",\"timestamp\":1772165026},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: Get over here, Starphage! I'll load de bolts. You start firing.\",\"id\":\"s19_2936\",\"timestamp\":1772165028},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mor'duun\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Mor'duun yells: GRAH! Your weapons are empowered with Light?\",\"id\":\"s19_2937\",\"timestamp\":1772165043},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Varamithis-Sargeras\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Varamithis-Sargeras|h[|cfff48cbaVaramithis-Sargeras|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41805:Player-76-095925CB:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Arator's Journey]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2938\",\"timestamp\":1772165054},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: Warriors, attack!\",\"id\":\"s19_2939\",\"timestamp\":1772165061},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: Running away? Coward. De victory should have been ours!\",\"id\":\"s19_2940\",\"timestamp\":1772165096},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Dis was no victory. We bought de civilians' escape with blood.\",\"id\":\"s19_2941\",\"timestamp\":1772165102},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver says: I have arrived.\",\"id\":\"s19_2942\",\"timestamp\":1772165107},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jan's eyes glow with the desire for vengeance.\",\"id\":\"s19_2943\",\"timestamp\":1772165108},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Xenosky-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Xenosky-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Xenosky|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-11-0BD1CA14:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2944\",\"timestamp\":1772165117},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Cabelas-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Cabelas-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dCabelas|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0E28B0F4:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2945\",\"timestamp\":1772165120},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Renewmedaddy-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Renewmedaddy-Stormrage|h[|cffff7c0aRenewmedaddy-Stormrage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62388:Player-60-0FE30D1E:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Illicit Rain: Five Stars]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2946\",\"timestamp\":1772165124},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Benbreeze-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Benbreeze-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Benbreeze|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41805:Player-11-0EB1FD5D:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Arator's Journey]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2947\",\"timestamp\":1772165141},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:248564::::::::83:1480::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:83:28:3086:::::|h[Zulguard's Stompers]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_2948\",\"timestamp\":1772165145},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: If we help eliminate the Twilight's Blade, the need for lightwood, and the raids into Eversong, will end.\",\"id\":\"s19_2949\",\"timestamp\":1772165148},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: We can end de threat inside and outside our gates. If you really want to join our fight, then come with me.\",\"id\":\"s19_2950\",\"timestamp\":1772165156},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: For your own safety, I suggest you keep your blade sheathed and stay close to me in Amani'Zar.\",\"id\":\"s19_2951\",\"timestamp\":1772165179},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Laceyna-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Laceyna-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffLaceyna|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62388:Player-11-0E5B24C4:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Illicit Rain: Five Stars]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2952\",\"timestamp\":1772165182},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Moistydank-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Moistydank-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Moistydank|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62388:Player-11-0E9CAA58:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Illicit Rain: Five Stars]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2953\",\"timestamp\":1772165182},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Come with me. De leaders of de forest tribes have gathered to discuss our war plan.\",\"id\":\"s19_2954\",\"timestamp\":1772165182},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: Where were all of you when de drums sounded? You let Atal'Aman fall!\",\"id\":\"s19_2955\",\"timestamp\":1772165215},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Atal'Aman has fallen.\",\"id\":\"s19_2956\",\"timestamp\":1772165226},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: No thanks to all of you!\",\"id\":\"s19_2957\",\"timestamp\":1772165229},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: We are under attack. De Vilebranch--\",\"id\":\"s19_2958\",\"timestamp\":1772165232},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: No time for barin' our tusks. We need a plan. Torundo?\",\"id\":\"s19_2959\",\"timestamp\":1772165235},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"UNKNOWN\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_BN_WHISPER_INFORM\",\"type\":\"BN_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.9647059440612793,\"g\":1,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"To [???]: pussy ass bitch\",\"id\":\"s19_2960\",\"timestamp\":1772165237},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Torundo the Grizzled\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Torundo the Grizzled says: Not many Amani made it back here.\",\"id\":\"s19_2961\",\"timestamp\":1772165241},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lilaju\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lilaju says: De Revantusk also suffered heavy losses.\",\"id\":\"s19_2962\",\"timestamp\":1772165244},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Tak'lejo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Tak'lejo says: I have sent out a call to my people. We will see.\",\"id\":\"s19_2963\",\"timestamp\":1772165248},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Forgive me...\",\"id\":\"s19_2964\",\"timestamp\":1772165252},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: But what about the loa? Can you not call upon them to aid you?\",\"id\":\"s19_2965\",\"timestamp\":1772165253},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Torundo the Grizzled\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Torundo the Grizzled says: De loa? Dey abandoned us long ago.\",\"id\":\"s19_2966\",\"timestamp\":1772165257},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: We never needed them. We can rely on our own strength!\",\"id\":\"s19_2967\",\"timestamp\":1772165261},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: I ask again for your assistance. We've got to make a stand.\",\"id\":\"s19_2968\",\"timestamp\":1772165267},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Make ready what you can.\",\"id\":\"s19_2969\",\"timestamp\":1772165271},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Ultrafather-MoonGuard\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Ultrafather-MoonGuard:3424:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aUltrafather|r]|h: WELCOME!\",\"id\":\"s19_2970\",\"timestamp\":1772165275},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: No point in talkin' about de loa. Dey abandoned us long ago. Come. Let us check on de refugees.\",\"id\":\"s19_2971\",\"timestamp\":1772165282},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Nightborne\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Nonesséntial-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Nonesséntial-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffNonesséntial|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62388:Player-11-0BBDF863:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Illicit Rain: Five Stars]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2972\",\"timestamp\":1772165288},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: Your forces are needed here, Kul'amara.\",\"id\":\"s19_2973\",\"timestamp\":1772165288},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"LightforgedDraenei\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Sneakybution-Ysondre\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Sneakybution-Ysondre|h[|cfff48cbaSneakybution-Ysondre|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-78-0FAC896B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2974\",\"timestamp\":1772165290},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: Den stop de Vilebranch from kidnappin' us in de middle of de night!\",\"id\":\"s19_2975\",\"timestamp\":1772165293},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jan scowls at Kul'amara angrily.\",\"id\":\"s19_2976\",\"timestamp\":1772165299},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Bombadilo-Gilneas\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Bombadilo-Gilneas|h[|cff00ff98Bombadilo-Gilneas|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41287:Player-67-0A795585:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Windrunner Spire]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2977\",\"timestamp\":1772165320},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Small Refugee\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Small Refugee says: Mama! I'm so hungry...\",\"id\":\"s19_2978\",\"timestamp\":1772165331},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Torundo, I need ya report. When can our soldiers be ready for battle?\",\"id\":\"s19_2979\",\"timestamp\":1772165332},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Your people's situation is far more desperate than I realized.\",\"id\":\"s19_2980\",\"timestamp\":1772165339},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Torundo the Grizzled\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Torundo the Grizzled says: It don't look good. All that's left be de old, de injured, and de hungry.\",\"id\":\"s19_2981\",\"timestamp\":1772165341},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lilaju\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lilaju says: De Revantusk's best smiths be repairing our weapons, Zul'jarra.\",\"id\":\"s19_2982\",\"timestamp\":1772165346},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lilaju\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lilaju says: We are workin' as fast as we can. But many of our weapons were broken in de attack.\",\"id\":\"s19_2983\",\"timestamp\":1772165349},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Parryhadder-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Parryhadder-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebParryhadder|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0EA2B21A:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2984\",\"timestamp\":1772165352},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Keep it up. These weapons are our best chance against de Void.\",\"id\":\"s19_2985\",\"timestamp\":1772165356},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Tak'lejo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Tak'lejo says: Ah, Zul'jarra. You come seeking de power of my tribe's shamans?\",\"id\":\"s19_2986\",\"timestamp\":1772165359},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Tak'lejo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Tak'lejo says: You know none can order de Shadowpine. We wander, obeying only de inner fire in each of us.\",\"id\":\"s19_2987\",\"timestamp\":1772165360},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: If de lightwood weapons are not ready, maybe de Shadowpine shamans can help.\",\"id\":\"s19_2988\",\"timestamp\":1772165360},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: You were with me as a child when I last went to Akil'zon's temple, Zul'jarra. Do you not remember?\",\"id\":\"s19_2989\",\"timestamp\":1772165366},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: De loa always heed us in times of crisis. Dey may listen now to de right voice--someone on de path of de hash'ey!\",\"id\":\"s19_2990\",\"timestamp\":1772165369},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Light de shrines on your way to de temple. And don't forget to leave Akil'zon an offerin'!\",\"id\":\"s19_2991\",\"timestamp\":1772165373},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Yes, uncle. But even den de loa did not speak to us.\",\"id\":\"s19_2992\",\"timestamp\":1772165375},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: De temple be overrun with gnarldin. Killin' dem will help us pass de time on de way. Come, \\\"hash'ura.\\\"\",\"id\":\"s19_2993\",\"timestamp\":1772165380},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: De Twilight's Blade pushed de gnarldin into our territory. We will have to fight through dem to get to de temple.\",\"id\":\"s19_2994\",\"timestamp\":1772165391},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Magisstorm-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Magisstorm-Tichondrius|h[|cff0070ddMagisstorm|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61836:Player-11-0EAC3E8E:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 3]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_2995\",\"timestamp\":1772165400},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: The gnarldin are close to destroying the shrines. And the nests of the eagles that roost here.\",\"id\":\"s19_2996\",\"timestamp\":1772165400},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gnarldin Clubfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Gnarldin Clubfist says: GRRRRRAAAHH!\",\"id\":\"s19_2997\",\"timestamp\":1772165405},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Den we must strike dem down.\",\"id\":\"s19_2998\",\"timestamp\":1772165406},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gnarldin Clubfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Gnarldin Clubfist says: Break your bones!\",\"id\":\"s19_2999\",\"timestamp\":1772165409},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gnarldin Clubfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Gnarldin Clubfist says: Face me, puny creature!\",\"id\":\"s19_3000\",\"timestamp\":1772165412},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Håvi-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Håvi-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaHåvi|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0E92A9E5:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_3001\",\"timestamp\":1772165417},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gnarldin Clubfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Gnarldin Clubfist says: Grah! Bested by... vermin.\",\"id\":\"s19_3002\",\"timestamp\":1772165429},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 9 Gold, 80 Silver, 33 Copper\",\"id\":\"s19_3003\",\"timestamp\":1772165436},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Gold, 15 Silver, 27 Copper\",\"id\":\"s19_3004\",\"timestamp\":1772165467},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Midnight Mining has increased to 9.\",\"id\":\"s19_3005\",\"timestamp\":1772165493},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive 