MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Haven't been back to de temple since I was a child. There be nothin' there but birds an' bramble.\",\"id\":\"s19_3049\",\"timestamp\":1772165962},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Soulzcuh-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Soulzcuh-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Soulzcuh|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41886:Player-11-0E6EF73F:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Weathered of the Ethereal]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_3050\",\"timestamp\":1772165968},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Soulzcuh-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Soulzcuh-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Soulzcuh|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41887:Player-11-0E6EF73F:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Carved of the Ethereal]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_3051\",\"timestamp\":1772165968},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Soulzcuh-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Soulzcuh-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Soulzcuh|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41888:Player-11-0E6EF73F:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Runed of the Ethereal]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_3052\",\"timestamp\":1772165968},{\"recordedBy\":