\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Kinduru wanted us to leave an offering. De heads of our enemies will do nicely.\",\"id\":\"s19_3057\",\"timestamp\":1772165991},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: If Kinduru is correct, it may be possible to contact the loa--by walking this path of \\\"hash'ey.\\\"\",\"id\":\"s19_3058\",\"timestamp\":1772165995},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: And be one step closer to ridding Zul'Aman of the Twilight's Blade.\",\"id\":\"s19_3059\",\"timestamp\":1772166003},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Wait... I did not mean to... Zul'jarra, becoming the hash'ey will be a great achievement.\",\"id\":\"s19_3060\",\"timestamp\":1772166014},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Enough, Zul'jarra. I admit that my past keeps me from... empathizing fully with your people.\",\"id\":\"s19_3061\",\"timestamp\":1772166035},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Buzek-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Buzek-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Buzek|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41960:Player-11-0E8DEF7E:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Murder Row]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_3062\",\"timestamp\":1772166036},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: I told you that I fought against your grandfather.\",\"id\":\"s19_3063\",\"timestamp\":1772166043},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: But I did not tell you that he held me captive and tortured me. And tortured and killed many of my peers.\",\"id\":\"s19_3064\",\"timestamp\":1772166047},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: That part of my past led me down a path I am not proud of.\",\"id\":\"s19_3065\",\"timestamp\":1772166056},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"???\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"??? says: Ha ha ha! The heads of our enemies. A tribute to our victory.\",\"id\":\"s19_3066\",\"timestamp\":1772166058},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: And, as strange as it seems, I see some of myself in your plight. And want you to become closer to your gods.\",\"id\":\"s19_3067\",\"timestamp\":1772166061},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s19_3068\",\"timestamp\":1772166068},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Now! Starphage and I are your hash'ura. We will attend you...\",\"id\":\"s19_3069\",\"timestamp\":1772166071},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"???\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"??? says: All that seek my favor must climb high but not be afraid to fall.\",\"id\":\"s19_3070\",\"timestamp\":1772166075},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Ha ha ha ha ha. You're a funny one. Straight as a spear but thick as a pango-hide shield.\",\"id\":\"s19_3071\",\"timestamp\":1772166076},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Wroot-Zuluhed\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Wroot-Zuluhed|h[|cffff7c0aWroot-Zuluhed|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-96-0BEC845D:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_3072\",\"timestamp\":1772166077},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Goochbandito-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Goochbandito-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eeGoochbandito|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61856:Player-11-0EA5692A:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Explore Zul'Aman]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_3073\",\"timestamp\":1772166093},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Kinduru... I hope you are right. For de Amani!\",\"id\":\"s19_3074\",\"timestamp\":1772166100},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Wait, Zul'jarra! Are you mad?\",\"id\":\"s19_3075\",\"timestamp\":1772166108},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Swagchecked-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Swagchecked-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffSwagchecked|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:40436:Player-11-0EB2269B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[You're Getting a Delve!]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_3076\",\"timestamp\":1772166169},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Swagchecked-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Swagchecked-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffSwagchecked|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-11-0EB2269B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_3077\",\"timestamp\":1772166169},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Shookone-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Shookone-Area52|h[|cff8788eeShookone-Area52|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61835:Player-3676-0EC012CA:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 2]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_3078\",\"timestamp\":1772166180},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Namoon-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Namoon-Stormrage|h[|cffff7c0aNamoon-Stormrage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-60-0EFC3DD6:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_3079\",\"timestamp\":1772166207},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Kähl-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kähl-Stormrage|h[|cffff7c0aKähl-Stormrage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191