an!]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772169902,\"id\":\"s19_3388\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Buzek-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Buzek-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Buzek|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:153:Player-11-0E8DEF7E:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Old Gnome and the Sea]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772169908,\"id\":\"s19_3389\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Mvmnt-MoonGuard\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mvmnt-MoonGuard|h[|cffff7c0aMvmnt-MoonGuard|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61856:Player-3675-0AC0F600:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Explore Zul'Aman]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772169909,\"id\":\"s19_3390\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra yells: With de blessin' of de loa, we will rid Zul'Aman of de Twilight's Blade. For de Amani!\",\"timestamp\":1772169923,\"id\":\"s19_3391\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Starphage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61856:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Explore Zul'Aman]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772169945,\"id\":\"s19_3392\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Starphage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61856:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Explore Zul'Aman]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772169945,\"id\":\"s19_3393\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Vengeance for Atal'Aman! Remind these invaders dis land is ours!\",\"timestamp\":1772169948,\"id\":\"s19_3394\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mor'duun\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mor'duun says: Amani reinforcements? No matter. More chaos and death to please Xal'atath!\",\"timestamp\":1772169955,\"id\":\"s19_3395\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: De loa have given me power. But still, de thrill of battle is what fills my heart!\",\"timestamp\":1772169955,\"id\":\"s19_3396\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Injured Amani Warrior\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Injured Amani Warrior says: I'll be back... after a moment to recover.\",\"timestamp\":1772169962,\"id\":\"s19_3397\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Spoken like a typical Amani. But... I would be lying to say I don't feel the same.\",\"timestamp\":1772169963,\"id\":\"s19_3398\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Injured Amani Warrior\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Injured Amani Warrior says: Bless ya, hash'ura!\",\"timestamp\":1772169969,\"id\":\"s19_3399\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Injured Amani Warrior\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Injured Amani Warrior says: Bless ya, hash'ura!\",\"timestamp\":1772169978,\"id\":\"s19_3400\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Injured Amani Warrior\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Injured Amani Warrior says: Bless ya, hash'ura!\",\"timestamp\":1772169980,\"id\":\"s19_3401\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Injured Amani Warrior\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Injured Amani Warrior says: Is it true? The loa have returned?\",\"timestamp\":1772169984,\"id\":\"s19_3402\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Injured Amani Warrior\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\"