,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Darkð-Kel'Thuzad|h[|cff8788eeDarkð-Kel'Thuzad|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-3693-0E27B45B:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772170653,\"id\":\"s19_3460\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:256928::::::::84:1480::11::1:28:3086:::::|h[Banner of the Amani Tribe]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772170660,\"id\":\"s19_3461\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Citizen says: Who rules Silvermoon? Is it Lor'themar? Or the fake King of Stormwind?\",\"timestamp\":1772170664,\"id\":\"s19_3462\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Archmage Aethas Sunreaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Archmage Aethas Sunreaver says: We need to put a stop to these fights.\",\"timestamp\":1772170670,\"id\":\"s19_3463\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Tmpikaboo-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tmpikaboo-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Tmpikaboo|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61638:Player-11-0E82A933:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Den of Nalorakk]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772170674,\"id\":\"s19_3464\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Doomsayer yells: The Vanguard will abandon us! They care nothing for the Sunwell!\",\"timestamp\":1772170683,\"id\":\"s19_3465\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Doomsayer yells: Your death will earn me a place by her side!\",\"timestamp\":1772170688,\"id\":\"s19_3466\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hallowfall Aeroknight\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Hallowfall Aeroknight says: This is for the Sunwell. We cannot survive on just mana biscuits.\",\"timestamp\":1772170691,\"id\":\"s19_3467\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sin'dorei Fruit Vendor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Sin'dorei Fruit Vendor says: You already took our Magister, our knights, our weapons, and now our food?\",\"timestamp\":1772170695,\"id\":\"s19_3468\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Doomsayer yells: Your death will earn me a place by her side!\",\"timestamp\":1772170697,\"id\":\"s19_3469\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Doomsayer yells: The Void is coming!\",\"timestamp\":1772170701,\"id\":\"s19_3470\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Guard\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"The nearby guard glares at you and the void energy that you surround yourself with.\",\"timestamp\":1772170702,\"id\":\"s19_3471\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Doomsayer says: You... you might be right. Thank you, champion.\",\"timestamp\":1772170705,\"id\":\"s19_3472\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Doomsayer yells: Your hope is a weakness!\",\"timestamp\":1772170714,\"id\":\"s19_3473\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Doomsayer says: So be it.\",\"timestamp\":1772170720,\"id\":\"s19_3474\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Doomsayer yells: Only the most vicious shall survive the Void!\",\"timestamp\":1772170722,\"id\":\"s19_3475\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Tehd Shoemaker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Tehd Shoemaker yells: I'm a Warlock, not a cultist.\",\"timestamp\":1772170734,\"id\":\"s19_3476\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Commander Venel Lightblood\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Commander Venel Lightblood says: Release the Void-wielders. They may wander the city, but we will tolerate none of their taint near the Sunwell.\",\"timestamp\":1772170736,\"id\":\"s19_3477\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Doomsayer yells: The Vanguard is making the Sunwell scream! Can you not feel it?!\",\"timestamp\":1772170753,\"id\":\"s19_3478\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Parryhadder-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Parryhadder-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebParryhadder|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41805:Player-11-0EA2B21A:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Arator's Journey]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772170768,\"id\":\"s19_3479\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Doomsayer yells: Your death will earn me a place by her side!\",\"timestamp\":1772170784,\"id\":\"s19_3480\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Kähl-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kähl-Stormrage|h[|cffff7c0aKähl-Stormrage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41287:Player-60-0FE11B88:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Windrunner Spire]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772170811,\"id\":\"s19_3481\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Namoon-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Namoon-Stormrage|h[|cffff7c0aNamoon-Stormrage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41287:Player-60-0EFC3DD6:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Windrunner Spire]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772170811,\"id\":\"s19_3482\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Renewmedaddy-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Renewmedaddy-Stormrage|h[|cffff7c0aRenewmedaddy-Stormrage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-60-0FE30D1E:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772170815,\"id\":\"s19_3483\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Doomsayer yells: Your hope is a weakness!\",\"timestamp\":1772170912,\"id\":\"s19_3484\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},