|cfff48cbaVaramithis-Sargeras|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41803:Player-76-095925CB:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[For Zul'Aman!]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772171238,\"id\":\"s19_3526\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: I have to learn more of the Lightbloom, even with the risks of traveling to your homeland.\",\"timestamp\":1772171257,\"id\":\"s19_3527\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Shookone-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Shookone-Area52|h[|cff8788eeShookone-Area52|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41097:Player-3676-0EC012CA:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Curiosity Never Killed the Looter]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772171272,\"id\":\"s19_3528\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Harandar is a dangerous place.\",\"timestamp\":1772171288,\"id\":\"s19_3529\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: I warn you both: my people do not welcome outsiders. They may no longer welcome me.\",\"timestamp\":1772171291,\"id\":\"s19_3530\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Despondent Magistrix\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Despondent Magistrix says: Oh, that poor dreaming fool of an apprentice...\",\"timestamp\":1772171305,\"id\":\"s19_3531\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Despondent Magistrix\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Despondent Magistrix says: The Farstriders? Really? Why he thinks so highly of those mud-covered ruffians I'll never know...\",\"timestamp\":1772171307,\"id\":\"s19_3532\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: This place... It is like we've stepped back in time.\",\"timestamp\":1772171350,\"id\":\"s19_3533\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: The people of the Har'athir settlement tend these roots. It is a short way down the path.\",\"timestamp\":1772171355,\"id\":\"s19_3534\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"Draenei\",\"name\":\"Geminara-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Geminara-Tichondrius|h[|cff0070ddGeminara|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-11-0E7A2922:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772171361,\"id\":\"s19_3535\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: I see why they are so protective... Such untouched beauty.\",\"timestamp\":1772171361,\"id\":\"s19_3536\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ku'paal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ku'paal says: Orweyna? Who are these--what have you done?\",\"timestamp\":1772171362,\"id\":\"s19_3537\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Oorla\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Oorla says: Who--what are you? Stay back, I'm warning you!\",\"timestamp\":1772171371,\"id\":\"s19_3538\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Oorla\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Oorla says: Fine, but those were my kills! No taking credit.\",\"timestamp\":1772171374,\"id\":\"s19_3539\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Danul\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Danul says: Aln'hara's roots! Who are you?\",\"timestamp\":1772171381,\"id\":\"s19_3540\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Danul\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Danul says: Aln'hara's roots! Who are you?\",\"timestamp\":1772171395,\"id\":\"s19_3541\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Danul\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Danul says: Aw, I was just getting warmed up too.\",\"timestamp\":1772171396,\"id\":\"s19_3542\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Behold, Harandar.\",\"timestamp\":1772171397,\"id\":\"s19_3543\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: Incredible. Starphage, come and see.\",\"timestamp\":1772171401,\"id\":\"s19_3544\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Behold, Harandar.\",\"timestamp\":1772171405,\"id\":\"s19_3545\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Wroot-Zuluhed\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Wroot-Zuluhed|h[|cffff7c0aWroot-Zuluhed|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61638:Player-96-0BEC845D:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Den of Nalorakk]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772171423,\"id\":\"s19_3546\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Bombadilo-Gilneas\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Bombadilo-Gilneas|h[|cff00ff98Bombadilo-Gilneas|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62388:Player-67-0A795585:1:2:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Illicit Rain: Five Stars]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772171424,\"id\":\"s19_3547\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: This way, Halduron, Starphage.\",\"timestamp\":1772171450,\"id\":\"s19_3548\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ruia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ruia says: This so-called \\\"Lightbloom\\\" is no real threat. It does not excuse your heresies.\",\"timestamp\":1772171459,\"id\":\"s19_3549\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:256227::::::::84:1480::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:84:28:3087:::::|h[Ancient Frond Cloak]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772171465,\"id\":\"s19_3550\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ruia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ruia says: Go to the Den at once! The Council will decide your fates.\",\"timestamp\":1772171469,\"id\":\"s19_3551\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Dolphinz-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Dolphinz-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788