lay siege to the Sunwell. The Light has chosen you to defend it.\",\"id\":\"s19_3556\",\"timestamp\":1772171513},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Image of Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Image of Lady Liadrin says: Auteist, Xal'atath and her Devouring Host lay siege to the Sunwell. The Light has chosen you to defend it.\",\"id\":\"s19_3557\",\"timestamp\":1772171556},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Image of Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Image of Lady Liadrin says: We desperately need your aid. Seek me out and the Light will bear you to Quel'Danas.\",\"id\":\"s19_3558\",\"timestamp\":1772171565},{\"recordedBy\":\"Auteist-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Renzik \\\"The Shiv\\\"\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Renzik \\\"The Shiv\\\" says: Hey, you remember that suspicious wall down in the Ringing Deeps? Someone just blasted it to pieces.\",\"id\":\"s19_3559\",\"timestamp\":1772171572},{\"recordedBy\":\"Hellavator-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Image of Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Image of Lady Liadrin says: Hellavator, Xal'atath and her Devouring Host lay siege to the Sunwell. The Light has chosen you to defend it.\",\"timestamp\":1772171605,\"id\":\"s19_3560\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Draenei\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Geminara-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"