ot-Woven Window]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4150\",\"timestamp\":1772207467},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Elder Hagar?\",\"id\":\"s19_4151\",\"timestamp\":1772207481},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elder Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Elder Hagar says: Help has arrived, little sprout. \",\"id\":\"s19_4152\",\"timestamp\":1772207483},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:256208::::::::85:1480::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:85:28:3087:::::|h[Bracers of the Suncrown]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4153\",\"timestamp\":1772207483},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: They just keep coming! Aln'hara, hear us... Send us your aid!\",\"id\":\"s19_4154\",\"timestamp\":1772207487},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: Stop the ritual! To arms! Eversong need not burn today!\",\"id\":\"s19_4155\",\"timestamp\":1772207489},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx3\",\"id\":\"s19_4156\",\"timestamp\":1772207519},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260662::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Polished Purple Pebble]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4157\",\"timestamp\":1772207519},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hara'ti Packleader\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hara'ti Packleader says: Aln's gift flows through me!\",\"id\":\"s19_4158\",\"timestamp\":1772207522},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s19_4159\",\"timestamp\":1772207546},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260662::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Polished Purple Pebble]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4160\",\"timestamp\":1772207546},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Lasadin-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Lasadin-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaLasadin|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61856:Player-11-0E872977:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Explore Zul'Aman]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_4161\",\"timestamp\":1772207547},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hara'ti Packleader\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hara'ti Packleader says: Push forward! Aln'hara's song protects us!\",\"id\":\"s19_4162\",\"timestamp\":1772207554},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hara'ti Packleader\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hara'ti Packleader says: Aln's gift flows through me!\",\"id\":\"s19_4163\",\"timestamp\":1772207592},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Fcrusader-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Fcrusader-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaFcrusader|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61835:Player-11-0E3247A2:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 2]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_4164\",\"timestamp\":1772207604},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hara'ti Packleader\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hara'ti Packleader says: Push forward! Aln'hara's song protects us!\",\"id\":\"s19_4165\",\"timestamp\":1772207621},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hara'ti Packleader\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hara'ti Packleader says: Aln's gift flows through me!\",\"id\":\"s19_4166\",\"timestamp\":1772207629},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Voidwhispèr-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Voidwhispèr-Area52|h[|cffa330c9Voidwhispèr-Area52|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61641:Player-3676-0EC3359E:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Blinding Vale]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_4167\",\"timestamp\":1772207650},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242640::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Plant Protein]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s19_4168\",\"timestamp\":1772207651},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260618::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Light-Infused Leaves]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4169\",\"timestamp\":1772207651},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:254878::::::::85:1480::11::1:28:3087:::::|h[Root-Woven Window]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4170\",\"timestamp\":1772207658},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: I cannot say we have ever fought a haranir Rootwarden before. Anything we should know?\",\"id\":\"s19_4171\",\"timestamp\":1772207661},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Ruia! The will of Aln'hara stands against you! Cease this madness!\",\"id\":\"s19_4172\",\"timestamp\":1772207666},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lightwarden Ruia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lightwarden Ruia says: No! Not here, not yet!\",\"id\":\"s19_4173\",\"timestamp\":1772207698},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: I can feel him fleeing through the roots. We have to--\",\"id\":\"s19_4174\",\"timestamp\":1772207707},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: With Ruia in retreat and Alndust in hand, we can drive the frenzy back.\",\"id\":\"s19_4175\",\"timestamp\":1772207716},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:252957::::::::85:1480::11:2:6652:13613:2:9:85:28:3087:::::|h[Tangle of Vibrant Vines]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4176\",\"timestamp\":1772207717},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: Your people saved our home, Orweyna--and at great cost to yourselves. Your sacrifice shall not go unrecognized.\",\"id\":\"s19_4177\",\"timestamp\":1772207722},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elder Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Elder Hagar says: Peace, Orweyna. Ruia will face judgment. Come, we should fall back to the Suncrown Tree.\",\"id\":\"s19_4178\",\"timestamp\":1772207728},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: I must insist you join me in Silvermoon.\",\"id\":\"s19_4179\",\"timestamp\":1772207731},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arcanist Taemin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arcanist Taemin says: Oof... Who knew being a Farstrider required so much physical activity?\",\"id\":\"s19_4180\",\"timestamp\":1772207747},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ranger Telenus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ranger Telenus says: Look at this mess!\",\"id\":\"s19_4181\",\"timestamp\":1772207802},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Orweyna, your efforts saved Eversong this day. The haranir will always have a place in Silvermoon, should they wish it.\",\"id\":\"s19_4182\",\"timestamp\":1772207802},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Starphage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41804:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[One Does Not Simply Walk Into Harandar]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_4183\",\"timestamp\":1772207803},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Starphage-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Starphage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41804:Player-11-0EA2971B:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[One Does Not Simply Walk Into Harandar]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_4184\",\"timestamp\":1772207803},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Starphage, return to the Sanctum of Light. This struggle is far from over.\",\"id\":\"s19_4185\",\"timestamp\":1772207813},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Thank you, Starphage. You helped bring my people back into the world. The goddess would be pleased, I think.\",\"id\":\"s19_4186\",\"timestamp\":1772207820},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: Lor'themar. What we saw out there. The Light drove the rutaani to zealotry and madness...\",\"id\":\"s19_4187\",\"timestamp\":1772207833},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: Watch your tone, Halduron. Blasphemy doesn't suit a man of your stature.\",\"id\":\"s19_4188\",\"timestamp\":1772207839},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: He was speaking to his Lord-Regent.\",\"id\":\"s19_4189\",\"timestamp\":1772207844},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Draenei\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Fayax-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Fayax-Tichondrius|h[|cff0070ddFayax|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-11-0EAB332D:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_4190\",\"timestamp\":1772207845},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: We assume benevolent motives, but have seen the Light used by the wicked before. \",\"id\":\"s19_4191\",\"timestamp\":1772207847},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: Without the Light, your precious city, all of Azeroth would have been lost!\",\"id\":\"s19_4192\",\"timestamp\":1772207853},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Frostyfries-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Frostyfries-Tichondrius:1351:GUILD:|h[|cffc41e3aFrostyfries|r]|h: like seeing that for the second time\",\"id\":\"s19_4193\",\"timestamp\":1772207857},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: No one is questioning the Light's grace, Turalyon. Least of all the sin'dorei!\",\"id\":\"s19_4194\",\"timestamp\":1772207858},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sunreaver Mage\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Sunreaver Mage says: Who are these Vanguard people who keep taking our food?\",\"id\":\"s19_4195\",\"timestamp\":1772207862},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: We seek to avoid its--corruption. The Light being turned against us.\",\"id\":\"s19_4196\",\"timestamp\":1772207863},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: We are your friends, Turalyon--your family.\",\"id\":\"s19_4197\",\"timestamp\":1772207869},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: ...Family. Of course. The Lightbloom is an anomaly, but nothing that should diminish our faith in the Light.\",\"id\":\"s19_4198\",\"timestamp\":1772207873},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Citizen says: The quel'dorei are prowling on our southern border! When are you going to drive them off?\",\"id\":\"s19_4199\",\"timestamp\":1772207913},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s19_4200\",\"timestamp\":1772207977},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Mageyuya-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Mageyuya-Tichondrius:1376:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebMageyuya|r]|h: holy christ mining is a money printer rn\",\"id\":\"s19_4201\",\"timestamp\":1772208076},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Alndust is limited, so we must cull the areas where the Lightbloom is most active.\",\"id\":\"s19_4202\",\"timestamp\":1772208077},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter says: Everyone get your buffs on.\",\"id\":\"s19_4203\",\"timestamp\":1772208077},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Meredy Huntswell\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Meredy Huntswell says: Mage table ready. Come and grab a bite for later.\",\"id\":\"s19_4204\",\"timestamp\":1772208080},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter says: Check your adventure guide if you need more information about what we'll find here.\",\"id\":\"s19_4205\",\"timestamp\":1772208081},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: A large attack only causes the Lightbloom to spread. A few, striking the most dangerous--that is best.\",\"id\":\"s19_4206\",\"timestamp\":1772208086},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Captain Garrick\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Captain Garrick says: Look at what the Lightbloom has done to...\",\"id\":\"s19_4207\",\"timestamp\":1772208087},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Captain Garrick\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Captain Garrick says: ... this land...\",\"id\":\"s19_4208\",\"timestamp\":1772208092},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Voidwhispèr-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Voidwhispèr-Area52:1388:GUILD:|h[|cffa330c9Voidwhispèr|r]|h: it really is, i went mining and herb for now to get money haha\",\"id\":\"s19_4209\",\"timestamp\":1772208101},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Frostyfries-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Frostyfries-Tichondrius:1389:GUILD:|h[|cffc41e3aFrostyfries|r]|h: yeah going to be lots of gold in pockets\",\"id\":\"s19_4210\",\"timestamp\":1772208107},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242640::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Plant Protein]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4211\",\"timestamp\":1772208164},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260646::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Glowing Gland]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4212\",\"timestamp\":1772208164},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:258867::::::::85:1480::17:1:13611:2:9:85:28:3322:::::|h[Brittle Faceguard]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4213\",\"timestamp\":1772208164},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 2 Gold, 35 Silver, 75 Copper\",\"id\":\"s19_4214\",\"timestamp\":1772208165},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lightwarden Ruia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lightwarden Ruia yells: Invading our gardens has a price, and the Lightbloom will make sure you pay it.\",\"id\":\"s19_4215\",\"timestamp\":1772208229},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Frostyfries-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Frostyfries-Tichondrius:1411:GUILD:|h[|cffc41e3aFrostyfries|r]|h: lots more where that came from\",\"id\":\"s19_4216\",\"timestamp\":1772208232},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: So this is where Ruia has hidden himself...\",\"id\":\"s19_4217\",\"timestamp\":1772208238},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260646::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Glowing Gland]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4218\",\"timestamp\":1772208263},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Gold, 95 Silver, 59 Copper\",\"id\":\"s19_4219\",\"timestamp\":1772208264},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Rapchercat-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Rapchercat-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aRapchercat|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:42328:Player-11-0EA8EBE7:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[One Warband Mentor: Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_4220\",\"timestamp\":1772208270},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Frostyfries-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Frostyfries-Tichondrius:1423