VEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Amaragos-Tichondrius|h[|cff00ff98Amaragos|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61835:Player-11-0EB05FFC:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 2]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_4326\",\"timestamp\":1772210191},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Lasadin-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Lasadin-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaLasadin|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61835:Player-11-0E872977:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 2]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_4327\",\"timestamp\":1772210294},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Guard\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"The nearby guard glares at you and the void energy that you surround yourself with.\",\"id\":\"s19_4328\",\"timestamp\":1772210405},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Frostyfries-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Frostyfries-Tichondrius|h[|cffc41e3aFrostyfries|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-11-0E83AB7E:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_4329\",\"timestamp\":1772210405},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Frostyfries-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Frostyfries-Tichondrius:1768:GUILD:|h[|cffc41e3aFrostyfries|r]|h: i found that 1 fun\",\"id\":\"s19_4330\",\"timestamp\":1772210446},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Solwin Brightstitch\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Solwin Brightstitch says: Alas, if I had but one worthy customer...\",\"id\":\"s19_4331\",\"timestamp\":1772210454},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Belath Dawnblade\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Belath Dawnblade says: The trace is faint... But I can still sense it here.\",\"id\":\"s19_4332\",\"timestamp\":1772210489},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Varamithis-Sargeras\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Varamithis-Sargeras|h[|cfff48cbaVaramithis-Sargeras|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61212:Player-76-095925CB:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Magisters' Terrace]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_4333\",\"timestamp\":1772210496},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Belath Dawnblade\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Belath Dawnblade says: Use your sight to track down the fel, Slayer. We will rendezvous shortly.\",\"id\":\"s19_4334\",\"timestamp\":1772210497},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Apprentice Mage\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Apprentice Mage says: Two more years to graduate? Silvermoon probably doesn't have two more months!\",\"id\":\"s19_4335\",\"timestamp\":1772210513},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Apprentice Mage\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Apprentice Mage says: The Void isn't going to wait. The academy is too slow to train us.\",\"id\":\"s19_4336\",\"timestamp\":1772210522},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hooded Noble\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hooded Noble says: Your connection was useful. My valet was able to secure a supply from the Row. It is an expensive vice, though a needed one.\",\"id\":\"s19_4337\",\"timestamp\":1772210530},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hooded Noble\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hooded Noble says: It is worth any cost. This is what saved our people from extinction once. It can save us again.\",\"id\":\"s19_4338\",\"timestamp\":1772210540},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:243237::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Bottled Fel Dust]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4339\",\"timestamp\":1772210540},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:243240::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Drained Wyrm Core]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4340\",\"timestamp\":1772210547},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Destitute Denizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Destitute Denizen says: If the Void attacks the city like the Scourge did, no one's defending the Row. We need our own weapons.\",\"id\":\"s19_4341\",\"timestamp\":1772210559},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:243238::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Blackened Metal Fragment]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4342\",\"timestamp\":1772210566},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Destitute Denizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Destitute Denizen says: Yeah, but we need gold for that. Fel isn't cheap. Maybe we can work for Zaen. Cut a deal with him.\",\"id\":\"s19_4343\",\"timestamp\":1772210569},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:243236::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Stained Worker's Shirt]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4344\",\"timestamp\":1772210581},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:238562::::::::85:1480::::1:28:3615:::::|h[What To Do When Nothing Works]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4345\",\"timestamp\":1772210603},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3259:0|h[Artisan Engineer's Moxie]|h|rx15\",\"id\":\"s19_4346\",\"timestamp\":1772210608},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3153:0|h[Midnight Engineering Knowledge]|h|rx3\",\"id\":\"s19_4347\",\"timestamp\":1772210608},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:243239::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Handwritten List]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4348\",\"timestamp\":1772210617},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Belath Dawnblade\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Belath Dawnblade says: Starphage, look here. Some elves ran off as I approached, but they left something behind.\",\"id\":\"s19_4349\",\"timestamp\":1772210643},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Belath Dawnblade\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Belath Dawnblade says: Pretend to be a buyer with enough coin and you'll find the fel dealer eventually.\",\"id\":\"s19_4350\",\"timestamp\":1772210649},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Belath Dawnblade\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Belath Dawnblade says: I will keep watch over the streets in the meantime.\",\"id\":\"s19_4351\",\"timestamp\":1772210653},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:244407::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Cracked Wyrm Core]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4352\",\"timestamp\":1772210654},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Soulzcuh-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Soulzcuh-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Soulzcuh|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:153:Player-11-0E6EF73F:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Old Gnome and the Sea]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_4353\",\"timestamp\":1772210663},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Miss Len'dali\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Miss Len'dali says: Whatever you might be implying, we do not dabble in that sort of magic.\",\"id\":\"s19_4354\",\"timestamp\":1772210663},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Denorin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Denorin says: I'm afraid we're fresh out. I have other creatures for sale, if you're interested.\",\"id\":\"s19_4355\",\"timestamp\":1772210671},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Thiel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Thiel says: You're asking questions a lot louder than you should.\",\"id\":\"s19_4356\",\"timestamp\":1772210681},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:253212::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Rogue's Signet]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4357\",\"timestamp\":1772210684},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Thiel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Thiel subtly slips a signet ring into your hand.\",\"id\":\"s19_4358\",\"timestamp\":1772210685},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Thiel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Thiel says: Down the road. Green torches. Be quiet about it.\",\"id\":\"s19_4359\",\"timestamp\":1772210688},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Durfnn-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Durfnn-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dDurfnn|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61734:Player-11-0E799EEA:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Endgame]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_4360\",\"timestamp\":1772210694},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Durfnn-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Durfnn-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dDurfnn|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:42328:Player-11-0E799EEA:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[One Warband Mentor: Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_4361\",\"timestamp\":1772210694},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Mageyuya-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mageyuya-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebMageyuya|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:12572:Player-11-0E97F286:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[War Supplied]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s19_4362\",\"timestamp\":1772210696},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Well-Paid Bruiser\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"The bruiser nods at your signet ring.\",\"id\":\"s19_4363\",\"timestamp\":1772210746},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Well-Paid Bruiser\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Well-Paid Bruiser says: Zaen will get Thiel his cut. Go on in.\",\"id\":\"s19_4364\",\"timestamp\":1772210749},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Selinde\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Selinde says: Ah, a new customer. Vira will want to speak with you personally. She's on the upper level.\",\"id\":\"s19_4365\",\"timestamp\":1772210750},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kystia Manaheart\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kystia Manaheart says: I'm under tight demands. How quickly can you break down these relics?\",\"id\":\"s19_4366\",\"timestamp\":1772210756},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vira Bloodsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vira Bloodsong says: Unfortunately, supply has not been able to keep up with demand as the Void draws ever closer.\",\"id\":\"s19_4367\",\"timestamp\":1772210757},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:244528::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Shipping Manifest]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4368\",\"timestamp\":1772210761},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:245566::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Fel Splinter]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4369\",\"timestamp\":1772210761},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vira Bloodsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vira Bloodsong says: But fear not. More wyrms are being infused soon. I will have some set aside for your purchase.\",\"id\":\"s19_4370\",\"timestamp\":1772210763},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vira Bloodsong\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vira Bloodsong says: In the meantime, you are welcome to peruse the unprocessed fel to be assured of its quality.\",\"id\":\"s19_4371\",\"timestamp\":1772210768},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Belath Dawnblade\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Belath Dawnblade says: You were in that place for a while. Uncover any leads?\",\"id\":\"s19_4372\",\"timestamp\":1772210771},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Belath Dawnblade\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Belath Dawnblade says: Head to the harbor and tell them you're picking up Zaen's shipments. We'll disrupt their supply line and take it as evidence. I'll meet you there.\",\"id\":\"s19_4373\",\"timestamp\":1772210776},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Belath Dawnblade\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Belath Dawnblade says: Found the dockmaster. You go talk to him. I'll stay hidden here in case something goes wrong.\",\"id\":\"s19_4374\",\"timestamp\":1772210792},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Tarelin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Tarelin says: You really think I'm that witless? Zaen would cut my throat!\",\"id\":\"s19_4375\",\"timestamp\":1772210801},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Tarelin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Tarelin says: Better this... than what... he would do...\",\"id\":\"s19_4376\",\"timestamp\":1772210825},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:244547::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Folded Receipt]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s19_4377\",\"timestamp\":1772210827},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 94 Silver, 35 Copper\",\"id\":\"s19_4378\",\"timestamp\":1772210828},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Belath Dawnblade\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Belath Dawnblade says: Where is Zaen?\",\"id\":\"s19_4379\",\"timestamp\":1772210831},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Belath Dawnblade\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Belath Dawnblade says: Quickly! Let's get back to the Row. We need to locate the Illicit Rain, track down Zaen, and put an end to this fel trade.\",\"id\":\"s19_4380\",\"timestamp\":1772210834},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Citizen\"},\"eve