:{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Leading Domanaar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Leading Domanaar says: My, what a delicious bloodbath! But I'm afraid I must take my leave.\",\"timestamp\":1772217469,\"id\":\"s19_4929\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Voidwhispèr-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Voidwhispèr-Area52|h[|cffa330c9Voidwhispèr-Area52|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61212:Player-3676-0EC3359E:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Magisters' Terrace]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772217481,\"id\":\"s19_4930\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Climatechang-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Climatechang-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aClimatechang|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61640:Player-11-0E90740E:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Nexus-Point Xenas]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772217533,\"id\":\"s19_4931\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lothraxion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lothraxion says: One wrong move and I will sear you with the Light, fiend.\",\"timestamp\":1772217536,\"id\":\"s19_4932\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: Such strength and wisdom! Clearly, it would be foolish to defy you!\",\"timestamp\":1772217542,\"id\":\"s19_4933\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1772217568,\"id\":\"s19_4934\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: Our scouts discovered an ethereal manaforge due south. Not sure what they're up to, though.\",\"timestamp\":1772217570,\"id\":\"s19_4935\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:260845::::::::86:1480::11:4:13573:13613:13615:6652:2:9:86:28:3084:::::|h[Greaves of Infinite Gravity]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772217572,\"id\":\"s19_4936\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lothraxion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lothraxion says: Then you will tell us how to break the storm, voidspawn.\",\"timestamp\":1772217573,\"id\":\"s19_4937\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Evohsx-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Evohsx-Stormrage:3271:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aEvohsx|r]|h: I think after all these years people still dont know how the AH works, all  this undercutting.  No, Last in first out.\",\"timestamp\":1772217580,\"id\":\"s19_4938\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: On the fringes of this world, you will find Nexus-Points. They keep the storm churning.\",\"timestamp\":1772217582,\"id\":\"s19_4939\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lothraxion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lothraxion says: Then we will destroy them. And the ethereals will provide our ordnance.\",\"timestamp\":1772217592,\"id\":\"s19_4940\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: Ah, the ethereals. It was not so long ago that Xal'atath brought them into the fold.\",\"timestamp\":1772217652,\"id\":\"s19_4941\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: Xal'atath... was once mortal?\",\"timestamp\":1772217670,\"id\":\"s19_4942\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: We'll secure the canisters and disrupt their operations. Stay close, Arator.\",\"timestamp\":1772217673,\"id\":\"s19_4943\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: That's what she told Salhadaar. Perhaps it was even the truth.\",\"timestamp\":1772217674,\"id\":\"s19_4944\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: I was about to say the same to you.\",\"timestamp\":1772217679,\"id\":\"s19_4945\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:237380::::::::86:1480:::::::::|h[Empty Manacell]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772217728,\"id\":\"s19_4946\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260615::::::::86:1480:::::::::|h[Void Dust Residue]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772217728,\"id\":\"s19_4947\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 3 Gold, 39 Silver, 84 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1772217747,\"id\":\"s19_4948\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Amaragos-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.2509804069995