:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Breaching the Voidstorm]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772217923,\"id\":\"s19_4969\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Climatechang-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Climatechang-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aClimatechang|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:42045:Player-11-0E90740E:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772217923,\"id\":\"s19_4970\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"name\":\"Frostyfries-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Frostyfries-Tichondrius|h[|cffc41e3aFrostyfries|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61520:Player-11-0E83AB7E:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Explore Harandar]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772217950,\"id\":\"s19_4971\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260615::::::::86:1480:::::::::|h[Void Dust Residue]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772217953,\"id\":\"s19_4972\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Unraveling Captive\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Unraveling Captive says: The Void devours its own. We have nothing left.\",\"timestamp\":1772217958,\"id\":\"s19_4973\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: You live up to your legend, mother.\",\"timestamp\":1772217985,\"id\":\"s19_4974\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:262737::::::::86:1480::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:86:28:3084:::::|h[Axe of the Great Dark]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772217987,\"id\":\"s19_4975\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264657::::::::86:1480::11::1:28:3084:::::|h[Open Sturdy Void Elf Trunk]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772217987,\"id\":\"s19_4976\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: And you fight well. But don't be in a rush to make your own.\",\"timestamp\":1772217988,\"id\":\"s19_4977\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:263240::::::::86:1480::11::1:28:3084:::::|h[Sturdy Void Elf Crate]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772217990,\"id\":\"s19_4978\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: Xal'atath doesn't spare her enemies without a reason. Find out what the ethereals are doing here.\",\"timestamp\":1772217992,\"id\":\"s19_4979\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lothraxion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lothraxion says: What does it matter? Salvage what we need and then raze this forge to the ground. They can burn with their secrets.\",\"timestamp\":1772217999,\"id\":\"s19_4980\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Echo-Missive of Salhadaar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Echo-Missive of Salhadaar says: This is not what I was promised! We toil endlessly while your monsters monitor our every move!\",\"timestamp\":1772218023,\"id\":\"s19_4981\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Echo-Missive of Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Echo-Missive of Xal'atath says: Such ingratitude is unbecoming of you, Salhadaar. I have provided you with a rare gift: an opportunity to prove your right to rule.\",\"timestamp\":1772218033,\"id\":\"s19_4982\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Echo-Missive of Salhadaar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Echo-Missive of Salhadaar says: Do you think I cannot see the trap you have set? The peril that now faces my people should our operation at Mid'Ar fail?\",\"timestamp\":1772218041,\"id\":\"s19_4983\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Echo-Missive of Salhadaar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Echo-Missive of Salhadaar says: The Shadowguard risk everything to strengthen the Devouring Host. Should Windrunner discover what we are doing--\",\"timestamp\":1772218049,\"id\":\"s19_4984\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Tempest Keeper\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Tempest Keeper says: More power. All will become Void.\",\"timestamp\":1772218061,\"id\":\"s19_4985\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lothraxion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lothraxion says: Burn in the Light, wretch!\",\"timestamp\":1772218069,\"id\":\"s19_4986\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Lasadin-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Lasadin-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaLasadin|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41804:Player-11-0E872977:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[One Does Not Simply Walk Into Harandar]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772218111,\"id\":\"s19_4987\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:237745::::::::86:1480:::::::::|h[Encrypted Device]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772218123,\"id\":\"s19_4988\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260646::::::::86:1480:::::::::|h[Glowing Gland]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772218123,\"id\":\"s19_4989\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lothraxion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lothraxion says: The Light prevails. I expect Decimus puts up even less of a fight.\",\"timestamp\":1772218124,\"id\":\"s19_4990\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:262671::::::::86:1480::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:86:28:3084:::::|h[Warglaive of Desolation]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772218144,\"id\":\"s19_4991\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Echo-Missive of Salhadaar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Echo-Missive of Salhadaar says: Windrunner will not prevent me from turning the naaru to the Void. I will claim the power I was promised!\",\"timestamp\":1772218146,\"id\":\"s19_4992\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lothraxion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lothraxion says: They've taken a naaru prisoner? We cannot allow these monsters to possess a being of pure Light!\",\"timestamp\":1772218157,\"id\":\"s19_4993\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: This cannot stand. I'm with you, Lothraxion.\",\"timestamp\":1772218165,\"id\":\"s19_4994\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:237744::::::::86:1480:::::::::|h[Arcane Remnant]|h|rx15\",\"timestamp\":1772218216,\"id\":\"s19_4995\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260662::::::::86:1480:::::::::|h[Polished Purple Pebble]|h|rx3\",\"timestamp\":1772218216,\"id\":\"s19_4996\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 3 Gold, 1 Silver, 34 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1772218217,\"id\":\"s19_4997\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:237744::::::::86:1480:::::::::|h[Arcane Remnant]|h|rx7\",\"timestamp\":1772218220,\"id\":\"s19_4998\"}]",
["endTimestamp"] = 1772218220,
},
