0673::::::::87:1480:::::::::|h[Partially Digested Bracers]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s20_3293\",\"timestamp\":1772225714},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Midnight Mining has increased to 28.\",\"id\":\"s20_3294\",\"timestamp\":1772225718},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:237359::::::::87:1480::::1:38:13:::::|h[Refulgent Copper Ore |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s20_3295\",\"timestamp\":1772225719},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3158:0|h[Midnight Mining Knowledge]|h|rx1\",\"id\":\"s20_3296\",\"timestamp\":1772225719},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3264:0|h[Artisan Miner's Moxie]|h|rx5\",\"id\":\"s20_3297\",\"timestamp\":1772225719},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:236952::::::::87:1480:::::::::|h[Mote of Pure Void]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s20_3298\",\"timestamp\":1772225719},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Noxian\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Noxian says: Decimus! Traitor!\",\"id\":\"s20_3299\",\"timestamp\":1772225737},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Decimus says: Traitor? Since when has loyalty been something we concerned ourselves with, Noxian?\",\"id\":\"s20_3300\",\"timestamp\":1772225738},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Decimus says: Make no mistake, Starphage. Noxian felt no loyalty to Xal'atath, only envy and greed.\",\"id\":\"s20_3301\",\"timestamp\":1772225763},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Swagchecked-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Swagchecked-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffSwagchecked|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41803:Player-11-0EB2269B:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[For Zul'Aman!]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s20_3302\",\"timestamp\":1772225764},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 2 Gold, 73 Silver, 83 Copper\",\"id\":\"s20_3303\",\"timestamp\":1772225766},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Helläkopta-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Helläkopta-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Helläkopta|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61638:Player-11-0E8A9BE5:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Den of Nalorakk]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s20_3304\",\"timestamp\":1772225773},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Tenebre\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Tenebre says: Decimus? You live? I thought Xal'atath consumed you with the other lords.\",\"id\":\"s20_3305\",\"timestamp\":1772225777},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Decimus says: Oh, I'm far too insignificant to be destroyed alongside our old lords. Just like you.\",\"id\":\"s20_3306\",\"timestamp\":1772225781},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Decimus says: How delicious.\",\"id\":\"s20_3307\",\"timestamp\":1772225797},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Gold, 9 Silver, 44 Copper\",\"id\":\"s20_3308\",\"timestamp\":1772225799},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Tiivah-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tiivah-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dTiivah|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61640:Player-11-0E6BD6A1:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Nexus-Point Xenas]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s20_3309\",\"timestamp\":1772225808},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260659::::::::87:1480:::::::::|h[Stellar Vortex Residue]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s20_3310\",\"timestamp\":1772225829},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260659::::::::87:1480:::::::::|h[Stellar Vortex Residue]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s20_3311\",\"timestamp\":1772225830},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260659::::::::87:1480:::::::::|h[Stellar Vortex Residue]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s20_3312\",\"timestamp\":1772225862},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260672::::::::87:1480:::::::::|h[Fetid Eye]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s20_3313\",\"timestamp\":1772225862},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::87:1480:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s20_3314\",\"timestamp\":1772225862},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Decimus says: I do hope you are enjoying yourself as much as I. May I presume to say we are becoming good friends?\",\"id\":\"s20_3315\",\"timestamp\":1772225881},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Kaliostus-BleedingHollow\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kaliostus-BleedingHollow|h[|cffa330c9Kaliostus-BleedingHollow|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61856:Player-73-0FDB5F09:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Explore Zul'Aman]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s20_3316\",\"timestamp\":1772225895},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vortensiun\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vortensiun says: Found a new toy, Decimus? Always playing with your food.\",\"id\":\"s20_3317\",\"timestamp\":1772225896},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Decimus says: Oh Vortensiun, the taste of your resentment is just as sweet as I'd hoped.\",\"id\":\"s20_3318\",\"timestamp\":1772225899},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vortensiun\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vortensiun says: How... dare you--! Decimus, you fiend--!\",\"id\":\"s20_3319\",\"timestamp\":1772225936},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260659::::::::87:1480:::::::::|h[Stellar Vortex Residue]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s20_3320\",\"timestamp\":1772225937},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 3 Gold, 49 Silver, 76 Copper\",\"id\":\"s20_3321\",\"timestamp\":1772225938},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Decimus says: Ignore his cries. See how the blade now draws power forth of its own will? There is yet more to do, Starphage. Meet me in the Gnawing Reach.\",\"id\":\"s20_3322\",\"timestamp\":1772225940},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Warglaives has increased to 440.\",\"id\":\"s20_3323\",\"timestamp\":1772225955},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Decimus says: Let's rest while the blade cools. Come, tell me about yourself.\",\"id\":\"s20_3324\",\"timestamp\":1772225956},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Decimus says: I understand you mortals form deep, meaningful bonds by sharing such personal information. Thank you for indulging me.\",\"id\":\"s20_3325\",\"timestamp\":1772225958},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Tiivah-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tiivah-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dTiivah|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41806:Player-11-0E6BD6A1:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Breaching the Voidstorm]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s20_3326\",\"timestamp\":1772225959},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Tiivah-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tiivah-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dTiivah|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:42045:Player-11-0E6BD6A1:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s20_3327\",\"timestamp\":1772225959},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lingering Shade\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lingering Shade says: You... murderer...\",\"id\":\"s20_3328\",\"timestamp\":1772225971},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Clearcast-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Clearcast-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebClear