|h[Light and Shaggy Fur]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s20_3384\",\"timestamp\":1772248546},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx3\",\"id\":\"s20_3385\",\"timestamp\":1772248546},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260637::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Rotting Insect Eggs]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s20_3386\",\"timestamp\":1772248546},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260662::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Polished Purple Pebble]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s20_3387\",\"timestamp\":1772248546},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260608::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Bloated Animal Remains]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s20_3388\",\"timestamp\":1772248546},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Voidwalker Phantasm\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Voidwalker Phantasm says: Feed... the Void...\",\"id\":\"s20_3389\",\"timestamp\":1772248548},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scout Nefina\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Scout Nefina says: Whatever you did out there seems to have worked.\",\"id\":\"s20_3390\",\"timestamp\":1772248557},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sentient Voidwalker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Sentient Voidwalker says: If we can muster the energy to power them, these domanaar devices will allow us to locate your scouts.\",\"id\":\"s20_3391\",\"timestamp\":1772248560},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Unknown\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Unknown says: Let's follow for now... but if the voidwalker tries anything funny, we'll be ready.\",\"id\":\"s20_3392\",\"timestamp\":1772248575},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Midnight Mining has increased to 30.\",\"id\":\"s20_3393\",\"timestamp\":1772248582},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:237359::::::::88:1480::::1:38:13:::::|h[Refulgent Copper Ore |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx3\",\"id\":\"s20_3394\",\"timestamp\":1772248583},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3376:0|h[Shard of Dundun]|h|rx1\",\"id\":\"s20_3395\",\"timestamp\":1772248584},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sentient Voidwalker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Sentient Voidwalker says: With your strength, the visions become clearer...\",\"id\":\"s20_3396\",\"timestamp\":1772248593},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scout Faindel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Scout Faindel says: Our group was routed by a beast of the Voidstorm. It's closing in on us. Hurry!\",\"id\":\"s20_3397\",\"timestamp\":1772248597},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sentient Voidwalker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Sentient Voidwalker says: Another. Come.\",\"id\":\"s20_3398\",\"timestamp\":1772248603},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sentient Voidwalker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Sentient Voidwalker says: The power... flows through me!\",\"id\":\"s20_3399\",\"timestamp\":1772248621},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scout Faindel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Scout Faindel says: It's coming. By the Void, it's coming! Is there anyone out there?\",\"id\":\"s20_3400\",\"timestamp\":1772248625},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scout Nefina\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Scout Nefina says: I can hardly stand upright, but we still don't know WHERE Faindel is...\",\"id\":\"s20_3401\",\"timestamp\":1772248631},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:258138::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Potent Healing Potion]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s20_3402\",\"timestamp\":1772248637},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:258868::::::::88:1480:::1:13611:2:9:88:28:3322:::::|h[Brittle Legguards]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s20_3403\",\"timestamp\":1772248637},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scout Faindel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Scout Faindel says: We're on the plateau just southeast of Locus Point. Trust the voidwalker!\",\"id\":\"s20_3404\",\"timestamp\":1772248646},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sentient Voidwalker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Sentient Voidwalker says: Yes. Trust in me. We will meet on the plateau.\",\"id\":\"s20_3405\",\"timestamp\":1772248653},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scout Nefina\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Scout Nefina says: \\\"Trust the voidwalker?\\\" This is the most obvious trap that's ever been laid.\",\"id\":\"s20_3406\",\"timestamp\":1772248658},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s20_3407\",\"timestamp\":1772248662},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Frostyfries-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Frostyfries-Tichondrius:134:GUILD:|h[|cffc41e3aFrostyfries|r]|h: sweet|cnIQ4:|Hitem:257240::::::::84:251::11::1:28:872:::::|h[Relinquished Scarlet Charger]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s20_3408\",\"timestamp\":1772248664},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scout Nefina\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Scout Nefina says: Here, Starphage.\",\"id\":\"s20_3409\",\"timestamp\":1772248673},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scout Nefina\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Scout Nefina says: Void beings are known for their all-consuming hunger. Rare to see one so... manipulative.\",\"id\":\"s20_3410\",\"timestamp\":1772248676},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:266098::::::::88:1480::::1:28:3321:::::|h[Faindel's Longbow]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s20_3411\",\"timestamp\":1772248686},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Badonkadonk-Trollbane\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Badonkadonk-Trollbane:148:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeBadonkadonk|r]|h: we're all pallies now\",\"id\":\"s20_3412\",\"timestamp\":1772248709},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Midnight Mining has increased to 31.\",\"id\":\"s20_3413\",\"timestamp\":1772248715},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:237364::::::::88:1480::::1:38:13:::::|h[Brilliant Silver Ore |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx4\",\"id\":\"s20_3414\",\"timestamp\":1772248716},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Deceitful Voidwalker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Deceitful Voidwalker says: Your essence will fuel my ascension!\",\"id\":\"s20_3415\",\"timestamp\":1772248724},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Tmcáke-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Tmcáke-Tichondrius:154:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaTmcáke|r]|h: you wish\",\"id\":\"s20_3416\",\"timestamp\":1772248726},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Frostyfries-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Frostyfries-Tichondrius:155:GUILD:|h[|cffc41e3aFrostyfries|r]|h: lol\",\"id\":\"s20_3417\",\"timestamp\":1772248732},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Deceitful Voidwalker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Deceitful Voidwalker says: I... could have been... more...\",\"id\":\"s20_3418\",\"timestamp\":1772248749},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260659::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Stellar Vortex Residue]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s20_3419\",\"timestamp\":1772248751},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scout Nefina\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Scout Nefina says: We lost many to this wretched being... but I'm glad to see some of you safe.\",\"id\":\"s20_3420\",\"timestamp\":1772248754},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Missing Scout\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Missing Scout says: Faindel tried to distract it... to let us escape... but we were all so weak...\",\"id\":\"s20_3421\",\"timestamp\":1772248758},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"UNKNOWN\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_BN_WHISPER_INFORM\",\"type\":\"BN_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.9647059440612793,\"g\":1,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"To [???]: smileclap these nuts\",\"id\":\"s20_3422\",\"timestamp\":1772248764},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scout Nefina\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Scout Nefina says: I wish we'd gotten here sooner. Let's see the rest of you back to Locus Point.\",\"id\":\"s20_3423\",\"timestamp\":1772248764},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Jàhseh-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Jàhseh-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffJàhseh|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62191:Player-11-0E40E72E:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Call of the Light]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s20_3424\",\"timestamp\":1772248770},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Midnight Mining has increased to 32.\",\"id\":\"s20_3425\",\"timestamp\":1772248774},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:237364::::::::88:1480::::1:38:13:::::|h[Brilliant Silver Ore |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s20_3426\",\"timestamp\":1772248774},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s20_3427\",\"timestamp\":1772248782},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Tmpikaboo-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tmpikaboo-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Tmpikaboo|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62137:Player-11-0E82A933:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[I'm Not Trapped In Here With You]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s20_3428\",\"timestamp\":1772248785},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:264420::::::::88:1480::11:4:13573:13614:13616:6652:2:9:88:28:3321:::::|h[Voidcaster's Warglaive]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s20_3429\",\"timestamp\":1772248788},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Scout Nefina\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Scout Nefina says: That creature was gathering power... feeding on the essence of so many of us.\",\"id\":\"s20_3430\",\"timestamp\":1772248788},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"UNKNOWN\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_BN_WHISP