},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Veraan says: Focus the burning fire within. Tear the conduit apart!\",\"timestamp\":1772252507,\"id\":\"s20_3832\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kifaan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kifaan says: Veraan please! The knowledge of how to operate the conduit died with D'zaar. You don't need to do this!\",\"timestamp\":1772252510,\"id\":\"s20_3833\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kifaan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kifaan says: Your strength burns brightly. There are others who resist. Choose life and I will show you!\",\"timestamp\":1772252516,\"id\":\"s20_3834\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Veraan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Veraan says: Choose...\",\"timestamp\":1772252522,\"id\":\"s20_3835\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Veraan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Veraan says: Very well. Take us to those you say also resisted.\",\"timestamp\":1772252525,\"id\":\"s20_3836\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kifaan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kifaan says: Starphage! We will meet you back at the Howling Ridge.\",\"timestamp\":1772252529,\"id\":\"s20_3837\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1772252540,\"id\":\"s20_3838\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Juras the Nethersent\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Juras the Nethersent:950:MONSTER_SAY:|h[Juras the Nethersent]|h says: [Draenei] Kiel veni Alar toralar ul. Y rakkan melar! Za gular te.\",\"timestamp\":1772252557,\"id\":\"s20_3839\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Juras the Nethersent\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Juras gestures toward you. Tul'amar eyes you carefully as the other refugees murmur in awe.\",\"timestamp\":1772252561,\"id\":\"s20_3840\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Håvi-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Håvi-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaHåvi|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61212:Player-11-0E92A9E5:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Magisters' Terrace]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772252601,\"id\":\"s20_3841\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Fireysquirts-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Fireysquirts-Tichondrius|h[|cff3fc7ebFireysquirts|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61640:Player-11-0E013D50:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Nexus-Point Xenas]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772252616,\"id\":\"s20_3842\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264408::::::::88:1480::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:88:28:3321:::::|h[Void Resister's Leggings]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772252639,\"id\":\"s20_3843\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Veraan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Veraan says: Kifaan... memories of you... memories of home... they awakened us.\",\"timestamp\":1772252640,\"id\":\"s20_3844\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Veraan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Veraan says: But the darkness lurks in us, even now. We cannot stay.\",\"timestamp\":1772252646,\"id\":\"s20_3845\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"KulTiran\",\"name\":\"Lacarei-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Lacarei-Tichondrius|h[|cff0070ddLacarei|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61835:Player-11-0EB05C9E:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 2]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772252650,\"id\":\"s20_3846\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kifaan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kifaan says: Look around you. These void elves are an entire society that has learned to co-exist with the Void.\",\"timestamp\":1772252651,\"id\":\"s20_3847\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1772252656,\"id\":\"s20_3848\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kifaan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kifaan says: And if you were able to resist, then maybe there are others, too. More lost sisters... fathers...\",\"timestamp\":1772252656,\"id\":\"s20_3849\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Knight Anais\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Knight Anais says: By the Light... check the bodies. I'll search for Callum.\",\"timestamp\":1772252672,\"id\":\"s20_3850\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Knight Anais\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Knight Anais yells: Let him go, monster!\",\"timestamp\":1772252676,\"id\":\"s20_3851\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Imperia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Imperia says: Oh, is he yours? But I haven't had my fun yet.\",\"timestamp\":1772252681,\"id\":\"s20_3852\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Callum Ashvow\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Callum Ashvow says: Anais... please. Stay away.\",\"timestamp\":1772252685,\"id\":\"s20_3853\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Knight Anais\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Knight Anais says: After them! Ride!\",\"timestamp\":1772252688,\"id\":\"s20_3854\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"Your skill in Midnight Mining has increased to 37.\",\"timestamp\":1772252709,\"id\":\"s20_3855\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:237359::::::::88:1480::::1:38:13:::::|h[Refulgent Copper Ore |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1772252709,\"id\":\"s20_3856\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260637::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Rotting Insect Eggs]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772252727,\"id\":\"s20_3857\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},