95|h[Explore Voidstorm]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772254114,\"id\":\"s20_4005\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Callum Ashvow\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Callum Ashvow says: You... killed her...\",\"timestamp\":1772254116,\"id\":\"s20_4006\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Wroot-Zuluhed\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Wroot-Zuluhed|h[|cffff7c0aWroot-Zuluhed|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61640:Player-96-0BEC845D:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Nexus-Point Xenas]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772254119,\"id\":\"s20_4007\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Imperia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Imperia says: You wielded the blade. I wielded you.\",\"timestamp\":1772254119,\"id\":\"s20_4008\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Callum Ashvow\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Callum Ashvow says: Stop me... for Anais.\",\"timestamp\":1772254128,\"id\":\"s20_4009\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Imperia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Imperia says: Aw, he's broken.\",\"timestamp\":1772254147,\"id\":\"s20_4010\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Callum Ashvow\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Callum Ashvow says: Not yet... Your chains bind us both. End this!\",\"timestamp\":1772254150,\"id\":\"s20_4011\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Imperia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Imperia yells: It burns, it burns!\",\"timestamp\":1772254155,\"id\":\"s20_4012\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Callum Ashvow\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Callum Ashvow says: Thank you... Anais... I'll find you in the Light...\",\"timestamp\":1772254162,\"id\":\"s20_4013\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Durfnn-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Durfnn-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dDurfnn|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61520:Player-11-0E799EEA:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Explore Harandar]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772254162,\"id\":\"s20_4014\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Recloak-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Recloak-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Recloak|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62269:Player-11-0EB1F702:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Altar of Blessings: Amani Curious]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772254172,\"id\":\"s20_4015\"},{\"r