\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lanlae Noxa says: You there, demon hunter. Interested in a mystery?\",\"timestamp\":1772254202,\"id\":\"s20_4020\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lanlae Noxa\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lanlae Noxa says: Excellent. I will see you there.\",\"timestamp\":1772254208,\"id\":\"s20_4021\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"name\":\"Geöspäwn-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Geöspäwn-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaGeöspäwn|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61581:Player-11-0AEAEF4B:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Zul'Aman Glyph Hunter]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772254211,\"id\":\"s20_4022\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vidious\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vidious says: The hatred burning in the hearts of these Alliance renegades is simply delectable. Do you also fight for vengeance?\",\"timestamp\":1772254240,\"id\":\"s20_4023\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vidious\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vidious says: I request your aid, regardless. Head to the Grief Spire, elf. I will meet you there.\",\"timestamp\":1772254247,\"id\":\"s20_4024\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Soulzcuh-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Soulzcuh-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Soulzcuh|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:40460:Player-11-0E6EF73F:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Delve Deep]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772254312,\"id\":\"s20_4025\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vidious\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vidious says: To me, Starphage. My nemesis, Ziadan, has made an unexpected attack.\",\"timestamp\":1772254343,\"id\":\"s20_4026\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:260948::::::::89:1480::11::1:28:3321:::::|h[Enigmatic Voidclarion]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772254353,\"id\":\"s20_4027\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vidious\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vidious says: If a contest with the Horde is not what you seek, consider aiding me simply to keep Ziadan from expanding her conquest to Azeroth.\",\"timestamp\":1772254355,\"id\":\"s20_4028\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Pogg-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Pogg-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aPogg|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:40436:Player-11-0EA98F08:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[You're Getting a Delve!]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772254360,\"id\":\"s20_4029\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Pogg-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Pogg-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aPogg|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61832:Player-11-0EA98F08:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 1]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772254360,\"id\":\"s20_4030\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vidious\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vidious says: Fight well, elf. I shall seek to confront Ziadan directly. Join me when you have finished.\",\"timestamp\":1772254362,\"id\":\"s20_4031\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lanlae Noxa\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lanlae Noxa says: Starphage, I found someth--!\",\"timestamp\":1772254387,\"id\":\"s20_4032\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lanlae Noxa\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lanlae Noxa says: Ouch! That... really stings.\",\"timestamp\":1772254392,\"id\":\"s20_4033\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Durfnn-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.2509