"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260655::::::::89:1480:::::::::|h[Decaying Humanoid Flesh]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772255393,\"id\":\"s20_4150\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Durfnn-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Durfnn-Tichondrius:1544:GUILD:|h[|cffc69b6dDurfnn|r]|h: oh word insane\",\"timestamp\":1772255400,\"id\":\"s20_4151\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Wroot-Zuluhed\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Wroot-Zuluhed:1545:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aWroot|r]|h: you can do it before 90, i think u gotta be done with the campaign?\",\"timestamp\":1772255401,\"id\":\"s20_4152\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:258138::::::::89:1480:::::::::|h[Potent Healing Potion]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1772255446,\"id\":\"s20_4153\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx6\",\"timestamp\":1772255447,\"id\":\"s20_4154\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ziadan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ziadan says: You weakling, stooping to shadowgrafting your forces! You are no better than Xal'atath!\",\"timestamp\":1772255468,\"id\":\"s20_4155\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ziadan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ziadan says: So, we must again set aside our feud in order to defeat a common enemy.\",\"timestamp\":1772255470,\"id\":\"s20_4156\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vidious\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vidious says: Not the first time, and it won't be the last. I hear it is much the same with this Horde and Alliance.\",\"timestamp\":1772255474,\"id\":\"s20_4157\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vidious\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vidious says: What an irritating distraction. I was enjoying watching the Horde and Alliance do battle.\",\"timestamp\":1772255506,\"id\":\"s20_4158\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ziadan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ziadan says: Still favoring the twin blades, Vidious? I preferred to deflect the magic from your old staff.\",\"timestamp\":1772255512,\"id\":\"s20_4159\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ziadan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ziadan says: We shall return to our game soon enough. Until then, I shall just have to stomach fighting at your side.\",\"timestamp\":1772255517,\"id\":\"s20_4160\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vidious\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vidious says: Yes, you were far too skilled at that. Will you never put away that polearm? It's an eyesore.\",\"timestamp\":1772255518,\"id\":\"s20_4161\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Evohsx-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Evohsx-Stormrage|h[|cffff7c0aEvohsx-Stormrage|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62388:Player-60-0F286FF8:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Illicit Rain: Five Stars]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772255518,\"id\":\"s20_4162\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ziadan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ziadan says: It's effective.\",\"timestamp\":1772255523,\"id\":\"s20_4163\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Mezmir-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mezmir-Tichondrius|h[|cff0070ddMezmir|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61913:Player-11-0EA2A9CD:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[A Singular Problem]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772255559,\"id\":\"s20_4164\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\