6999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Frostyghost-Illidan|h[|cff3fc7ebFrostyghost-Illidan|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61856:Player-57-0DE6A71E:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Explore Zul'Aman]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772255589,\"id\":\"s20_4169\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260659::::::::89:1480:::::::::|h[Stellar Vortex Residue]|h|rx3\",\"timestamp\":1772255619,\"id\":\"s20_4170\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260662::::::::89:1480:::::::::|h[Polished Purple Pebble]|h|rx3\",\"timestamp\":1772255619,\"id\":\"s20_4171\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Håvi-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Håvi-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaHåvi|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:42328:Player-11-0E92A9E5:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[One Warband Mentor: Midnight]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772255667,\"id\":\"s20_4172\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ziadan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ziadan says: What a magnificent beast, ruined by shadowgrafting!\",\"timestamp\":1772255672,\"id\":\"s20_4173\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vidious\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vidious says: A miserable waste. The shadowgrafting must end. There must be a grafter nearby.\",\"timestamp\":1772255675,\"id\":\"s20_4174\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ziadan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ziadan says: Even our combined strength may not be enough to end this monster, Vidious.\",\"timestamp\":1772255678,\"id\":\"s20_4175\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vidious\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vidious says: It is good it is bound. Demon Hunter, find and slay the grafter while we weaken this beast. You will have the final blow.\",\"timestamp\":1772255683,\"id\":\"s20_4176\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Wroot-Zuluhed\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Wroot-Zuluhed:1629:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aWroot|r]|h: anyone know with prey how many times your prey will ambush you?\",\"timestamp\":1772255685,\"id\":\"s20_4177\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Claus-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Claus-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eeClaus|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:617