ONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Trelus the Grafter says: Another one of master's pets? Where's your graft?\",\"timestamp\":1772255725,\"id\":\"s20_4182\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Trelus the Grafter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Trelus the Grafter says: The master... will be... entertained...\",\"timestamp\":1772255748,\"id\":\"s20_4183\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Franksappä-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Franksappä-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Franksappä|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-11-0E5DFE8F:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772255749,\"id\":\"s20_4184\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260647::::::::89:1480:::::::::|h[Digested Human Hand]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772255750,\"id\":\"s20_4185\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::89:1480:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx5\",\"timestamp\":1772255750,\"id\":\"s20_4186\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260677::::::::89:1480:::::::::|h[Void Flakes]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772255750,\"id\":\"s20_4187\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260672::::::::89:1480:::::::::|h[Fetid Eye]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1772255750,\"id\":\"s20_4188\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:258934::::::::89:1480::133:2:13729:13578:2:9:89:28:3321:::::|h[Tarnished Dawnlit Sentinel's Girdle]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772255750,\"id\":\"s20_4189\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Charonus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Charonus says: Ah, you've finally arrived! Forgive my absence. Unlike some, I do Xal'atath's bidding when called.\",\"timestamp\":1772255761,\"id\":\"s20_4190\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ziadan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ziadan says: Charonus! Figures. You were always fond of shadowgrafting. We've put an end to your grafter.\",\"timestamp\":1772255767,\"id\":\"s20_4191\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Durfnn-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Durfnn-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dDurfnn|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61913:Player-11-0E799EEA:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[A Singular Problem]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772255768,\"id\":\"s20_4192\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Tmpikaboo-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Tmpikaboo-Tichondrius|h[|cfffff468Tmpikaboo|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61913:Player-11-0E82A933:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[A Singular Problem]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772255768,\"id\":\"s20_4193\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Charonus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Charonus says: Indeed--you've thoroughly trashed my arena! Delightful! I did not expect a mortal of such prowess. I have a proposition for you.\",\"timestamp\":1772255773,\"id\":\"s20_4194\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Charonus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Charonus says: This demon hunter has slain my grafter and decimated my home. Consider me impressed. I will leave you both to your squabble if this mortal rallies their allies and fights in my arena!\",\"timestamp\":1772255789,\"id\":\"s20_4195\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vidious\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vidious says: That does sounds like an enjoyable spectacle. You'll meet your demise in your own arena, Charonus.\",\"timestamp\":1772255798,\"id\":\"s20_4196\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ziadan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ziadan says: Afterward, we continue our endless war, Vidious--with renewed vigor.\",\"timestamp\":1772255804,\"id\":\"s20_4197\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Charonus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Charonus says: Then we have an arrangement. I will see you in the arena, demon hunter.\",\"timestamp\":1772255809,\"id\":\"s20_4198\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"Your skill in Midnight Mining has increased to 39.\",\"timestamp\":1772255816,\"id\":\"s20_4199\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:237362::::::::89:1480::::1:38:13:::::|h[Umbral Tin Ore |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx3\",\"timestamp\":1772255816,\"id\":\"s20_4200\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6