e\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Cindrid-Tichondrius|h[|cffa330c9Cindrid|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61835:Player-11-0E985DCC:1:3:2:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 2]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s21_4092\",\"timestamp\":1772503379},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Saltheril\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lord Saltheril says: Sin'dorei politics require a great deal of subtlety. An intricate dance that we were simply born to perform.\",\"id\":\"s21_4093\",\"timestamp\":1772503416},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Saltheril\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lord Saltheril says: Oh, and the invitation addressed to Murder Row is not a mistake. I'm ever a fan of dramatics.\",\"id\":\"s21_4094\",\"timestamp\":1772503425},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Willië-Barthilas\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Willië-Barthilas|h[|cfff48cbaWillië-Barthilas|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61506:Player-3723-0C52DAA7:1:3:2:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Allied Race: Haranir]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s21_4095\",\"timestamp\":1772503457},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ranger-Captain Dawnfletch\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ranger-Captain Dawnfletch says: This is for the war bonds party? Alright. I can spend some time rubbing elbows to get some noble gold in Farstrider coffers.\",\"id\":\"s21_4096\",\"timestamp\":1772503473},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magistrix Bloodflame\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magistrix Bloodflame says: My dear, I would have attended even without his invitation. He and I have played this game for the aristocracy many times now. I will get my things.\",\"id\":\"s21_4097\",\"timestamp\":1772503496},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Abidan-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Abidan-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eeAbidan|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61836:Player-11-0EAF38AC:1:3:2:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 3]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s21_4098\",\"timestamp\":1772503504},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Sanfu-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Sanfu-Tichondrius|h[|cffffffffSanfu|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:60891:Player-11-0EACB8D4:1:3:2:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Crimson Rogue]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s21_4099\",\"timestamp\":1772503509},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Knight-Lord Sunguard\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Knight-Lord Sunguard says: I despise this way of operating. But the Blood Knights will need resources for this war, so let us get on with it.\",\"id\":\"s21_4100\",\"timestamp\":1772503525},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Sellytonk-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Sellytonk-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aSellytonk|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:238:Player-11-0EA6215F:1:3:2:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[An Honorable Kill]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s21_4101\",\"timestamp\":1772503535},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vyrin the Supplier\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vyrin the Supplier says: Ha! Saltheril's inviting the Row to the party? Maybe my wares can soak up some of the gold. Count me in.\",\"id\":\"s21_4102\",\"timestamp\":1772503557},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Saltheril\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lord Saltheril says: Ah, sin'dorei politics at their finest are a sight to behold, are they not?\",\"id\":\"s21_4103\",\"timestamp\":1772503596},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Saltheril\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lord Saltheril says: Select any invitation you desire to sway the favor of the court. But be warned: sin'dorei do not take well to being snubbed.\",\"id\":\"s21_4104\",\"timestamp\":1772503603},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Snowshatter-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Snowshatter-Tichondrius:69:GUILD:|h[|cffc41e3aSnowshatter|r]|h: anyone and engineer and need |cnIQ3:|Hitem:257370::::::::90:251::::1:28:982:::::|h[Schematic: Thalassian Competitor's Leather Sliders]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s21_4105\",\"timestamp\":1772503803},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:251235::::::::90:1480::17:3:13441:13436:13578:2:9:90:28:3321:::::|h[Gravitic Girdle]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s21_4106\",\"timestamp\":1772503854},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vidious\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vidious says: How appropriate, that Charonus should be slain in his own arena. After capturing so many mortals from your world, he deserved your wrath.\",\"id\":\"s21_4107\",\"timestamp\":1772503854},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vidious\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vidious says: Now, Ziadan and I will return to our games. You have my gratitude and I hope to see you out on the battlefield, demon hunter.\",\"id\":\"s21_4108\",\"timestamp\":1772503861},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Däzedx-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Däzedx-Tichondrius|h[|cfff48cbaDäzedx|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:1258:Player-11-0E9C5FCD:1:3:2:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Take a Chill Pill]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s21_4109\",\"timestamp\":1772503963},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Aroland-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Aroland-Tichondrius|h[|cffff7c0aAroland|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:153:Player-11-0BC80AEE:1:3:2:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Old Gnome and the Sea]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s21_4110\",\"timestamp\":1772504040},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Cabelmonk-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Cabelmonk-Tichondrius|h[|cff00ff98Cabelmonk|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61638:Player-11-0DBFB890:1:3:2:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Den of Nalorakk]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s21_4111\",\"timestamp\":1772504120},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Picknsave-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Picknsave-Tichondrius|h[|cff00ff98Picknsave|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61922:Player-11-0E56026E:1:3:2:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Ninety Percent is Good Enough]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s21_4112\",\"times