ase. De girl can't help it.\",\"timestamp\":1772808413,\"id\":\"s23_4027\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:237359::::::::90:1480::::1:38:13:::::|h[Refulgent Copper Ore |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772808459,\"id\":\"s23_4028\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"Your skill in Midnight Mining has increased to 54.\",\"timestamp\":1772808470,\"id\":\"s23_4029\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:237362::::::::90:1480::::1:38:13:::::|h[Umbral Tin Ore |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx3\",\"timestamp\":1772808471,\"id\":\"s23_4030\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kel'vujo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kel'vujo says: Dey didn't say de trial would have dis many gnarldin...\",\"timestamp\":1772808478,\"id\":\"s23_4031\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kel'vujo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kel'vujo says: We'll be done with dis trial in no time once you get dem trophies.\",\"timestamp\":1772808481,\"id\":\"s23_4032\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Star