|cnIQ1:|Hitem:255258::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Grovecrawler Fang]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s24_2670\",\"timestamp\":1772819267},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260653::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Large Lightbloom Fungi]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s24_2671\",\"timestamp\":1772819267},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:255260::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Lasher Vine]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s24_2672\",\"timestamp\":1772819288},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260664::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Bioluminescent Flower Petals]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s24_2673\",\"timestamp\":1772819288},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s24_2674\",\"timestamp\":1772819288},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260662::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Polished Purple Pebble]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s24_2675\",\"timestamp\":1772819288},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Nøçht-Area52\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Nøçht-Area52:2745:GUILD:|h[|cfffff468Nøçht|r]|h: catch yas later, be back on tonight\",\"id\":\"s24_2676\",\"timestamp\":1772819296},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s24_2677\",\"timestamp\":1772819306},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Mezmir-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Mezmir-Tichondrius:2747:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddMezmir|r]|h: have a good friday!\",\"id\":\"s24_2678\",\"timestamp\":1772819307},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Al'yaat\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Al'yaat says: Akazi told me of your mentor, but I can't forge the weapon without them.\",\"id\":\"s24_2679\",\"timestamp\":1772819344},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Al'yaat\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Al'yaat says: We will start with Starphage adding the bone, and Ketan adding the fang.\",\"id\":\"s24_2680\",\"timestamp\":1772819347},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ketan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ketan says: Starphage is my mentor. Here they come.\",\"id\":\"s24_2681\",\"timestamp\":1772819348},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Al'yaat\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Al'yaat eyes you up and down, then nods in acceptance.\",\"id\":\"s24_2682\",\"timestamp\":1772819351},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Al'yaat\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Al'yaat says: Now add the sporebat's tail, while Ketan adds the lasher's vines to bind it all together.\",\"id\":\"s24_2683\",\"timestamp\":1772819353},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ketan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ketan says: It is a beautiful weapon, Al'yaat. Starphage, as my mentor it is up to you to bring the spear to Elder Akazi. I will meet you there.\",\"id\":\"s24_2684\",\"timestamp\":1772819361},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:257717::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Ka'dani Spear]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s24_2685\",\"timestamp\":1772819361},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Al'yaat\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Al'yaat says: A masterpiece Ka'dani weapon. Not even Akazi will deny it.\",\"id\":\"s24_2686\",\"timestamp\":1772819362},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Akazi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Akazi says: A fine weapon. A masterpiece indeed.\",\"id\":\"s24_2687\",\"timestamp\":1772819389},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Akazi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Akazi says: Ketan, a Ka'dani is never afraid of its prey. Your prey today is something to be scared of.\",\"id\":\"s24_2688\",\"timestamp\":1772819404},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Akazi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Akazi says: You will hunt down the great Radooni, and once the trial is over, you will be one of the Ka'dani.\",\"id\":\"s24_2689\",\"timestamp\":1772819410},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ketan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ketan says: I have heard the tales about Radooni. Regardless, I will take on the task with honor!\",\"id\":\"s24_2690\",\"timestamp\":1772819416},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Mezmir-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mezmir-Tichondrius|h[|cff0070ddMezmir|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41291:Player-11-0EA2A9CD:1:3:6:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Mythic: Windrunner Spire]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s24_2691\",\"timestamp\":1772819424},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ney'tar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ney'tar says: Please, make sure that my budlings are well protected.\",\"id\":\"s24_2692\",\"timestamp\":1772819448},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s24_2693\",\"timestamp\":1772819463},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"T'omm\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"An opportunistic grovecrawler is attacking T'omm!\",\"id\":\"s24_2694\",\"timestamp\":1772819471},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242640::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Plant Protein]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s24_2695\",\"timestamp\":1772819496},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":