tar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ney'tar says: Now that the budlings are gone, it is too quiet. I was thinking of adopting a grovecrawler.\",\"id\":\"s24_2707\",\"timestamp\":1772819619},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ney'tar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ney'tar sinks into deep thought.\",\"id\":\"s24_2708\",\"timestamp\":1772819625},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"ßigßrain-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:ßigßrain-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dßigßrain|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61387:Player-11-0E43E93E:1:3:6:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Prey: Normal Mode I]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s24_2709\",\"timestamp\":1772819630},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ketan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ketan says: It is time for me to prove that I can be a Ka'dani.\",\"id\":\"s24_2710\",\"timestamp\":1772819633},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Pedrayy-Illidan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Pedrayy-Illidan|h[|cfffff468Pedrayy-Illidan|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41961:Player-57-0D6693B5:1:3:6:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Heroic: Murder R