\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: It's guiding us down into the rift. We must follow.\",\"id\":\"s24_2921\",\"timestamp\":1772821334},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260662::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Polished Purple Pebble]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s24_2922\",\"timestamp\":1772821349},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260683::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Fine Magenta Sand]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s24_2923\",\"timestamp\":1772821349},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: It hurts like it's ripping a part of me away.\",\"id\":\"s24_2924\",\"timestamp\":1772821378},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260638::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Fine Void Residue]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s24_2925\",\"timestamp\":1772821390},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Northernmist-BlackwaterRaiders\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Northernmist-BlackwaterRaiders:3117:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaNorthernmist|r]|h: those Dungeons drop Decor which is nice from em bosses\",\"id\":\"s24_2926\",\"timestamp\":1772821405},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260638::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Fine Void Residue]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s24_2927\",\"timestamp\":1772821409},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260662::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Polished Purple Pebble]|h|rx3\",\"id\":\"s24_2928\",\"timestamp\":1772821409},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_RAID_BOSS_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_BOSS_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.8666667342185974,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Pull to collapse the tear.\",\"id\":\"s24_2929\",\"timestamp\":1772821416},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: We must be careful. There are things in here that will rip us apart.\",\"id\":\"s24_2930\",\"timestamp\":1772821416},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: We need to collapse these smaller tears in the rift before they grow bigger.\",\"id\":\"s24_2931\",\"timestamp\":1772821421},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: Ugh... I can feel the ritual site is near.\",\"id\":\"s24_2932\",\"timestamp\":1772821440},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: It's... I'm not sure. We think we have to go back the other way.\",\"id\":\"s24_2933\",\"timestamp\":1772821450},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Northernmist-BlackwaterRaiders\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Northernmist-BlackwaterRaiders:3125:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaNorthernmist|r]|h: cant wait for the Raids to open up  want thisCrown of the Cosmos\",\"id\":\"s24_2934\",\"timestamp\":1772821467},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_RAID_BOSS_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_BOSS_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.8666667342185974,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Pull to collapse the tear.\",\"id\":\"s24_2935\",\"timestamp\":1772821483},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260669::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Colorless Pebbles]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s24_2936\",\"timestamp\":1772821483},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Northernmist-BlackwaterRaiders\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Northernmist-BlackwaterRaiders:3128:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaNorthernmist|r]|h: voidspire\",\"id\":\"s24_2937\",\"timestamp\":1772821483},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Midnight Mining has increased to 64.\",\"id\":\"s24_2938\",\"timestamp\":1772821498},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:237364::::::::90:1480::::1:38:13:::::|h[Brilliant Silver Ore |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx5\",\"id\":\"s24_2939\",\"timestamp\":1772821499},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Siuknom\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"The Boon of Glory has been acquired by Siuknom! Primary Stats have been permanently increased for all!\",\"id\":\"s24_2940\",\"timestamp\":1772821516},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: The ritual site is right over there!\",\"id\":\"s24_2941\",\"timestamp\":1772821546},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amarakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Amarakk says: You've found the location for your ritual, En'liahn.\",\"id\":\"s24_2942\",\"timestamp\":1772821551},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: I'm ready to begin.\",\"id\":\"s24_2943\",\"timestamp\":1772821554},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amarakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Amarakk says: First, we place the wards. I can already sense the manifestations gathering.\",\"id\":\"s24_2944\",\"timestamp\":1772821555},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: I'm ready to begin the ritual when you are, Starphage.\",\"id\":\"s24_2945\",\"timestamp\":1772821563},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amarakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Amarakk says: Use the power of the wards to destroy the manifestations.\",\"id\":\"s24_2946\",\"timestamp\":1772821565},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amarakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Amarakk says: Hurry, Starphage. The manifestations are weakening En'liahn.\",\"id\":\"s24_2947\",\"timestamp\":1772821576},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: I can't hear her song anymore. She's gone.\",\"id\":\"s24_2948\",\"timestamp\":1772821587},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amarakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Amarakk says: It is said that Morta'ka is the shadow of the first of the Hara'ti to fall to the madness of the rift.\",\"id\":\"s24_2949\",\"timestamp\":1772821589},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: I know what's next. I must kill Morta'ka.\",\"id\":\"s24_2950\",\"timestamp\":1772821590},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amarakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Amarakk says: En'liahn, no. You're too weak!\",\"id\":\"s24_2951\",\"timestamp\":1772821593},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: Once I kill you, I'll be a Shul'ka.\",\"id\":\"s24_2952\",\"timestamp\":1772821601},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Morta'ka the Sundered Echo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Morta'ka the Sundered Echo says: Come. I will add your essence to mine.\",\"id\":\"s24_2953\",\"timestamp\":1772821604},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Siuknom\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"The Boon of Alacrity has been acquired by Siuknom! Movement Speed has been permanently increased for all!\",\"id\":\"s24_2954\",\"timestamp\":1772821624},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Morta'ka the Sundered Echo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Morta'ka the Sundered Echo says: When I return, little haranir, I will make you mine.\",\"id\":\"s24_2955\",\"timestamp\":1772821639},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: Starphage, over here.\",\"id\":\"s24_2956\",\"timestamp\":1772821643},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: It's done. I'll meet you outside.\",\"id\":\"s24_2957\",\"timestamp\":1772821643},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"En'liahn says: I'll see you up there, Starphage.\",\"id\":\"s24_2958\",\"timestamp\":1772821648},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"En'liahn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\