T_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Twilight's Blade be hidin' out at Speaker's Rest. Show them how a hash'ura protects Zul'Aman!\",\"timestamp\":1772852331,\"id\":\"s24_4332\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Starphage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1772852341,\"id\":\"s24_4333\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Bombadilo-Gilneas\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Bombadilo-Gilneas:2619:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Bombadilo|r]|h: judging by the 5 horde UH DKs in that bg, people are away it is OP\",\"timestamp\":1772852472,\"id\":\"s24_4334\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Dis must be de fire Lilaju spoke of.\",\"timestamp\":1772852496,\"id\":\"s24_4335\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Smileclap-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY_LEADER\",\"type\":\"PARTY_LEADER\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.4627451300621033,\"g\":0.7843137979507446,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party Leader]|h |Hplayer:Smileclap-Mal'Ganis:2621:PARTY:|h[|cffff7c0aSmileclap-Mal'Ganis|r]|h: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:264507::::::::90:105::42:1:12785:1:28:4240:::::|h[Crucible of Erratic Energies]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772852497,\"id\":\"s24_4336\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Sit and we will start de ritual--but be ready. Dis is de Loa of War. What ever he dreams of, we must complete de trial.\",\"timestamp\":1772852499,\"id\":\"s24_4337\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Do not worry about your friend, de would-be hash'ey. Nalorakk, de dreamer, de Loa of War, will test her strength.\",\"timestamp\":1772852509,\"id\":\"s24_4338\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: A hash'ey is only as strong as their warriors. So, you too will be tested in Nalorakk's dream.\",\"timestamp\":1772852521,\"id\":\"s24_4339\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Moistybolts-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Moistybolts-Tichondrius|h[|cff8788eeMoistybolts|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:42329:Player-11-0EA414FF:1:3:6:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Two Warband Mentors: Midnight]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772852523,\"id\":\"s24_4340\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.623529434