":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: What took you so long, eh? De loa will not fight me without you.\",\"timestamp\":1772853618,\"id\":\"s24_4430\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Hold. Before ya face de loa, ya must face an' kill... me.\",\"timestamp\":1772853622,\"id\":\"s24_4431\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nalorakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nalorakk says: Leadership requires sacrifice. Even of the things we cherish.\",\"timestamp\":1772853628,\"id\":\"s24_4432\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver says: I can see why you have summoned me, demon hunter.\",\"timestamp\":1772853647,\"id\":\"s24_4433\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Ilmindofbory-Illidan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Ilmindofbory-Illidan|h[|cff3fc7ebIlmindofbory-Illidan|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61684:Player-57-0DC53781:1:3:6:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Progressing in Battle]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772853654,\"id\":\"s24_4434\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Deli