ment |cffffff00|Hachievement:12573:Player-11-0E8F65DC:1:3:11:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Band of Brothers]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s26_4839\",\"timestamp\":1773275272},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: In de winter there were those like de Hoardmonger whose greed burdened others.\",\"id\":\"s26_4840\",\"timestamp\":1773275277},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: De Amani hash'ey used their most trusted warriors to eliminate them. For de good of de tribe.\",\"id\":\"s26_4841\",\"timestamp\":1773275284},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Well done. Like a living vine, some branches must be cut so de others may live. De tribe survives--for now.\",\"id\":\"s26_4842\",\"timestamp\":1773275391},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:251143::::::::90:268::23:4:12779:13439:6652:12701:1:28:3025:::::|h[Grim Harvest Gloves]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s26_4843\",\"timestamp\":1773275392},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 16 Gold, 56 Silver, 74 Copper\",\"id\":\"s26_